		'inviteUserToGroup', 'kickGroupMember', 'isJoinGroup', 'getSpecifiedGroupMembersInfo', 'getUsersInGroup',
		'searchGroupMembers', 'getJoinedGroupList', 'getJoinedGroupListPage', 'createGroup', 'setGroupInfo',
		'setGroupMemberInfo', 'joinGroup', 'searchGroups', 'quitGroup', 'dismissGroup', 'changeGroupMute',
		'changeGroupMemberMute', 'transferGroupOwner', 'getGroupApplicationListAsApplicant',
		'getGroupApplicationListAsRecipient', 'getGroupApplicationUnhandledCount', 'acceptGroupApplication',
		'refuseGroupApplication', 'findMessageList', 'updateFcmToken',
		'subscribeUsersStatus', 'unsubscribeUsersStatus', 'getUserStatus', 'getSubscribeUsersStatus',
		'createTextMessage', 'createImageMessageFromFullPath', 'createImageMessageByURL', 'createCustomMessage',
		'createQuoteMessage', 'createAdvancedQuoteMessage', 'createAdvancedTextMessage', 'createTextAtMessage',
		'createSoundMessageFromFullPath', 'createSoundMessageByURL', 'createVideoMessageFromFullPath',
		'createVideoMessageByURL', 'createFileMessageFromFullPath', 'createFileMessageByURL', 'createMergerMessage',
		'createForwardMessage', 'createFaceMessage', 'createLocationMessage', 'createCardMessage',
		'sendMessage', 'sendMessageNotOss', 'uploadFile', 'uploadLogs'
	]

	function readAutomationString(value : UTSJSONObject, key : string) : string {
		const raw = value[key]
		if (raw != null) {
			return raw as string
		}
		return ''
	}

	function readAutomationNumber(value : UTSJSONObject, key : string) : number {
		const raw = value[key]
		if (raw != null) {
			return raw as number
		}
		return 0
	}

	function readAutomationBoolean(value : UTSJSONObject, key : string) : boolean {
		const raw = value[key]
		if (raw != null) { return raw as boolean }
		return false
	}

	function selectAutomationPlatformTokens(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : OpenIMAutomationConfig {
		let primaryToken = config.primaryToken
		let secondaryToken = config.secondaryToken
		// #ifdef APP-IOS
		if (config.primaryIOSToken.length > 0) { primaryToken = config.primaryIOSToken }
		if (config.secondaryIOSToken.length > 0) { secondaryToken = config.secondaryIOSToken }
		// #endif
		// #ifdef APP-ANDROID
		if (config.primaryAndroidToken.length > 0) { primaryToken = config.primaryAndroidToken }
		if (config.secondaryAndroidToken.length > 0) { secondaryToken = config.secondaryAndroidToken }
		// #endif
		config.primaryToken = primaryToken
		config.secondaryToken = secondaryToken
		return config
	}

	function normalizeAutomationConfig(value : UTSJSONObject) : OpenIMAutomationConfig {
		const config : OpenIMAutomationConfig = {
			autorun: readAutomationString(value, 'autorun'),
			suiteFilter: readAutomationString(value, 'suiteFilter'),
			apiAddr: readAutomationString(value, 'apiAddr'),
			wsAddr: readAutomationString(value, 'wsAddr'),
			platformID: readAutomationNumber(value, 'platformID'),
			primaryUserID: readAutomationString(value, 'primaryUserID'),
			primaryToken: readAutomationString(value, 'primaryToken'),
			primaryIOSToken: readAutomationString(value, 'primaryIOSToken'),
			primaryAndroidToken: readAutomationString(value, 'primaryAndroidToken'),
			secondaryUserID: readAutomationString(value, 'secondaryUserID'),
			secondaryToken: readAutomationString(value, 'secondaryToken'),
			secondaryIOSToken: readAutomationString(value, 'secondaryIOSToken'),
			secondaryAndroidToken: readAutomationString(value, 'secondaryAndroidToken'),
			peerBridgeEnabled: readAutomationBoolean(value, 'peerBridgeEnabled'),
			peerBridgeRunNonce: readAutomationString(value, 'peerBridgeRunNonce')
		}
		return selectAutomationPlatformTokens(config)
	}

	function parseAutomationConfigText(text : string) : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null {
		try {
			const parsed = JSON.parseObject<UTSJSONObject>(text)
			if (parsed != null) {
				return normalizeAutomationConfig(parsed)
			}
		} catch (error) {
			return null
		}
		return null
	}

	function readAutomationJSONFile(filePath : string) : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null {
		try {
			const contentValue = uni.getFileSystemManager().readFileSync(filePath, 'utf-8')
			const content = contentValue as string
			if (content.length == 0) {
				return null
			}
			return parseAutomationConfigText(content)
		} catch (error) {
			return null
		}
	}

	function readStaticAutomationConfig() : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null {
		const userDataPath = uni.env.USER_DATA_PATH
		const paths : Array<string> = [
			'static/openim-test-config.json',
			'/static/openim-test-config.json',
			'uni-app-x/apps/__UNI__B3F7C44/www/static/openim-test-config.json',
			'/uni-app-x/apps/__UNI__B3F7C44/www/static/openim-test-config.json'
		]
		if (userDataPath.length > 0) {
			paths.push(userDataPath + '/www/static/openim-test-config.json')
			paths.push(userDataPath + '/static/openim-test-config.json')
		}
		let index = 0
		while (index < paths.length) {
			const config = readAutomationJSONFile(paths[index])
			if (config != null) {
				return config
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function isAutomationConfigReady(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null) : boolean {
		if (config == null) { return false }
		return (config as OpenIMAutomationConfig).apiAddr.length > 0 &&
			(config as OpenIMAutomationConfig).wsAddr.length > 0 &&
			(config as OpenIMAutomationConfig).primaryUserID.length > 0 &&
			(config as OpenIMAutomationConfig).primaryToken.length > 0 &&
			(config as OpenIMAutomationConfig).secondaryUserID.length > 0 &&
			(config as OpenIMAutomationConfig).secondaryToken.length > 0
	}

	function applyConfiguredAutomationSuiteFilter(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null) {
		if (automationQuerySuiteFilter.length > 0) {
			automationSuiteFilter = automationQuerySuiteFilter
			return
		}
		automationSuiteFilter = config == null ? '' : config.suiteFilter.trim()
	}

	function readAutomationConfig() : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null {
		const raw = uni.getStorageSync('openim-test-config')
		if (raw instanceof UTSJSONObject) {
			const storageConfig = normalizeAutomationConfig(raw)
			if (isAutomationConfigReady(storageConfig)) {
				return storageConfig
			}
		}
		if (raw != null) {
			const text = JSON.stringify(raw)
			if (text != null) {
				const parsed = parseAutomationConfigText(text as string)
				if (isAutomationConfigReady(parsed)) { return parsed }
			}
		}
		return readStaticAutomationConfig()
	}

	function buildAutomationInitConfig(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : OpenIMInitConfig {
		let platformID = OpenIMPlatformIOS
		let systemType = 'unix-ios'
		// #ifdef APP-ANDROID
		platformID = OpenIMPlatformAndroid
		systemType = 'unix-android'
		// #endif
		const initConfig : OpenIMInitConfig = {
			platformID: platformID,
			apiAddr: config.apiAddr,
			wsAddr: config.wsAddr,
			dataDir: null,
			logFilePath: null,
			logLevel: OpenIMLogLevelVerbose,
			isLogStandardOutput: true,
			systemType: systemType
		}
		return initConfig
	}

	function buildAutomationInitConfigWithWS(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig, wsAddr : string) : OpenIMInitConfig {
		const initConfig = buildAutomationInitConfig(config)
		initConfig.wsAddr = wsAddr
		return initConfig
	}

	function buildAutomationUnavailableWSAddr(wsAddr : string) : string {
		const schemeSeparator = wsAddr.indexOf('://')
		const portSeparator = wsAddr.lastIndexOf(':')
		if (schemeSeparator < 0 || portSeparator <= schemeSeparator + 2) { throw new Error('connection failure probe requires an explicit WS port') }
		return wsAddr.substring(0, portSeparator + 1) + '1'
	}

	function resetAutomationCache() {
		automationSuiteFilter = ''
		cachedConversation = null
		cachedGroupID = ''
		cachedGroup = null
		cachedGroupMember = null
		cachedFriend = null
		cachedFriendApplication = null
		cachedGroupApplication = null
		cachedQuoteSourceMessage = null
		cachedCreatedMessage = null
		cachedSentMessage = null
		cachedClientMsgID = ''
		automationLoggedIn = false
		automationActiveUserID = ''
		automationExpectedSecondaryUserID = ''
		automationConversationID = ''
		automationFixedImageFullPath = ''
		automationFixedSoundFullPath = ''
		automationFixedVideoFullPath = ''
		automationFixedVideoSnapshotFullPath = ''
		automationFixedFileFullPath = ''
		automationAssetDirFullPath = ''
		automationAssetDirFileSystemPath = ''
		automationRunLogFilePath = ''
		automationRunJSONFilePath = ''
		automationRunLogWriteError = ''
		automationUploadFileProgressExpected = false
		automationUploadLogsProgressExpected = false
		automationSendMessageProgressExpected = false
		automationStepResults = []
		automationCoveredAPINames = []
		automationValidatedAPINames = []
		automationEventRecords = []
		automationEventOccurrences = []
		automationOperationWindows = []
		automationEvidenceSequenceCounter = 0
		automationLifecycleEpochCounter = 0
		automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = 0
		automationPeerBridgeEnabled = false
		automationPeerBridgeRunNonce = ''
		automationPeerBridgeRequestText = ''
		automationPeerBridgeResponseText = ''
		automationPeerBridgeRequestCounter = 0
		updateCacheText()
	}

	function automationClip(value : string) : string {
		if (value.length > 1000) {
			return value.substring(0, 1000)
		}
		return value
	}

	function automationStringArrayContains(items : Array<string>, value : string) : boolean {
		let index = 0
		while (index < items.length) {
			if (items[index] == value) {
				return true
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return false
	}

	function markAutomationAPICovered(name : string) {
		if (automationStringArrayContains(automationPublicAPINames, name) && !automationStringArrayContains(automationCoveredAPINames, name)) {
			automationCoveredAPINames.push(name)
		}
	}

	function markAutomationAPIValidated(name : string) {
		if (automationStringArrayContains(automationPublicAPINames, name) && !automationStringArrayContains(automationValidatedAPINames, name)) {
			automationValidatedAPINames.push(name)
		}
	}

	function truncateAutomationEventPayload(value : string) : string {
		if (value.length > 600) {
			return value.substring(0, 600)
		}
		return value
	}

	function findAutomationEventRecord(eventName : string) : OpenIMAutomationEventRecord | null {
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationEventRecords.length) {
			if (automationEventRecords[index].name == eventName) {
				return automationEventRecords[index]
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function readAutomationEventSequence() : number {
		return automationEvidenceSequenceCounter
	}

	function findAutomationEventOccurrence(eventName : string, epoch : number, afterSequence : number) : OpenIMAutomationEventOccurrence | null {
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationEventOccurrences.length) {
			const occurrence = automationEventOccurrences[index]
			if (occurrence.eventName == eventName && (epoch <= 0 || occurrence.epoch == epoch) && occurrence.sequence > afterSequence) {
				return occurrence
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function beginAutomationOperation(apiName : string, payloadNeedle : string | null = null, exclusiveOperation : boolean | null = null) {
		automationEvidenceSequenceCounter = automationEvidenceSequenceCounter + 1
		let exclusive = exclusiveOperation == true
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationOperationWindows.length) {
			const existing = automationOperationWindows[index]
			if (existing.operationApiName == apiName && existing.terminalSequence == 0) { exclusive = false }
			index = index + 1
		}
		const window : OpenIMAutomationOperationWindow = {
			operationApiName: apiName,
			operationSequence: readAutomationEventSequence(),
			operationEpoch: automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch,
			payloadNeedle: payloadNeedle == null ? '' : payloadNeedle as string,
			resultIdentity: '',
			terminalSequence: 0,
			exclusiveOperation: exclusive
		}
		automationOperationWindows.push(window)
	}

	function findLatestAutomationOperation(apiName : string) : OpenIMAutomationOperationWindow | null {
		let index = automationOperationWindows.length - 1
		while (index >= 0) {
			const window = automationOperationWindows[index]
			if (window.operationApiName == apiName) { return window }
			index = index - 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function findAutomationLoginLifecycleWindow(expectedEvents : Array<string>) : OpenIMAutomationOperationWindow | null {
		let windowIndex = automationOperationWindows.length - 1
		while (windowIndex >= 0) {
			const window = automationOperationWindows[windowIndex]
			if (window.operationApiName == 'login') {
				let afterSequence = window.operationSequence
				let eventIndex = 0
				while (eventIndex < expectedEvents.length) {
					const occurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrence(expectedEvents[eventIndex], window.operationEpoch, afterSequence)
					if (occurrence == null) { break }
					afterSequence = occurrence.sequence
					eventIndex = eventIndex + 1
				}
				if (eventIndex == expectedEvents.length) { return window }
			}
			windowIndex = windowIndex - 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function completeAutomationOperation(apiName : string, resultIdentity : string | null = null) {
		const window = findLatestAutomationOperation(apiName)
		if (window == null || window.terminalSequence > 0) { return }
		automationEvidenceSequenceCounter = automationEvidenceSequenceCounter + 1
		window.resultIdentity = resultIdentity == null ? '' : resultIdentity as string
		window.terminalSequence = automationEvidenceSequenceCounter
	}

	function markAutomationEventEvidence(eventName : string, semanticValidated : boolean, orderingValidated : boolean, epochValidated : boolean) {
		const record = findAutomationEventRecord(eventName)
		if (record == null) { return }
		record.semanticValidated = record.semanticValidated || semanticValidated
		record.orderingValidated = record.orderingValidated || orderingValidated
		record.epochValidated = record.epochValidated || epochValidated
	}

	function readAutomationEventPayloadIdentity(eventName : string, payloadText : string) : string {
		try {
			if (eventName == 'onRecvC2CReadReceipt') {
				const rawReceipts = JSON.parseArray<UTSJSONObject>(payloadText)
				if (rawReceipts != null && rawReceipts.length > 0) {
					const userID = rawReceipts[0]['userID']
					const rawMessageIDs = rawReceipts[0]['msgIDList']
					if (userID != null && rawMessageIDs != null) {
						const messageIDs = rawMessageIDs as Array<string>
						if (messageIDs.length > 0) { return (userID as string) + ':' + messageIDs[0] }
					}
				}
			}
			const parsed = JSON.parseObject<UTSJSONObject>(payloadText)
			if (parsed == null) { return '' }
			if (eventName == 'onSendMessageProgress') {
				const clientMsgID = parsed['clientMsgID']
				return clientMsgID == null ? '' : clientMsgID as string
			}
			if (eventName == 'onRecvNewMessage') {
				const clientMsgID = parsed['clientMsgID']
				return clientMsgID == null ? '' : clientMsgID as string
			}
			if (eventName == 'onMsgDeleted' || eventName == 'onNewRecvMessageRevoked') {
				const clientMsgID = parsed['clientMsgID']
				return clientMsgID == null ? '' : clientMsgID as string
			}
			if (eventName == 'onConversationChanged' || eventName == 'onNewConversation') {
				const rawConversations = parsed['conversations']
				if (rawConversations != null) {
					const conversations = rawConversations as Array<UTSJSONObject>
					if (conversations.length > 0) {
						const conversationID = conversations[0]['conversationID']
						const groupID = conversations[0]['groupID']
						const userID = conversations[0]['userID']
						if (eventName == 'onNewConversation' && groupID != null && (groupID as string).length > 0) { return groupID as string }
						if (conversationID != null) { return conversationID as string }
						return userID == null ? '' : userID as string
					}
				}
			}
			if (eventName == 'onFriendApplicationAdded' || eventName == 'onFriendApplicationRejected' || eventName == 'onFriendApplicationAccepted') {
				const fromUserID = parsed['fromUserID']
				return fromUserID == null ? '' : fromUserID as string
			}
			if (eventName == 'onFriendAdded' || eventName == 'onBlackAdded' || eventName == 'onFriendDeleted' || eventName == 'onFriendInfoChanged' || eventName == 'onBlackDeleted' || eventName == 'onSelfInfoUpdated') {
				const userID = parsed['userID']
				return userID == null ? '' : userID as string
			}
			if (eventName == 'onGroupMemberAdded' || eventName == 'onGroupMemberDeleted' || eventName == 'onGroupMemberInfoChanged') {
				const groupID = parsed['groupID']
				const userID = parsed['userID']
				if (groupID == null || userID == null) { return '' }
				return (groupID as string) + ':' + (userID as string)
			}
			if (eventName == 'onJoinedGroupAdded' || eventName == 'onJoinedGroupDeleted' || eventName == 'onGroupApplicationAdded' || eventName == 'onGroupApplicationRejected' || eventName == 'onGroupApplicationAccepted' || eventName == 'onGroupDismissed' || eventName == 'onGroupInfoChanged') {
				const groupID = parsed['groupID']
				return groupID == null ? '' : groupID as string
			}
		} catch (error) {
			return ''
		}
		return ''
	}

	function findAutomationEventOccurrenceByPayloadIdentity(eventName : string, epoch : number, afterSequence : number, payloadIdentity : string) : OpenIMAutomationEventOccurrence | null {
		if (payloadIdentity.length == 0) { return null }
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationEventOccurrences.length) {
			const occurrence = automationEventOccurrences[index]
			if (occurrence.eventName == eventName && (epoch <= 0 || occurrence.epoch == epoch) && occurrence.sequence > afterSequence && readAutomationEventPayloadIdentity(eventName, occurrence.payloadText) == payloadIdentity) {
				return occurrence
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function findAutomationEventOccurrenceByMessageIdentityAfter(eventName : string, afterSequence : number, clientMsgID : string) : OpenIMAutomationEventOccurrence | null {
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationEventOccurrences.length) {
			const occurrence = automationEventOccurrences[index]
			if (occurrence.eventName == eventName && occurrence.sequence > afterSequence) {
				if (eventName == 'onRecvNewMessage' || eventName == 'onRecvOfflineNewMessage') {
					if (readAutomationEventPayloadIdentity('onRecvNewMessage', occurrence.payloadText) == clientMsgID) { return occurrence }
				} else {
					try {
						const result = JSON.parseObject<OpenIMMessageListResult>(occurrence.payloadText)
						if (result != null) {
							let messageIndex = 0
							while (messageIndex < result.messages.length) {
								if (result.messages[messageIndex].clientMsgID == clientMsgID) { return occurrence }
								messageIndex = messageIndex + 1
							}
						}
					} catch (_error) {
					}
				}
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function buildAutomationEventCorrelations(apiName : string, expectedEvents : Array<string>) : Array<OpenIMAutomationEventCorrelation> {
		const correlations : Array<OpenIMAutomationEventCorrelation> = []
		const window = apiName == 'login' ? findAutomationLoginLifecycleWindow(expectedEvents) : findLatestAutomationOperation(apiName)
		if (window == null || window.operationEpoch <= 0) { return correlations }
		let afterSequence = window.operationSequence
		let index = 0
		while (index < expectedEvents.length) {
			const eventName = expectedEvents[index]
			const occurrenceEpoch = eventName == 'onRecvNewMessage' ? 0 : window.operationEpoch
			let occurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrence(eventName, occurrenceEpoch, afterSequence)
			if (occurrence == null) { return correlations }
			let correlationKind = 'lifecycle-order'
			let payloadIdentity = ''
			let payloadMatched = true
			if (apiName == 'sendMessage' || apiName == 'sendMessageNotOss') {
				correlationKind = eventName == 'onRecvNewMessage' ? 'cross-account-payload-identity' : 'operation-payload-identity'
				payloadIdentity = eventName == 'onRecvNewMessage' ? window.resultIdentity : window.payloadNeedle
				payloadMatched = payloadIdentity.length > 0 && readAutomationEventPayloadIdentity(eventName, occurrence.payloadText) == payloadIdentity
			} else if (apiName == 'addFriend' || apiName == 'acceptFriendApplication' || apiName == 'refuseFriendApplication' || apiName == 'createGroup' || apiName == 'joinGroup' || apiName == 'acceptGroupApplication' || apiName == 'refuseGroupApplication' || apiName == 'kickGroupMember' || apiName == 'inviteUserToGroup' || apiName == 'quitGroup' || apiName == 'dismissGroup' || apiName == 'markConversationMessageAsRead') {
				correlationKind = 'cross-account-payload-identity'
				payloadIdentity = ((apiName == 'acceptFriendApplication' && (eventName == 'onFriendAdded' || eventName == 'onFriendApplicationAccepted')) || (apiName == 'acceptGroupApplication' && eventName == 'onGroupApplicationAccepted')) ? window.payloadNeedle : window.resultIdentity
				payloadMatched = payloadIdentity.length > 0 && readAutomationEventPayloadIdentity(eventName, occurrence.payloadText) == payloadIdentity
			} else if (apiName == 'setConversation' || apiName == 'revokeMessage' || apiName == 'deleteMessage' || apiName == 'updateFriends' || apiName == 'deleteFriend' || apiName == 'removeBlack' || apiName == 'setGroupInfo' || apiName == 'setGroupMemberInfo' || apiName == 'setSelfInfo') {
				correlationKind = 'operation-payload-identity'
				payloadIdentity = window.resultIdentity
				payloadMatched = payloadIdentity.length > 0 && readAutomationEventPayloadIdentity(eventName, occurrence.payloadText) == payloadIdentity
			} else if (apiName == 'uploadFile' || apiName == 'uploadLogs') {
				correlationKind = 'exclusive-operation-window'
				payloadMatched = window.exclusiveOperation && window.terminalSequence > occurrence.sequence
			}
			if (payloadMatched == false && payloadIdentity.length > 0 && (correlationKind == 'operation-payload-identity' || correlationKind == 'cross-account-payload-identity')) {
				const exactOccurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrenceByPayloadIdentity(eventName, occurrenceEpoch, afterSequence, payloadIdentity)
				if (exactOccurrence != null) {
					occurrence = exactOccurrence
					payloadMatched = true
				}
			}
			const correlation : OpenIMAutomationEventCorrelation = {
				operationApiName: apiName,
				eventName: eventName,
				operationSequence: window.operationSequence,
				eventSequence: occurrence.sequence,
				operationEpoch: window.operationEpoch,
				eventEpoch: occurrence.epoch,
				payloadMatched: payloadMatched,
				correlationKind: correlationKind,
				operationTerminalSequence: window.terminalSequence,
				exclusiveOperation: window.exclusiveOperation,
				payloadIdentity: payloadIdentity,
				eventPayloadDetail: occurrence.payloadText
			}
			correlations.push(correlation)
			const matched = correlation.payloadMatched
			markAutomationEventEvidence(eventName, matched, true, eventName == 'onRecvNewMessage' || occurrence.epoch == window.operationEpoch)
			afterSequence = occurrence.sequence
			index = index + 1
		}
		return correlations
	}

	function recordSDKEventDelivery(eventName : string, payloadText : string, payloadEncoding : string = 'uts-typed-json-v1') {
		if (!automationRunning) {
			return
		}
		automationEvidenceSequenceCounter = automationEvidenceSequenceCounter + 1
		const occurrence : OpenIMAutomationEventOccurrence = { eventName: eventName, payloadText: payloadText, sequence: automationEvidenceSequenceCounter, epoch: automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch }
		automationEventOccurrences.push(occurrence)
		let record = findAutomationEventRecord(eventName)
		if (record == null) {
			const item : OpenIMAutomationEventRecord = {
				name: eventName,
				eventName: eventName,
				count: 0,
				lastPayload: '',
				payloadEvidence: false,
				payloadEncoding: '',
				payloadDetail: '',
				payloadDetails: [],
				payloadEncodings: [],
				deliveryValidated: false,
				structureValidated: false,
				semanticValidated: false,
				orderingValidated: false,
				epochValidated: false,
				cleanupValidated: false,
				cleanupAction: ''
			}
			automationEventRecords.push(item)
			record = item
		}
		if (record != null) {
			record.count = record.count + 1
			record.lastPayload = truncateAutomationEventPayload(payloadText)
			record.payloadEvidence = true
			record.payloadEncoding = payloadEncoding
			record.payloadDetail = payloadText
			record.payloadDetails.push(payloadText)
			record.payloadEncodings.push(payloadEncoding)
			record.deliveryValidated = true
			// Reaching the typed callback proves the façade/event decoder accepted the wire shape.
			record.structureValidated = true
		}
	}

	function readAutomationEventCount(eventName : string) : number {
		const record = findAutomationEventRecord(eventName)
		if (record == null) {
			return 0
		}
		return record.count
	}

	// SDK event subscriptions
	let sdkEventSubscriptions : Array<OpenIMSDKEventSubscription> = []
	let sdkRegisteredEventNames : Array<string> = []
	let sdkEventSubscriptionNames : Array<string> = []

	function updateStatusForSDKEventName(eventName : string) {
		if (eventName == 'onConnecting') {
			statusText.value = 'Connecting'
		} else if (eventName == 'onConnectSuccess') {
			statusText.value = 'Connected'
		} else if (eventName == 'onConnectFailed') {
			statusText.value = 'Connect failed'
		} else if (eventName == 'onKickedOffline') {
			statusText.value = 'Kicked offline'
		} else if (eventName == 'onUserTokenExpired') {
			statusText.value = 'Token expired'
		} else if (eventName == 'onUserTokenInvalid') {
			statusText.value = 'Token invalid'
		} else if (eventName == 'onSyncServerStart') {
			statusText.value = 'Syncing conversations'
		} else if (eventName == 'onSyncServerFinish') {
			statusText.value = 'Sync finished'
		} else if (eventName == 'onSyncServerFailed') {
			statusText.value = 'Sync failed'
		}
	}

	function showSDKEvent(eventName : string, value : any | null) {
		updateStatusForSDKEventName(eventName)
		const jsonText = stringifyAutomationEventValue(eventName, value)
		const payloadEncoding = eventName == 'onRecvNewMessage' || eventName == 'onRecvOfflineNewMessage' || eventName == 'onRecvOnlineOnlyMessage' || eventName == 'onMsgDeleted' || eventName == 'onRecvNewMessages' || eventName == 'onRecvOfflineNewMessages' || eventName == 'onConversationChanged' || eventName == 'onNewConversation' ? 'openim-explicit-json-v1' : 'uts-typed-json-v1'
		recordSDKEventDelivery(eventName, jsonText, payloadEncoding)
		console.log('sdk event name', eventName)
		console.log('sdk event typed payload', value)
		console.log('sdk event json payload', jsonText)
		if (automationEventSuppressed) {
			return
		}
		setResult('event: ' + eventName + '\n\ntyped payload:\n' + jsonText + '\n\njson string:\n' + jsonText)
	}

	function showSDKErrorEvent(eventName : string, errCode : number, errMsg : string) {
		updateStatusForSDKEventName(eventName)
		const encodedErrMsg = JSON.stringify(errMsg)
		recordSDKEventDelivery(eventName, '[' + errCode.toString() + ',' + (encodedErrMsg == null ? '""' : encodedErrMsg as string) + ']')
		console.log('sdk event error', eventName, errCode, errMsg)
		if (automationEventSuppressed) {
			return
		}
		setResult('event: ' + eventName + '\nerrCode: ' + errCode.toString() + '\nerrMsg: ' + errMsg)
	}

	function addSDKEventSubscription(eventName : string, subscription : OpenIMSDKEventSubscription) {
		if (!automationStringArrayContains(sdkRegisteredEventNames, eventName)) {
			sdkRegisteredEventNames.push(eventName)
		}
		if (subscription.id.length > 0 && subscription.eventName == eventName) {
			sdkEventSubscriptions.push(subscription)
			if (!automationStringArrayContains(sdkEventSubscriptionNames, eventName)) {
				sdkEventSubscriptionNames.push(eventName)
			}
		} else {
			console.log('sdk event subscription returned an invalid handle ' + eventName)
		}
	}

	function unregisterSDKEvents() {
		let subscriptionIndex : number = 0
		while (subscriptionIndex < sdkEventSubscriptions.length) {
			const subscription = sdkEventSubscriptions[subscriptionIndex]
			if (subscription != null) { off(subscription) }
			subscriptionIndex = subscriptionIndex + 1
		}
		sdkEventSubscriptions = []
		sdkRegisteredEventNames = []
		sdkEventSubscriptionNames = []
	}

	function registerSDKEvents() {
		unregisterSDKEvents()
		addSDKEventSubscription('onConnecting', onConnecting(() => { showSDKEvent('onConnecting', null) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onConnectSuccess', onConnectSuccess(() => { showSDKEvent('onConnectSuccess', null) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onConnectFailed', onConnectFailed((errCode : number, errMsg : string) => { showSDKErrorEvent('onConnectFailed', errCode, errMsg) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onKickedOffline', onKickedOffline(() => { showSDKEvent('onKickedOffline', null) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onUserTokenExpired', onUserTokenExpired(() => { showSDKEvent('onUserTokenExpired', null) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onUserTokenInvalid', onUserTokenInvalid((errCode : number, errMsg : string) => { showSDKErrorEvent('onUserTokenInvalid', errCode, errMsg) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onRecvNewMessage', onRecvNewMessage((message : OpenIMMessageItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onRecvNewMessage', message) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onRecvOfflineNewMessage', onRecvOfflineNewMessage((message : OpenIMMessageItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onRecvOfflineNewMessage', message) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onRecvOnlineOnlyMessage', onRecvOnlineOnlyMessage((message : OpenIMMessageItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onRecvOnlineOnlyMessage', message) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onMsgDeleted', onMsgDeleted((message : OpenIMMessageItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onMsgDeleted', message) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onNewRecvMessageRevoked', onNewRecvMessageRevoked((revoked : OpenIMMessageRevokedItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onNewRecvMessageRevoked', revoked) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onRecvC2CReadReceipt', onRecvC2CReadReceipt((result : OpenIMMessageReceiptListResult | null) => { showSDKEvent('onRecvC2CReadReceipt', result) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onRecvNewMessages', onRecvNewMessages((result : OpenIMMessageListResult | null) => { showSDKEvent('onRecvNewMessages', result) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onRecvOfflineNewMessages', onRecvOfflineNewMessages((result : OpenIMMessageListResult | null) => { showSDKEvent('onRecvOfflineNewMessages', result) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onConversationChanged', onConversationChanged((result : OpenIMConversationListResult | null) => { showSDKEvent('onConversationChanged', result) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onConversationUserInputStatusChanged', onConversationUserInputStatusChanged((status : OpenIMConversationInputStatusItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onConversationUserInputStatusChanged', status) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onNewConversation', onNewConversation((result : OpenIMConversationListResult | null) => { showSDKEvent('onNewConversation', result) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onSyncServerFailed', onSyncServerFailed((reinstalled : boolean) => { showSDKEvent('onSyncServerFailed', reinstalled) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onSyncServerFinish', onSyncServerFinish((reinstalled : boolean) => { showSDKEvent('onSyncServerFinish', reinstalled) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onSyncServerProgress', onSyncServerProgress((progress : number) => { showSDKEvent('onSyncServerProgress', progress) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onSyncServerStart', onSyncServerStart((reinstalled : boolean) => { showSDKEvent('onSyncServerStart', reinstalled) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onSendMessageProgress', onSendMessageProgress((progress : OpenIMSendMessageProgressEvent | null) => { showSDKEvent('onSendMessageProgress', progress) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onUploadFileProgress', onUploadFileProgress((progress : OpenIMUploadFileProgressEvent | null) => { showSDKEvent('onUploadFileProgress', progress) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onUploadLogsProgress', onUploadLogsProgress((progress : OpenIMUploadLogsProgressEvent | null) => { showSDKEvent('onUploadLogsProgress', progress) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onTotalUnreadMessageCountChanged', onTotalUnreadMessageCountChanged((count : number) => { showSDKEvent('onTotalUnreadMessageCountChanged', count) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onRecvCustomBusinessMessage', onRecvCustomBusinessMessage((payload : string) => { showSDKEvent('onRecvCustomBusinessMessage', payload) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onBlackAdded', onBlackAdded((blackUser : OpenIMBlackUserItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onBlackAdded', blackUser) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onBlackDeleted', onBlackDeleted((blackUser : OpenIMBlackUserItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onBlackDeleted', blackUser) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onFriendAdded', onFriendAdded((friend : OpenIMFriendUserItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onFriendAdded', friend) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onFriendApplicationAccepted', onFriendApplicationAccepted((application : OpenIMFriendApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onFriendApplicationAccepted', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onFriendApplicationAdded', onFriendApplicationAdded((application : OpenIMFriendApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onFriendApplicationAdded', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onFriendApplicationDeleted', onFriendApplicationDeleted((application : OpenIMFriendApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onFriendApplicationDeleted', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onFriendApplicationRejected', onFriendApplicationRejected((application : OpenIMFriendApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onFriendApplicationRejected', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onFriendDeleted', onFriendDeleted((friend : OpenIMFriendUserItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onFriendDeleted', friend) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onFriendInfoChanged', onFriendInfoChanged((friend : OpenIMFriendUserItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onFriendInfoChanged', friend) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupApplicationAccepted', onGroupApplicationAccepted((application : OpenIMGroupApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupApplicationAccepted', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupApplicationAdded', onGroupApplicationAdded((application : OpenIMGroupApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupApplicationAdded', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupApplicationDeleted', onGroupApplicationDeleted((application : OpenIMGroupApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupApplicationDeleted', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupApplicationRejected', onGroupApplicationRejected((application : OpenIMGroupApplicationItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupApplicationRejected', application) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupDismissed', onGroupDismissed((group : OpenIMGroupItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupDismissed', group) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupInfoChanged', onGroupInfoChanged((group : OpenIMGroupItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupInfoChanged', group) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupMemberAdded', onGroupMemberAdded((member : OpenIMGroupMemberItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupMemberAdded', member) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupMemberDeleted', onGroupMemberDeleted((member : OpenIMGroupMemberItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupMemberDeleted', member) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onGroupMemberInfoChanged', onGroupMemberInfoChanged((member : OpenIMGroupMemberItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onGroupMemberInfoChanged', member) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onJoinedGroupAdded', onJoinedGroupAdded((group : OpenIMGroupItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onJoinedGroupAdded', group) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onJoinedGroupDeleted', onJoinedGroupDeleted((group : OpenIMGroupItem | null) => { showSDKEvent('onJoinedGroupDeleted', group) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onSelfInfoUpdated', onSelfInfoUpdated((user : OpenIMUserInfo | null) => { showSDKEvent('onSelfInfoUpdated', user) }))
		addSDKEventSubscription('onUserStatusChanged', onUserStatusChanged((result : OpenIMUserStatusListResult | null) => { showSDKEvent('onUserStatusChanged', result) }))
	}

	registerSDKEvents()

	function requireAutomation(condition : boolean, message : string) {
		if (condition == false) {
			throw new Error(message)
		}
	}

	function requireAutomationString(value : string, message : string) {
		requireAutomation(value.length > 0, message)
	}

	function requireAutomationUser(value : OpenIMUserInfo | null, userID : string, label : string) {
		requireAutomation(value != null, label + ' returned null')
		const item = value as OpenIMUserInfo
		requireAutomationString(item.userID, label + ' returned empty userID')
		requireAutomation(item.userID == userID, label + ' returned unexpected userID ' + item.userID)
	}

	function requireAutomationUserList(value : OpenIMUserListResult | null, primaryUserID : string, secondaryUserID : string) {
		requireAutomation(value != null, 'getUsersInfo returned null')
		const result = value as OpenIMUserListResult
		let hasPrimary = false
		let hasSecondary = false
		result.users.forEach((item : OpenIMUserInfo) => {
			if (item.userID == primaryUserID) { hasPrimary = true }
			if (item.userID == secondaryUserID) { hasSecondary = true }
		})
		requireAutomation(hasPrimary, 'getUsersInfo did not include primary user')
		requireAutomation(hasSecondary, 'getUsersInfo did not include secondary user')
	}

	function requireAutomationCheckFriend(value : OpenIMCheckFriendResult | null, userID : string) {
		requireAutomation(value != null, 'checkFriend returned null')
		const rawValue = stringifyAPIValue(value)
		const result = value as OpenIMCheckFriendResult
		let matched = false
		result.result.forEach((item : OpenIMCheckFriendResultItem) => {
			if (item.userID == userID) {
				matched = true
			}
		})
		requireAutomation(matched, 'checkFriend did not include target user: ' + rawValue)
	}

	function requireAutomationMessage(value : OpenIMMessageItem | null, label : string) {
		requireAutomation(value != null, label + ' returned null')
		const message = value as OpenIMMessageItem
		const clientMsgID = message.clientMsgID != null ? message.clientMsgID as string : ''
		requireAutomationString(clientMsgID, label + ' returned empty clientMsgID')
	}

	function cacheRequiredAutomationMessage(value : OpenIMMessageItem | null) {
		requireAutomationMessage(value, 'message create')
		cacheMessage(value)
	}

	function cacheSentAutomationMessage(value : OpenIMMessageItem) {
		requireAutomationMessage(value, 'send message')
		cachedSentMessage = value
		cacheMessage(value)
	}

	function requireAutomationTextAtUsersInfo(value : OpenIMMessageItem, userID : string) {
		requireAutomation(value.atTextElem != null, 'sent text-at message returned no atTextElem')
		const elem = value.atTextElem as OpenIMAtTextElem
		requireAutomation(elem.atUsersInfo != null, 'sent text-at message returned no atUsersInfo')
		const items = elem.atUsersInfo as Array<OpenIMAtUsersInfoItem>
		let matched = false
		items.forEach((item : OpenIMAtUsersInfoItem) => {
			if (item.atUserID == userID) {
				matched = true
			}
		})
		requireAutomation(matched, 'sent text-at message did not preserve atUsersInfo for ' + userID)
	}

	function requireAutomationHistory(value : OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null, clientMsgID : string) {
		requireAutomation(value != null, 'getAdvancedHistoryMessageList returned null')
		requireAutomationString(clientMsgID, 'sent message clientMsgID is empty')
		const history = value as OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult
		let matched = false
		history.messageList.forEach((message : OpenIMMessageItem) => {
			const id = message.clientMsgID != null ? message.clientMsgID as string : ''
			if (id == clientMsgID) {
				matched = true
			}
		})
		requireAutomation(matched, 'history did not include sent message')
	}

	function joinAutomationPath(parent : string, child : string) : string {
		if (parent.length == 0) { return child }
		const suffix = parent.substring(parent.length - 1, parent.length)
		return suffix == '/' ? parent + child : parent + '/' + child
	}

	function requireAutomationBase64FileContent(filePath : string, label : string) {
		const contentValue = uni.getFileSystemManager().readFileSync(filePath, 'base64')
		const content = contentValue as string
		requireAutomation(content.length > 0, label + ' is empty: ' + filePath)
	}

	function sleepAutomation(milliseconds : number) : Promise<void> {
		return new Promise<void>((resolve, _reject) => {
			setTimeout(() => { resolve() }, milliseconds)
		})
	}

	function initializeAutomationLogFiles() {
		try {
			const basePath = joinAutomationPath(uni.env.USER_DATA_PATH, 'openim-automation-result-' + new Date().getTime().toString())
			automationRunLogFilePath = basePath + '.log'
			automationRunJSONFilePath = basePath + '.json'
			uni.getFileSystemManager().writeFileSync(automationRunLogFilePath, 'OpenIM public Android/iOS automation started\n', 'utf-8')
			uni.getFileSystemManager().writeFileSync(automationRunJSONFilePath, '{"status":"started","cases":[]}', 'utf-8')
		} catch (error) {
			automationRunLogWriteError = stringifyAPIValue(error)
		}
	}

	function buildAutomationProgressLogText() : string {
		const lines : Array<string> = []
		lines.push('OpenIM public Android/iOS automation progress')
		lines.push('Log file: ' + automationRunLogFilePath)
		lines.push('JSON file: ' + automationRunJSONFilePath)
		automationStepResults.forEach((item : OpenIMAutomationCase) => {
			lines.push('[' + item.status + '] [' + item.group + '] ' + item.name + ' ' + item.message)
		})
		return lines.join('\n')
	}

	function flushAutomationProgressFiles() {
		if (automationRunLogFilePath.length == 0 || automationRunJSONFilePath.length == 0) {
			return
		}
		try {
			const progress : UTSJSONObject = {
				status: 'running',
				logFilePath: automationRunLogFilePath,
				jsonFilePath: automationRunJSONFilePath,
				cases: automationStepResults,
				events: automationEventRecords
			}
			const jsonText = JSON.stringify(progress)
			uni.getFileSystemManager().writeFileSync(automationRunLogFilePath, buildAutomationProgressLogText(), 'utf-8')
			if (jsonText != null) {
				uni.getFileSystemManager().writeFileSync(automationRunJSONFilePath, jsonText as string, 'utf-8')
			}
		} catch (error) {
			automationRunLogWriteError = stringifyAPIValue(error)
		}
	}

	function emptyAutomationValidationState() : OpenIMAutomationValidationState {
		return { structureValidated: false, semanticValidated: false }
	}

	function assertAutomationMessageItem(value : OpenIMMessageItem | null, label : string, requireResolvedSessionType : boolean) : OpenIMMessageItem {
		if (value == null) { throw new Error(label + ' returned null message') }
		const message = value as OpenIMMessageItem
		const clientMsgID = message.clientMsgID != null ? message.clientMsgID as string : ''
		if (clientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error(label + ' returned empty clientMsgID') }
		if (message.createTime < 0 || message.sendTime < 0 || message.seq < 0) { throw new Error(label + ' returned an invalid message timestamp or seq') }
		if (requireResolvedSessionType && message.sessionType != OpenIMSessionTypeSingle && message.sessionType != OpenIMSessionTypeGroup) { throw new Error(label + ' returned invalid sessionType') }
		return message
	}

	function parseAutomationInsertedMessageJSON(payloadJSON : string, method : string) : OpenIMMessageItem {
		const message = JSON.parseObject<OpenIMMessageItem>(payloadJSON)
		if (message == null || message.clientMsgID == null || (message.clientMsgID as string).length == 0) {
			throw new Error(method + ' returned no concrete clientMsgID')
		}
		return message as OpenIMMessageItem
	}

	function assertAutomationConversationItem(value : OpenIMConversationItem | null, label : string) : OpenIMConversationItem {
		if (value == null) { throw new Error(label + ' returned null conversation') }
		const conversation = value as OpenIMConversationItem
		if (conversation.conversationID.length == 0) { throw new Error(label + ' returned empty conversationID') }
		if (conversation.minSeq > conversation.maxSeq && conversation.maxSeq > 0) { throw new Error(label + ' returned minSeq greater than maxSeq') }
		return conversation
	}

	function isAutomationCreatedMessageName(name : string) : boolean {
		return name == 'createAdvancedTextMessage' || name == 'createQuoteMessage' || name == 'createAdvancedQuoteMessage' || name == 'createTextAtMessage' || name == 'createMergerMessage' || name == 'createForwardMessage' || name == 'createCustomMessage' || name == 'createFaceMessage' || name == 'createLocationMessage' || name == 'createCardMessage' || name == 'createImageMessageByURL' || name == 'createSoundMessageByURL' || name == 'createVideoMessageByURL' || name == 'createFileMessageByURL' || name == 'createImageMessageFromFullPath' || name == 'createSoundMessageFromFullPath' || name == 'createVideoMessageFromFullPath' || name == 'createFileMessageFromFullPath'
	}

	function validateAutomationCreatedMessage(name : string, value : any | null) : OpenIMAutomationValidationState {
		const message = assertAutomationMessageItem(value as OpenIMMessageItem | null, name, false)
		let expectedContentType = 0
		let hasExpectedElement = false
		if (name == 'createAdvancedTextMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeAdvancedText
			hasExpectedElement = message.advancedTextElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createQuoteMessage' || name == 'createAdvancedQuoteMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeQuote
			hasExpectedElement = message.quoteElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createTextAtMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeAtText
			hasExpectedElement = message.atTextElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createMergerMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeMerge
			hasExpectedElement = message.mergeElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createForwardMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeText
			hasExpectedElement = message.textElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createCustomMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeCustom
			hasExpectedElement = message.customElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createFaceMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeFace
			hasExpectedElement = message.faceElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createLocationMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeLocation
			hasExpectedElement = message.locationElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createCardMessage') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeCard
			hasExpectedElement = message.cardElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createImageMessageByURL' || name == 'createImageMessageFromFullPath') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypePicture
			hasExpectedElement = message.pictureElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createSoundMessageByURL' || name == 'createSoundMessageFromFullPath') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeVoice
			hasExpectedElement = message.soundElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createVideoMessageByURL' || name == 'createVideoMessageFromFullPath') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeVideo
			hasExpectedElement = message.videoElem != null
		} else if (name == 'createFileMessageByURL' || name == 'createFileMessageFromFullPath') {
			expectedContentType = OpenIMMessageTypeFile
			hasExpectedElement = message.fileElem != null
		}
		if (expectedContentType == 0) { throw new Error('unsupported automation message creator: ' + name) }
		if (message.contentType != expectedContentType) { throw new Error(name + ' returned unexpected contentType=' + message.contentType.toString()) }
		if (!hasExpectedElement) { throw new Error(name + ' returned no typed payload for contentType=' + expectedContentType.toString()) }
		return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
	}

	function validateAutomationResponse(name : string, value : any | null) : OpenIMAutomationValidationState {
		if (isAutomationCreatedMessageName(name)) { return validateAutomationCreatedMessage(name, value) }
		if (name == 'initSDK') {
			if (!(value as boolean)) { throw new Error('initSDK did not report successful initialization') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'login' || name == 'logout') {
			if (JSON.stringify(value as string) == null) { throw new Error(name + ' did not return a string response') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: false }
		}
		if (name == 'setAppBackgroundStatus' || name == 'setAppBadge' || name == 'networkStatusChanged' || name == 'updateFcmToken') {
			const encodedResponse = JSON.stringify(value)
			if (encodedResponse == null) { throw new Error(name + ' did not return a string response') }
			const responseJSON = encodedResponse as string
			if (responseJSON.length < 2 || responseJSON.substring(0, 1) != '"' || responseJSON.substring(responseJSON.length - 1, responseJSON.length) != '"') { throw new Error(name + ' did not return a string response') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: name == 'networkStatusChanged' }
		}
		if (name == 'getLoginStatus') {
			const status = value as number
			const expectedStatus = automationLoggedIn ? OpenIMLoginStatusLogged : 1
			if (status != expectedStatus) { throw new Error('getLoginStatus did not match the current automation lifecycle state') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getLoginUserID') {
			const userID = value as string
			if (userID.length == 0 || userID != automationActiveUserID) { throw new Error('getLoginUserID did not match active automation account') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getSelfUserInfo') {
			if (value == null || (value as OpenIMUserInfo).userID != automationActiveUserID) { throw new Error('getSelfUserInfo did not match active automation account') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getUsersInfo') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error('getUsersInfo returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMUserListResult
			let foundPrimary = false
			let foundSecondary = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.users.length) {
				const userID = result.users[index].userID
				if (userID == automationActiveUserID) { foundPrimary = true }
				if (userID == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { foundSecondary = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			if (!foundPrimary || !foundSecondary) { throw new Error('getUsersInfo did not contain both automation accounts') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getUserStatus' || name == 'getSubscribeUsersStatus') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMUserStatusListResult
			let found = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.statuses.length) {
				if (result.statuses[index].userID == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { found = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: found }
		}
		if (name == 'subscribeUsersStatus') {
			const responseText = value as string
			const statuses = JSON.parseArray<UTSJSONObject>(responseText)
			let found = false
			if (statuses != null) {
				let index = 0
				while (index < statuses.length) {
					const userID = statuses[index]['userID']
					if (userID != null && (userID as string) == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { found = true }
					index = index + 1
				}
			}
			if (!found) { throw new Error('subscribeUsersStatus response did not contain the secondary account') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'unsubscribeUsersStatus') {
			const encodedResponse = JSON.stringify(value)
			if (encodedResponse == null) { throw new Error('unsubscribeUsersStatus did not return a string response') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: false }
		}
		if (name == 'createTextMessage') {
			const message = assertAutomationMessageItem(value as OpenIMMessageItem | null, name, false)
			const content = message.textElem == null ? null : (message.textElem as OpenIMTextElem).content
			if (content == null || content.length == 0) { throw new Error('createTextMessage returned empty textElem.content') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'sendMessage' || name == 'sendMessageNotOss') {
			const message = assertAutomationMessageItem(value as OpenIMMessageItem | null, name, true)
			const serverMsgID = message.serverMsgID != null ? message.serverMsgID as string : ''
			if (serverMsgID.length == 0 || message.sendID == null || message.sendID != automationActiveUserID) { throw new Error(name + ' returned an uncorrelated sender or empty serverMsgID') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'insertSingleMessageToLocalStorage' || name == 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorage') {
			parseAutomationInsertedMessageJSON(value as string, name)
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getConversationIDBySessionType') {
			if ((value as string).length == 0) { throw new Error('getConversationIDBySessionType returned empty conversationID') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getOneConversation') {
			assertAutomationConversationItem(value as OpenIMConversationItem | null, name)
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getAllConversationList' || name == 'searchConversation' || name == 'getConversationListSplit' || name == 'getMultipleConversation') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMConversationListResult
			if (name == 'getConversationListSplit' && result.conversations.length > 20) { throw new Error('getConversationListSplit returned more than the requested page size') }
			let found = automationConversationID.length == 0
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.conversations.length) {
				const conversation = assertAutomationConversationItem(result.conversations[index], name)
				if (conversation.conversationID == automationConversationID) { found = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			if (!found) { throw new Error(name + ' did not contain the active scenario conversationID') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'searchLocalMessages' || name == 'findMessageList') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			let totalCount = 0
			let items : Array<OpenIMSearchMessageResultItem> = []
			if (name == 'searchLocalMessages') {
				const result = value as OpenIMSearchMessageResult
				totalCount = result.totalCount
				items = result.searchResultItems
			} else {
				const result = value as OpenIMFindMessageResult
				totalCount = result.totalCount
				items = result.findResultItems
			}
			let observedMessageCount = 0
			let index = 0
			while (index < items.length) {
				if (items[index].conversationID.length == 0 || items[index].messageCount != items[index].messageList.length) { throw new Error(name + ' returned inconsistent result metadata') }
				observedMessageCount = observedMessageCount + items[index].messageList.length
				index = index + 1
			}
			if (totalCount < observedMessageCount) { throw new Error(name + ' returned totalCount below its observed message count') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getAdvancedHistoryMessageList') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult
			if (result.errCode != 0 || result.lastMinSeq < 0) { throw new Error(name + ' returned invalid pagination metadata') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'createGroup') {
			if (value == null || (value as OpenIMGroupItem).groupID.length == 0) { throw new Error('createGroup returned null or empty groupID') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getSpecifiedGroupsInfo') {
			if (value == null || (value as OpenIMGroupListResult).groups.length == 0) { throw new Error('getSpecifiedGroupsInfo returned no group') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getGroupMemberList' || name == 'getSpecifiedGroupMembersInfo') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMGroupMemberListResult
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.members.length) {
				if (result.members[index].groupID.length == 0 || result.members[index].userID.length == 0) { throw new Error(name + ' returned invalid member identity') }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'searchGroupMembers') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error('searchGroupMembers returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMGroupMemberListResult
			let found = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.members.length) {
				if (result.members[index].groupID.length == 0 || result.members[index].userID.length == 0) { throw new Error('searchGroupMembers returned invalid member identity') }
				if (result.members[index].userID == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { found = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			if (!found) { throw new Error('searchGroupMembers did not contain the secondary automation account') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getFriendListPage') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error('getFriendListPage returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMFriendListResult
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.friends.length) {
				if (result.friends[index].userID.length == 0) { throw new Error('getFriendListPage returned empty friend userID') }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: false }
		}
		if (name == 'getFriendList' || name == 'searchFriends' || name == 'getSpecifiedFriendsInfo') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMFriendListResult
			let found = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.friends.length) {
				if (result.friends[index].userID.length == 0) { throw new Error(name + ' returned empty friend userID') }
				if (result.friends[index].userID == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { found = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: found }
		}
		if (name == 'checkFriend') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error('checkFriend returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMCheckFriendResult
			let found = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.result.length) {
				if (result.result[index].userID == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { found = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			if (!found) { throw new Error('checkFriend did not contain the secondary automation account') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getFriendApplicationListAsRecipient' || name == 'getFriendApplicationListAsApplicant') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMFriendApplicationListResult
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.applications.length) {
				if (result.applications[index].fromUserID.length == 0 || result.applications[index].toUserID.length == 0) { throw new Error(name + ' returned invalid application identity') }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getFriendApplicationUnhandledCount' || name == 'getGroupApplicationUnhandledCount' || name == 'getTotalUnreadMsgCount') {
			if (value == null || (value as number) < 0) { throw new Error(name + ' returned a negative or null count') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getBlackList') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error('getBlackList returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMBlackListResult
			let found = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.blackUsers.length) {
				if (result.blackUsers[index].userID == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { found = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: found }
		}
		if (name == 'getJoinedGroupList' || name == 'getJoinedGroupListPage' || name == 'searchGroups') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMGroupListResult
			let found = cachedGroupID.length == 0
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.groups.length) {
				if (result.groups[index].groupID.length == 0) { throw new Error(name + ' returned empty groupID') }
				if (result.groups[index].groupID == cachedGroupID) { found = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: found }
		}
		if (name == 'getGroupApplicationListAsApplicant' || name == 'getGroupApplicationListAsRecipient') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error(name + ' returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMGroupApplicationListResult
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.applications.length) {
				if (result.applications[index].groupID.length == 0 || result.applications[index].userID.length == 0) { throw new Error(name + ' returned invalid application identity') }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		if (name == 'getUsersInGroup') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error('getUsersInGroup returned null') }
			const users = value as Array<string>
			let foundSecondary = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < users.length) {
				if (users[index] == automationExpectedSecondaryUserID) { foundSecondary = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: foundSecondary }
		}
		if (name == 'isJoinGroup') {
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: value as boolean }
		}
		if (name == 'uploadFile') {
			if (value == null) { throw new Error('uploadFile returned null') }
			const result = value as OpenIMUploadFileResult
			const url = result.url != null ? result.url as string : ''
			const uri = result.uri != null ? result.uri as string : ''
			if (url.length == 0 && uri.length == 0) { throw new Error('uploadFile returned neither url nor uri') }
			return { structureValidated: true, semanticValidated: true }
		}
		return emptyAutomationValidationState()
	}

	function emptyAutomationEvidence() : OpenIMAutomationEvidence {
		return {
			structureValidated: false,
			semanticValidated: false,
			sideEffectValidated: false,
			eventCorrelated: false,
			cleanupValidated: false,
			cleanupAction: '',
			assertions: []
		}
	}

	function createAutomationProfileAssertion(axis : string, profile : string, rule : string, expected : string, actual : string, ok : boolean) : OpenIMAutomationAssertionResult {
		return { path: '$', axis: axis, profile: profile, rule: rule, expected: expected, actual: actual, ok: ok }
	}

	function requireAutomationProfile(apiName : string) : OpenIMAutomationProfileEntry {
		requireAutomation(openIMAutomationContractEdition == 'public', 'automation profile registry edition is ' + openIMAutomationContractEdition + ', expected public')
		let index = 0
		while (index < openIMAutomationProfileEntries.length) {
			const entry = openIMAutomationProfileEntries[index]
			if (entry.apiName == apiName) {
				return entry
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		throw new Error('missing generated automation profile for ' + apiName)
	}

	function requireAutomationSemanticProfile(apiName : string) : string {
		return requireAutomationProfile(apiName).semanticProfile
	}

	function requireAutomationSideEffectProbe(apiName : string) : string {
		return requireAutomationProfile(apiName).sideEffectProbe
	}

	function mergeAutomationValidationEvidence(apiName : string, validation : OpenIMAutomationValidationState, supplied : OpenIMAutomationEvidence | null) : OpenIMAutomationEvidence {
		const evidence = supplied == null ? emptyAutomationEvidence() : supplied as OpenIMAutomationEvidence
		if (validation.structureValidated) { evidence.structureValidated = true }
		if (validation.semanticValidated && !evidence.semanticValidated) {
			evidence.semanticValidated = true
			evidence.assertions.push(createAutomationProfileAssertion('semantic', requireAutomationSemanticProfile(apiName), 'scenario-semantics', 'response correlated with current automation context', 'response correlated', true))
		}
		return evidence
	}

	function responseAutomationEvidence(apiName : string, rule : string) : OpenIMAutomationEvidence {
		const semanticProfile = requireAutomationSemanticProfile(apiName)
		const assertions : Array<OpenIMAutomationAssertionResult> = [createAutomationProfileAssertion('semantic', semanticProfile, rule, 'scenario response constraint passes', 'scenario response constraint passed', true)]
		return {
			structureValidated: true,
			semanticValidated: true,
			sideEffectValidated: false,
			eventCorrelated: false,
			cleanupValidated: false,
			cleanupAction: '',
			assertions: assertions
		}
	}

	function mutationAutomationEvidence(apiName : string, semanticRule : string, sideEffectRule : string, eventCorrelated : boolean) : OpenIMAutomationEvidence {
		const semanticProfile = requireAutomationSemanticProfile(apiName)
		const sideEffectProbe = requireAutomationSideEffectProbe(apiName)
		requireAutomation(sideEffectProbe != 'none', apiName + ' does not declare a side-effect probe')
		const assertions : Array<OpenIMAutomationAssertionResult> = [
			createAutomationProfileAssertion('semantic', semanticProfile, semanticRule, 'scenario mutation constraint passes', 'scenario mutation constraint passed', true),
			createAutomationProfileAssertion('side-effect', sideEffectProbe, sideEffectRule, 'observable state transition', 'observable state transition confirmed', true)
		]
		return {
			structureValidated: true,
			semanticValidated: true,
			sideEffectValidated: true,
			eventCorrelated: eventCorrelated,
			cleanupValidated: false,
			cleanupAction: '',
			assertions: assertions
		}
	}

	function serverAcknowledgedMutationAutomationEvidence(apiName : string) : OpenIMAutomationEvidence {
		const semanticProfile = requireAutomationSemanticProfile(apiName)
		const sideEffectProbe = requireAutomationSideEffectProbe(apiName)
		requireAutomation(sideEffectProbe == 'server-acknowledgement', apiName + ' does not declare the server acknowledgement probe')
		const assertions : Array<OpenIMAutomationAssertionResult> = [
			createAutomationProfileAssertion('semantic', semanticProfile, 'server-acknowledged-mutation', 'request correlated with the active server operation', 'server operation correlated', true),
			createAutomationProfileAssertion('side-effect', sideEffectProbe, 'server-acknowledged-mutation', 'native Core receives a successful server acknowledgement', 'native Core resolved after server acknowledgement', true)
		]
		return {
			structureValidated: true,
			semanticValidated: true,
			sideEffectValidated: true,
			eventCorrelated: false,
			cleanupValidated: false,
			cleanupAction: '',
			assertions: assertions
		}
	}

	function subscriptionAutomationEvidence(eventName : string, handleMatched : boolean, registryObserved : boolean) : OpenIMAutomationEvidence {
		const semanticProfile = requireAutomationSemanticProfile(eventName)
		const sideEffectProbe = requireAutomationSideEffectProbe(eventName)
		const assertions : Array<OpenIMAutomationAssertionResult> = [
			createAutomationProfileAssertion('semantic', semanticProfile, 'exact-subscription-handle', eventName + ' handle id and eventName', handleMatched ? eventName + ' exact handle' : 'missing or mismatched handle', handleMatched),
			createAutomationProfileAssertion('side-effect', sideEffectProbe, 'registry-entry-observed', eventName + ' registered by public eventName', registryObserved ? eventName + ' registry entry' : 'registry entry missing', registryObserved)
		]
		return {
			structureValidated: true,
			semanticValidated: handleMatched,
			sideEffectValidated: registryObserved,
			eventCorrelated: false,
			cleanupValidated: false,
			cleanupAction: '',
			assertions: assertions
		}
	}

	function cleanupAutomationEvidence(cleanupAction : string, rule : string, expected : string, actual : string, ok : boolean) : OpenIMAutomationEvidence {
		const assertions : Array<OpenIMAutomationAssertionResult> = [createAutomationProfileAssertion('cleanup', cleanupAction, rule, expected, actual, ok)]
		return {
			structureValidated: false,
			semanticValidated: false,
			sideEffectValidated: false,
			eventCorrelated: false,
			cleanupValidated: ok,
			cleanupAction: cleanupAction,
			assertions: assertions
		}
	}

	function recordAutomationCase(group : string, name : string, status : string, message : string, startedAt : number, evidence : OpenIMAutomationEvidence | null = null, apiName : string | null = null, invoked : boolean | null = null, resolved : boolean | null = null, responseDetail : string | null = null, eventCorrelations : Array<OpenIMAutomationEventCorrelation> | null = null) {
		const contractAPIName = apiName == null || (apiName as string).length == 0 ? name : apiName as string
		markAutomationAPICovered(contractAPIName)
		const checked = evidence == null ? emptyAutomationEvidence() : evidence as OpenIMAutomationEvidence
		if (status == 'passed' && (checked.structureValidated || checked.semanticValidated || checked.sideEffectValidated || checked.eventCorrelated)) {
			markAutomationAPIValidated(contractAPIName)
		}
		const item : OpenIMAutomationCase = {
			group: group,
			name: name,
			apiName: contractAPIName,
			status: status,
			message: automationClip(message),
			durationMs: new Date().getTime() - startedAt,
			invoked: invoked == true,
			resolved: resolved == true,
			responseEvidence: responseDetail != null,
			responseEncoding: responseDetail != null ? automationResponseEncoding(contractAPIName) : '',
			responseDetail: responseDetail != null ? responseDetail as string : '',
			structureValidated: checked.structureValidated,
			semanticValidated: checked.semanticValidated,
			sideEffectValidated: checked.sideEffectValidated,
			eventCorrelated: checked.eventCorrelated,
			negativeValidated: false,
			negativeProfile: '',
			cleanupValidated: checked.cleanupValidated,
			cleanupAction: checked.cleanupAction,
			errCode: 0,
			eventCorrelations: eventCorrelations == null ? [] : eventCorrelations as Array<OpenIMAutomationEventCorrelation>,
			assertions: checked.assertions
		}
		automationStepResults.push(item)
		flushAutomationProgressFiles()
	}

	function recordAutomationStep(group : string, name : string, ok : boolean, detail : string) {
		recordAutomationCase(group, name, ok ? 'passed' : 'failed', detail, new Date().getTime(), null, name, true, ok, null, null)
	}

	function recordAutomationEvidenceStep(group : string, name : string, ok : boolean, detail : string, evidence : OpenIMAutomationEvidence, responseDetail : string | null = null, eventCorrelations : Array<OpenIMAutomationEventCorrelation> | null = null) {
		recordAutomationCase(group, name, ok ? 'passed' : 'failed', detail, new Date().getTime(), evidence, name, true, ok, responseDetail, eventCorrelations)
	}

	function recordAutomationSemanticEvidence(group : string, name : string, detail : string, apiName : string | null = null) {
		const contractAPIName = apiName == null ? name : apiName as string
		recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'passed', detail, new Date().getTime(), responseAutomationEvidence(contractAPIName, 'query-correlation'), contractAPIName, true, true, null, null)
	}

	function recordAutomationSideEffect(group : string, name : string, detail : string, eventCorrelated : boolean | null = null, apiName : string | null = null) {
		const contractAPIName = apiName == null ? name : apiName as string
		const evidence = mutationAutomationEvidence(contractAPIName, 'scenario-mutation-correlated', 'generated-side-effect-observed', eventCorrelated == true)
		recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'passed', detail, new Date().getTime(), evidence, contractAPIName, true, true, null, null)
	}

	function recordAutomationSideEffectFailure(group : string, name : string, detail : string, apiName : string) {
		const evidence = mutationAutomationEvidence(apiName, 'scenario-mutation-correlated', 'generated-side-effect-observed', false)
		recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'failed', detail, new Date().getTime(), evidence, apiName, true, true, null, null)
	}

	function recordAutomationCleanupEvidence(group : string, apiName : string, cleanupAction : string, rule : string, expected : string, actual : string, ok : boolean) {
		recordAutomationCase(group, apiName, ok ? 'passed' : 'failed', rule + ': expected ' + expected + ', actual ' + actual, new Date().getTime(), cleanupAutomationEvidence(cleanupAction, rule, expected, actual, ok), apiName, true, ok, null, null)
	}

	function recordAutomationSkip(group : string, name : string, detail : string) {
		recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'skipped', detail, new Date().getTime(), null, name, false, false, null, null)
	}

	function prepareAutomationLocalFiles() {
		const nativeBasePath = getOpenIMDataPath()
		if (nativeBasePath.length == 0) {
			throw new Error('getOpenIMDataPath returned empty path')
		}
		const fileSystemBasePath = uni.env.USER_DATA_PATH
		automationAssetDirFileSystemPath = fileSystemBasePath
		automationAssetDirFullPath = fileSystemBasePath
		const imageFileName = 'openim-automation-image.jpg'
		const soundFileName = 'openim-automation-sound.wav'
		const videoFileName = 'openim-automation-video.mp4'
		const videoSnapshotFileName = 'openim-automation-video-snapshot.jpg'
		const documentFileName = 'openim-automation-' + demoFixedFileName
		const imageFileSystemPath = joinAutomationPath(fileSystemBasePath, imageFileName)
		const soundFileSystemPath = joinAutomationPath(fileSystemBasePath, soundFileName)
		const videoFileSystemPath = joinAutomationPath(fileSystemBasePath, videoFileName)
		const videoSnapshotFileSystemPath = joinAutomationPath(fileSystemBasePath, videoSnapshotFileName)
		const fileFileSystemPath = joinAutomationPath(fileSystemBasePath, documentFileName)
		automationFixedImageFullPath = imageFileSystemPath
		automationFixedSoundFullPath = soundFileSystemPath
		automationFixedVideoFullPath = videoFileSystemPath
		automationFixedVideoSnapshotFullPath = videoSnapshotFileSystemPath
		automationFixedFileFullPath = fileFileSystemPath
		const fileManager = uni.getFileSystemManager()
		const jpegFixtureBase64 = ''
		fileManager.writeFileSync(imageFileSystemPath, jpegFixtureBase64, 'base64')
		fileManager.writeFileSync(videoSnapshotFileSystemPath, jpegFixtureBase64, 'base64')
		requireAutomationBase64FileContent(imageFileSystemPath, 'image fixture')
		requireAutomationBase64FileContent(videoSnapshotFileSystemPath, 'video snapshot fixture')
		fileManager.writeFileSync(soundFileSystemPath, 'UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAESsAACJWAAACABAAZGF0YQAAAAA=', 'base64')
		fileManager.writeFileSync(videoFileSystemPath, '', 'base64')
		fileManager.writeFileSync(fileFileSystemPath, '%PDF-1.1\n1 0 obj\n<<>>\nendobj\ntrailer\n<<>>\n%%EOF\n', 'utf-8')
		recordAutomationStep('setup', 'prepareLocalFiles', true, nativeBasePath)
	}

	function automationSuiteRequiresLocalFiles() : boolean {
		return automationSuiteFilter.length == 0 || automationSuiteFilter == 'message-create' || automationSuiteFilter == 'upload' || automationSuiteFilter == 'event-delivery'
	}

	function writeAutomationUniqueUploadFile(fileName : string, marker : string) : string {
		if (automationAssetDirFullPath.length == 0 || automationAssetDirFileSystemPath.length == 0) {
			throw new Error('automation asset directory is empty')
		}
		const fileSystemPath = joinAutomationPath(automationAssetDirFileSystemPath, fileName)
		const nativeFilePath = joinAutomationPath(automationAssetDirFullPath, fileName)
		let fileText = ''
		let index = 0
		const block = 'unixsdk automation unique upload fixture ' + marker + ' 0123456789 abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\n'
		while (index < 4096) {
			fileText = fileText + block
			index = index + 1
		}
		uni.getFileSystemManager().writeFileSync(fileSystemPath, fileText, 'utf-8')
		return nativeFilePath
	}

	function withAutomationTimeout<T>(promise : Promise<T>, label : string, timeoutMilliseconds : number) : Promise<T> {
		return new Promise<T>((resolve, reject) => {
			let completed = false
			const timer = setTimeout(() => {
				if (completed == false) {
					completed = true
					reject(new Error(label + ' timed out after ' + timeoutMilliseconds.toString() + 'ms'))
				}
			}, timeoutMilliseconds)
			promise.then((value : T) => {
				if (completed == false) {
					completed = true
					clearTimeout(timer)
					resolve(value)
				}
			}).catch((error : any | null) : void => {
				if (completed == false) {
					completed = true
					clearTimeout(timer)
					reject(error)
				}
			})
		})
	}

	function buildAutomationPeerPayload(target : string, payload : UTSJSONObject | null) : UTSJSONObject {
		const result : UTSJSONObject = { target: target }
		if (payload != null) {
			const keys = UTSJSONObject.keys(payload)
			let index = 0
			while (index < keys.length) {
				const key = keys[index]
				result[key] = payload[key]
				index = index + 1
			}
		}
		return result
	}

	async function runAutomationPeerCommand(command : string, payload : UTSJSONObject | null, timeoutMilliseconds : number | null = null) : Promise<UTSJSONObject> {
		if (!automationPeerBridgeEnabled || automationPeerBridgeRunNonce.length == 0) {
			throw new Error('Public automation peer bridge is required')
		}
		automationPeerBridgeRequestCounter = automationPeerBridgeRequestCounter + 1
		const requestID = automationPeerBridgeRunNonce + '-' + automationPeerBridgeRequestCounter.toString()
		const request : UTSJSONObject = { id: requestID, command: command }
		if (payload != null) { request['payload'] = payload }
		const requestText = JSON.stringify(request)
		if (requestText == null) { throw new Error('Public automation peer request could not be encoded') }
		automationPeerBridgeResponseText = ''
		automationPeerBridgeRequestText = requestText as string
		const timeout = timeoutMilliseconds == null ? automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds : timeoutMilliseconds as number
		const deadline = Date.now() + timeout
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			if (automationPeerBridgeResponseText.length > 0) {
				const response = JSON.parseObject<UTSJSONObject>(automationPeerBridgeResponseText)
				if (response != null && response['id'] == requestID) {
					automationPeerBridgeRequestText = ''
					automationPeerBridgeResponseText = ''
					if (response['ok'] != true) { throw new Error('Public automation peer command failed') }
					const result = response['result']
					if (result instanceof UTSJSONObject) { return result as UTSJSONObject }
					return {}
				}
			}
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		automationPeerBridgeRequestText = ''
		throw new Error('Public automation peer command timed out: ' + command)
	}

	function handleAutomationPeerBridgeReadRequest(runNonce : string) : string {
		if (!automationPeerBridgeEnabled || runNonce != automationPeerBridgeRunNonce) { return '' }
		return automationPeerBridgeRequestText
	}

	function handleAutomationPeerBridgeWriteResponse(responseText : string) : boolean {
		if (!automationPeerBridgeEnabled || responseText.length == 0) { return false }
		automationPeerBridgeResponseText = responseText
		return true
	}

	function mapAutomationPeerEventName(peerEventName : string) : string {
		if (peerEventName == 'OnRecvNewMessage') { return 'onRecvNewMessage' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnRecvC2CReadReceipt') { return 'onRecvC2CReadReceipt' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnNewRecvMessageRevoked') { return 'onNewRecvMessageRevoked' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnMsgDeleted') { return 'onMsgDeleted' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnFriendApplicationAdded') { return 'onFriendApplicationAdded' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnFriendApplicationRejected') { return 'onFriendApplicationRejected' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnFriendAdded') { return 'onFriendAdded' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnBlackAdded') { return 'onBlackAdded' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnJoinedGroupAdded') { return 'onJoinedGroupAdded' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnJoinedGroupDeleted') { return 'onJoinedGroupDeleted' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnGroupApplicationAdded') { return 'onGroupApplicationAdded' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnGroupMemberAdded') { return 'onGroupMemberAdded' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnGroupMemberDeleted') { return 'onGroupMemberDeleted' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnGroupApplicationRejected') { return 'onGroupApplicationRejected' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnGroupDismissed') { return 'onGroupDismissed' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnConversationUserInputStatusChanged') { return 'onConversationUserInputStatusChanged' }
		if (peerEventName == 'OnUserStatusChanged') { return 'onUserStatusChanged' }
		return peerEventName
	}

	async function captureAutomationPeerCursor(target : string) : Promise<number> {
		const result = await runAutomationPeerCommand('event_cursor', buildAutomationPeerPayload(target, null), automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds)
		const sequence = result['seq']
		if (sequence == null) { throw new Error('Public automation peer cursor is missing') }
		return sequence as number
	}

	async function captureAutomationPeerSettledCursor(target : string) : Promise<number> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let cursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor(target)
		let stableIntervals = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			await sleepAutomation(500)
			const nextCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor(target)
			if (nextCursor == cursor) {
				stableIntervals = stableIntervals + 1
				if (stableIntervals >= 2) { return nextCursor }
			} else {
				cursor = nextCursor
				stableIntervals = 0
			}
		}
		throw new Error('Public automation peer event stream did not settle before the scenario')
	}

	async function waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent(target : string, peerEventName : string, apiName : string, afterSequence : number, label : string, expectedTextContent : string | null = null, requireSendProgress : boolean = false) : Promise<void> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let peerCursor = afterSequence
		let identityMismatchCount = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const remaining = deadline - Date.now()
			const waitPayload : UTSJSONObject = { name: peerEventName, afterSeq: peerCursor, timeoutMs: remaining }
			let result : UTSJSONObject
			try {
				result = await runAutomationPeerCommand('wait_event', buildAutomationPeerPayload(target, waitPayload), remaining + automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
			} catch (_error) {
				break
			}
			const sequence = result['seq']
			if (sequence == null || (sequence as number) <= peerCursor) { throw new Error(label + ' returned an invalid peer event sequence') }
			peerCursor = sequence as number
			const payloadTextValue = JSON.stringify(result['payload'])
			if (payloadTextValue == null) { throw new Error(label + ' returned no event payload') }
			const mappedEventName = mapAutomationPeerEventName(peerEventName)
			if (apiName == 'sendMessage' || apiName == 'sendMessageNotOss') {
				const window = findLatestAutomationOperation(apiName)
				const expectedIdentity = window == null ? '' : window.resultIdentity
				const observedIdentity = readAutomationEventPayloadIdentity(mappedEventName, payloadTextValue as string)
				if (expectedIdentity.length == 0 || observedIdentity != expectedIdentity) {
					identityMismatchCount = identityMismatchCount + 1
					if (expectedTextContent != null) {
						const message = JSON.parseObject<UTSJSONObject>(payloadTextValue as string)
						const textElem = message == null ? null : message['textElem']
						if (textElem instanceof UTSJSONObject && textElem['content'] == expectedTextContent as string) {
							throw new Error(label + ' delivered the exact scenario content with a different clientMsgID')
						}
					}
					continue
				}
			}
			recordSDKEventDelivery(mappedEventName, payloadTextValue as string, 'openim-core-json-v1')
			const expectedEvents : Array<string> = requireSendProgress ? ['onSendMessageProgress', mappedEventName] : [mappedEventName]
			const correlations = buildAutomationEventCorrelations(apiName, expectedEvents)
			let matched = correlations.length == expectedEvents.length
			let correlationIndex = 0
			while (correlationIndex < correlations.length) {
				if (!correlations[correlationIndex].payloadMatched) { matched = false }
				correlationIndex = correlationIndex + 1
			}
			if (!matched) { continue }
			const evidence = mutationAutomationEvidence(apiName, 'independent-peer-event-identity', 'cross-account-event-observed', true)
			recordAutomationCase('event-delivery', apiName, 'passed', label, new Date().getTime(), evidence, apiName, true, true, null, correlations)
			return
		}
		throw new Error(label + ' did not correlate with the operation identity before timeout; nonmatching events=' + identityMismatchCount.toString())
	}

	async function waitAutomationPeerInputState(target : string, conversationID : string, userID : string, expectedPlatform : number, expectedPresent : boolean, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const payload : UTSJSONObject = {
				conversationID: conversationID,
				userID: userID,
				operationID: operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()
			}
			const result = await runAutomationPeerCommand('get_input_states', buildAutomationPeerPayload(target, payload), automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
			const rawStates = result['states']
			let found = false
			if (rawStates != null) {
				const states = rawStates as Array<number>
				let index = 0
				while (index < states.length) {
					if (states[index] == expectedPlatform) { found = true }
					index = index + 1
				}
			}
			if (found == expectedPresent) { return }
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('Public peer did not observe the expected input state')
	}

	async function runAutomationStepWithTimeout<T>(group : string, name : string, promise : Promise<T>, onSuccess : (value : T) => void, timeoutMilliseconds : number, evidence : OpenIMAutomationEvidence | null = null) : Promise<T> {
		statusText.value = 'Automation: ' + group + ' / ' + name
		const startedAt = new Date().getTime()
		let resolvedValueText = ''
		try {
			const value = await withAutomationTimeout<T>(promise, group + '/' + name, timeoutMilliseconds)
			resolvedValueText = stringifyAutomationResponseValue(name, value)
			onSuccess(value)
			const validation = validateAutomationResponse(name, value)
			const checked = mergeAutomationValidationEvidence(name, validation, evidence)
			recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'passed', resolvedValueText, startedAt, checked, name, true, true, resolvedValueText, null)
			return value
		} catch (error) {
			const errorText = stringifyAPIValue(error)
			recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'failed', resolvedValueText.length > 0 ? 'value=' + resolvedValueText + '; error=' + errorText : errorText, startedAt, null, name, true, false, null, null)
			throw error
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationStep<T>(group : string, name : string, promise : Promise<T>, onSuccess : (value : T) => void, evidence : OpenIMAutomationEvidence | null = null) : Promise<T> {
		return await runAutomationStepWithTimeout<T>(group, name, promise, onSuccess, automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds, evidence)
	}

	async function runAutomationContinueStep<T>(group : string, name : string, promise : Promise<T>, onSuccess : (value : T) => void) : Promise<T | null> {
		try {
			return await runAutomationStep<T>(group, name, promise, onSuccess)
		} catch (error) {
			return null
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationOptionalStep<T>(group : string, name : string, promise : Promise<T>, onSuccess : (value : T) => void, reason : string) : Promise<T | null> {
		statusText.value = 'Automation: ' + group + ' / ' + name
		const startedAt = new Date().getTime()
		try {
			const value = await withAutomationTimeout<T>(promise, group + '/' + name, automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			onSuccess(value)
			const responseDetail = stringifyAutomationResponseValue(name, value)
			const validation = validateAutomationResponse(name, value)
			const checked = mergeAutomationValidationEvidence(name, validation, null)
			recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'passed', responseDetail, startedAt, checked, name, true, true, responseDetail, null)
			return value
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationCase(group, name, 'skipped', reason + ': ' + stringifyAPIValue(error), startedAt, null, name, true, false, null, null)
			return null
		}
	}

	function isIOSRuntime() : boolean {
		let result = false
		// #ifdef APP-IOS
		result = true
		// #endif
		return result
	}

	async function switchAutomationAccount(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig, userID : string, token : string, label : string) : Promise<void> {
		if (automationLoggedIn && automationActiveUserID == userID) {
			recordAutomationStep('setup', 'switchAccount', true, label + ' already active')
			return
		}
		if (automationLoggedIn) {
			if (isIOSRuntime()) {
				await sleepAutomation(1000)
			}
			await runAutomationStep<string>('setup', 'logout', logout('uvue_auto_logout_' + label), (_value : string) => {
				automationLoggedIn = false
				automationActiveUserID = ''
			})
			if (isIOSRuntime()) {
				await sleepAutomation(500)
			}
		}
		beginAutomationOperation('login', null, false)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('setup', 'login', login(userID, token, 'uvue_auto_login_' + label), (_value : string) => {
			automationLoggedIn = true
			automationActiveUserID = userID
		})
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMLoginStatus>('setup', 'getLoginStatus', getLoginStatus('uvue_auto_login_status_' + label), (value : OpenIMLoginStatus) => {
			requireAutomation(value == 3, 'getLoginStatus did not report logged-in state')
		}, responseAutomationEvidence('getLoginStatus', 'login-status-is-logged'))
		await runAutomationStep<string>('setup', 'getLoginUserID', getLoginUserID(), (value : string) => {
			requireAutomation(value == userID, 'getLoginUserID returned ' + value + ', expected ' + userID)
		}, responseAutomationEvidence('getLoginUserID', 'login-user-id-matches-active-user'))
		completeAutomationOperation('login', userID)
		recordAutomationEvidenceStep('setup', 'login', true, 'read-after-login status and userID matched ' + userID, mutationAutomationEvidence('login', 'authenticated-user-observed', 'login-readback-observed', false), null, null)
	}

	async function switchAutomationPrimary(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig, label : string) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationAccount(config, config.primaryUserID, config.primaryToken, label)
	}

	async function switchAutomationSecondary(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig, label : string) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationAccount(config, config.secondaryUserID, config.secondaryToken, label)
	}

	async function normalizeAutomationExistingSession() : Promise<void> {
		const status = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMLoginStatus>('setup', 'getLoginStatus', getLoginStatus('uvue_auto_existing_login_status'), (_value : OpenIMLoginStatus) => {})
		if (status == 3) {
			const existingUserID = await runAutomationStep<string>('setup', 'getLoginUserID', getLoginUserID(), (value : string) => { requireAutomationString(value, 'retained getLoginUserID returned empty userID') })
			automationLoggedIn = true
			automationActiveUserID = existingUserID
			await runAutomationStep<string>('setup', 'logout', logout('uvue_auto_existing_logout'), (_value : string) => {
				automationLoggedIn = false
				automationActiveUserID = ''
			})
			if (isIOSRuntime()) { await sleepAutomation(500) }
		} else {
			automationLoggedIn = false
			automationActiveUserID = ''
		}
	}

	function recordAutomationEventSubscriptionCoverage() {
		let index = 0
		while (index < sdkEventSubscriptions.length) {
			const subscription = sdkEventSubscriptions[index]
			const eventName = subscription.eventName
			const handleMatched = subscription.id.length > 0 && automationStringArrayContains(sdkRegisteredEventNames, eventName)
			const registryObserved = automationStringArrayContains(sdkEventSubscriptionNames, eventName)
			const valid = handleMatched && registryObserved
			recordAutomationCase('events', eventName, valid ? 'passed' : 'failed', valid ? 'exact subscription handle and registry entry observed' : 'event subscription handle or registry entry missing', new Date().getTime(), subscriptionAutomationEvidence(eventName, handleMatched, registryObserved), eventName, true, valid, valid ? stringifyAPIValue(subscription) : null, null)
			index = index + 1
		}
		index = 0
		while (index < automationEventSubscriptionNames.length) {
			const eventName = automationEventSubscriptionNames[index]
			if (!automationStringArrayContains(sdkRegisteredEventNames, eventName)) {
				recordAutomationStep('events', eventName, false, 'event subscription was not registered')
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationEventControlScenario(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		let removedCount = 0
		let selfRemovingCount = 0
		let survivorCount = 0
		let connectionCompletedCount = 0
		let postOffAllWitnessCount = 0
		const removed = onConnecting(() => { removedCount = removedCount + 1 })
		let selfRemoving : OpenIMSDKEventSubscription | null = null
		let postOffAllWitness : OpenIMSDKEventSubscription | null = null
		selfRemoving = onConnecting(() => {
			selfRemovingCount = selfRemovingCount + 1
			if (selfRemoving != null) { off(selfRemoving as OpenIMSDKEventSubscription) }
		})
		const survivor = onConnecting(() => { survivorCount = survivorCount + 1 })
		const connectionCompleted = onConnectSuccess(() => { connectionCompletedCount = connectionCompletedCount + 1 })
		try {
			requireAutomationString(removed.id, 'off scenario returned empty subscription id')
			requireAutomation(removed.eventName == 'onConnecting', 'off scenario returned wrong eventName')
			off(removed)
			const forged : OpenIMSDKEventSubscription = { id: 'forged-openim-subscription', eventName: 'onConnecting' }
			off(forged)
			let completedBefore = connectionCompletedCount
			await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_event_control_first')
			let waited = 0
			while ((connectionCompletedCount <= completedBefore || selfRemovingCount < 1 || survivorCount < 1) && waited < 10000) {
				await sleepAutomation(250)
				waited = waited + 250
			}
			requireAutomation(connectionCompletedCount > completedBefore, 'login completed without onConnectSuccess delivery')
			requireAutomation(removedCount == 0, 'off delivered a removed subscription')
			requireAutomation(selfRemovingCount == 1, 'snapshot dispatch/self removal count changed')
			requireAutomation(survivorCount > 0, 'off blocked a sibling subscription')
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('events', 'off', true, 'exact, forged, self-removal, and sibling delivery validated', mutationAutomationEvidence('off', 'exact-and-forged-handles-distinguished', 'removed-handler-not-dispatched', false), 'null', null)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('events', 'off', 'none', 'event-control-operation-is-terminal', 'no retained resource owned by off', 'no retained resource owned by off', true)
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('events', 'onConnecting', true, 'typed handle delivered once and self-removal affected only later dispatch', mutationAutomationEvidence('onConnecting', 'snapshot-dispatch-preserved', 'sibling-registry-entry-survived', true), stringifyAPIValue(survivor), null)

			const survivorBeforeOffAll = survivorCount
			offAll('onConnecting')
			postOffAllWitness = onConnecting(() => {
				postOffAllWitnessCount = postOffAllWitnessCount + 1
				if (postOffAllWitness != null) { off(postOffAllWitness as OpenIMSDKEventSubscription) }
			})
			completedBefore = connectionCompletedCount
			await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_event_control_off_all')
			waited = 0
			while ((connectionCompletedCount <= completedBefore || postOffAllWitnessCount < 1) && waited < 10000) {
				await sleepAutomation(250)
				waited = waited + 250
			}
			requireAutomation(connectionCompletedCount > completedBefore, 'account switch completed without onConnectSuccess delivery')
			requireAutomation(postOffAllWitnessCount == 1, 'post-offAll event witness was not delivered exactly once')
			requireAutomation(survivorCount == survivorBeforeOffAll, 'offAll retained an onConnecting subscription')
			requireAutomation(selfRemovingCount == 1, 'offAll reactivated a removed subscription')
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('events', 'offAll', true, 'public eventName registry cleared without native-code aliasing', mutationAutomationEvidence('offAll', 'public-event-name-selected', 'all-matching-handlers-removed', false), 'null', null)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('events', 'offAll', 'none', 'event-control-operation-is-terminal', 'no retained resource owned by offAll', 'no retained resource owned by offAll', true)
			registerSDKEvents()
			await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_event_control_restore')
		} finally {
			off(connectionCompleted)
			if (postOffAllWitness != null) { off(postOffAllWitness as OpenIMSDKEventSubscription) }
		}
	}

	async function sendAutomationCreatedMessage(stepName : string, message : OpenIMMessageItem | null, recvID : string, groupID : string, operationID : string, useNotOss : boolean | null = null) : Promise<OpenIMMessageItem | null> {
		if (message == null) {
			recordAutomationSkip('message-create-send', stepName, 'create step returned null or was skipped')
			return null
		}
		const options : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: operationID, message: message as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: recvID, groupID: groupID, isOnlineOnly: false }
		const promise = useNotOss == true ? sendMessageNotOss(options) : sendMessage(options)
		try {
			return await runAutomationStepWithTimeout<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-create-send', stepName, promise, cacheSentAutomationMessage, automationSendStepTimeoutMilliseconds, null)
		} catch (error) {
			return null
		}
	}

	function readAutomationHistoryMessageSeq(history : OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null, clientMsgID : string) : number {
		if (history == null) {
			return 0
		}
		const items = (history as OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult).messageList
		let index = 0
		while (index < items.length) {
			const message = items[index]
			const id = message.clientMsgID != null ? message.clientMsgID as string : ''
			if (id == clientMsgID && message.seq > 0) {
				return message.seq
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return 0
	}

	function readAutomationHistoryMaxSeq(history : OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null) : number {
		if (history == null) {
			return 0
		}
		let maxSeq = 0
		const items = (history as OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult).messageList
		let index = 0
		while (index < items.length) {
			const seq = items[index].seq
			if (seq > maxSeq) {
				maxSeq = seq
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return maxSeq
	}

	async function loadAutomationGroupHistory(groupID : string, operationID : string) : Promise<OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null> {
		const params : OpenIMGetAdvancedHistoryMessageListParams = { conversationID: 'sg_' + groupID, startClientMsgID: '', count: 20 }
		return await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null>(getAdvancedHistoryMessageList(params, operationID), 'group history poll', 5000)
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupMessageSeq(groupID : string, clientMsgID : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<number> {
		let waited = 0
		while (waited < 12000) {
			try {
				const history = await loadAutomationGroupHistory(groupID, operationPrefix + '_history_' + waited.toString())
				const seq = readAutomationHistoryMessageSeq(history, clientMsgID)
				if (seq > 0) {
					return seq
				}
			} catch (error) {
			}
			await sleepAutomation(500)
			waited = waited + 500
		}
		throw new Error('group message seq was not synced: ' + groupID + '/' + clientMsgID)
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupHistorySeq(groupID : string, minSeq : number, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<number> {
		let waited = 0
		while (waited < 12000) {
			try {
				const history = await loadAutomationGroupHistory(groupID, operationPrefix + '_history_' + waited.toString())
				const maxSeq = readAutomationHistoryMaxSeq(history)
				if (maxSeq >= minSeq) {
					return maxSeq
				}
			} catch (error) {
			}
			await sleepAutomation(500)
			waited = waited + 500
		}
		throw new Error('group history seq did not reach ' + minSeq.toString() + ': ' + groupID)
	}

	async function seedAutomationGroupConversation(groupID : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<number> {
		const seedMessage = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('group', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('group seq seed from unixsdk public automation', operationPrefix + '_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const seedOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: operationPrefix + '_send', message: seedMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: '', groupID: groupID, isOnlineOnly: false }
		const sentSeed = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('group', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(seedOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
		const clientMsgID = sentSeed.clientMsgID != null ? sentSeed.clientMsgID as string : ''
		requireAutomationString(clientMsgID, 'group seed returned empty clientMsgID')
		return await waitAutomationGroupMessageSeq(groupID, clientMsgID, operationPrefix)
	}

	async function waitAutomationEventCountIncrease(eventName : string, previousCount : number, timeoutMilliseconds : number) : Promise<boolean> {
		let waited = 0
		while (waited < timeoutMilliseconds) {
			if (readAutomationEventCount(eventName) > previousCount) {
				return true
			}
			await sleepAutomation(250)
			waited = waited + 250
		}
		return readAutomationEventCount(eventName) > previousCount
	}

	async function recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation(apiName : string, eventName : string, previousCount : number, timeoutMilliseconds : number | null = null) : Promise<boolean> {
		const timeout = timeoutMilliseconds == null ? automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds : timeoutMilliseconds as number
		let waited = 0
		while (waited < timeout) {
			if (readAutomationEventCount(eventName) > previousCount) {
				const correlations = buildAutomationEventCorrelations(apiName, [eventName])
				if (correlations.length == 1 && correlations[0].payloadMatched) {
					const evidence = emptyAutomationEvidence()
					evidence.eventCorrelated = true
					recordAutomationCase('event-delivery', apiName, 'passed', 'operation event correlated by exact payload identity', new Date().getTime(), evidence, apiName, true, true, null, correlations)
					return true
				}
			}
			await sleepAutomation(250)
			waited = waited + 250
		}
		const finalCorrelations = readAutomationEventCount(eventName) > previousCount ? buildAutomationEventCorrelations(apiName, [eventName]) : [] as Array<OpenIMAutomationEventCorrelation>
		if (finalCorrelations.length == 1 && finalCorrelations[0].payloadMatched) {
			const evidence = emptyAutomationEvidence()
			evidence.eventCorrelated = true
			recordAutomationCase('event-delivery', apiName, 'passed', 'operation event correlated by exact payload identity', new Date().getTime(), evidence, apiName, true, true, null, finalCorrelations)
			return true
		}
		recordAutomationStep('event-delivery', apiName, false, 'expected ' + eventName + ' was not correlated to the exact operation identity')
		return false
	}

	function recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations(apiName : string, expectedEvents : Array<string>) {
		const correlations = buildAutomationEventCorrelations(apiName, expectedEvents)
		let allMatched = correlations.length == expectedEvents.length
		let index = 0
		while (index < correlations.length) {
			if (!correlations[index].payloadMatched) { allMatched = false }
			index = index + 1
		}
		if (correlations.length == 0) { return }
		const evidence = mutationAutomationEvidence(apiName, 'operation-event-identity', 'cross-account-event-observed', allMatched)
		evidence.eventCorrelated = allMatched
		const detail = (allMatched ? 'complete' : 'partial') + ' operation-window event correlation ' + correlations.length.toString() + '/' + expectedEvents.length.toString()
		recordAutomationCase('event-delivery', apiName, 'passed', detail, new Date().getTime(), evidence, apiName, true, true, null, correlations)
	}

	function cacheAutomationConversationID(value : string) {
		requireAutomationString(value, 'getConversationIDBySessionType returned empty conversationID')
		automationConversationID = value
	}

	function messageKeyFromMessage(message : OpenIMMessageItem | null) : OpenIMMessageKeyParams | null {
		if (message == null) {
			return null
		}
		const messageItem = message as OpenIMMessageItem
		const clientMsgID = messageItem.clientMsgID != null ? messageItem.clientMsgID as string : ''
		if (clientMsgID.length == 0 || automationConversationID.length == 0) {
			return null
		}
		const params : OpenIMMessageKeyParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, clientMsgID: clientMsgID }
		return params
	}

	function findAutomationHistoryMessage(history : OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null, clientMsgID : string) : OpenIMMessageItem | null {
		if (history == null) { return null }
		let index = 0
		while (index < history.messageList.length) {
			if (history.messageList[index].clientMsgID == clientMsgID) { return history.messageList[index] }
			index = index + 1
		}
		return null
	}

	async function waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(conversationID : string, clientMsgID : string, expectedPresent : boolean, expectedContentType : number | null, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<OpenIMMessageItem | null> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const params : OpenIMGetAdvancedHistoryMessageListParams = { conversationID: conversationID, startClientMsgID: '', count: 100 }
			try {
				const history = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null>(getAdvancedHistoryMessageList(params, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'message-storage/getAdvancedHistoryMessageListReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
				const message = findAutomationHistoryMessage(history, clientMsgID)
				if (!expectedPresent && message == null) { return null }
				if (expectedPresent && message != null && (expectedContentType == null || message.contentType == expectedContentType as number)) { return message }
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('message history state did not match before timeout')
	}

	async function waitAutomationMessageLocalEx(key : OpenIMMessageKeyParams, expectedLocalEx : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const message = await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(key.conversationID, key.clientMsgID, true, null, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString())
			if (message != null && message.localEx == expectedLocalEx) { return }
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('message localEx did not match before timeout')
	}

	function findFriendApplication(result : OpenIMFriendApplicationListResult | null, fromUserID : string, toUserID : string) : OpenIMFriendApplicationItem | null {
		if (result == null) {
			return null
		}
		let fallback : OpenIMFriendApplicationItem | null = null
		let index = 0
		while (index < result.applications.length) {
			const item = result.applications[index]
			if (item.fromUserID == fromUserID && item.toUserID == toUserID) {
				if (item.handleResult == 0) {
					return item
				}
				if (fallback == null) {
					fallback = item
				}
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return fallback
	}

	function findGroupApplication(result : OpenIMGroupApplicationListResult | null, groupID : string, fromUserID : string) : OpenIMGroupApplicationItem | null {
		if (result == null) {
			return null
		}
		let fallback : OpenIMGroupApplicationItem | null = null
		let index = 0
		while (index < result.applications.length) {
			const item = result.applications[index]
			if (item.groupID == groupID && item.userID == fromUserID) {
				if (item.handleResult == 0) {
					return item
				}
				if (fallback == null) {
					fallback = item
				}
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return fallback
	}

	async function runAutomationConnectFailureProbe(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		const eventName = 'onConnectFailed'
		const beforeCount = readAutomationEventCount(eventName)
		const afterSequence = readAutomationEventSequence()
		automationLifecycleEpochCounter = automationLifecycleEpochCounter + 1
		automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = automationLifecycleEpochCounter
		let primaryError : Error | null = null
		try {
			const unavailableWSAddr = buildAutomationUnavailableWSAddr(config.wsAddr)
			await withAutomationTimeout<boolean>(initSDK(buildAutomationInitConfigWithWS(config, unavailableWSAddr), 'uvue_auto_connect_failure_init'), 'events/initSDKConnectFailureProbe', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			try {
				await withAutomationTimeout<string>(login(config.primaryUserID, config.primaryToken, 'uvue_auto_connect_failure_login'), 'events/loginConnectFailureProbe', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			const delivered = await waitAutomationEventCountIncrease(eventName, beforeCount, automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds)
			const occurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrence(eventName, automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch, afterSequence)
			if (!delivered || occurrence == null) { throw new Error('unavailable WS endpoint did not deliver onConnectFailed') }
			const payload = occurrence.payloadText
			const separator = payload.indexOf(',')
			if (payload.substring(0, 1) != '[' || separator <= 1 || payload.substring(payload.length - 1) != ']') { throw new Error('onConnectFailed did not carry an error tuple') }
			const errorCode = parseInt(payload.substring(1, separator))
			if (errorCode.toString() == 'NaN' || errorCode == 0 || payload.length <= separator + 3) { throw new Error('onConnectFailed did not carry a non-zero error and message') }
			markAutomationEventEvidence(eventName, true, true, false)
		} catch (error) {
			primaryError = error instanceof Error ? error as Error : new Error(stringifyAPIValue(error))
		} finally {
			try {
				const status = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMLoginStatus>(getLoginStatus('uvue_auto_connect_failure_status'), 'events/getLoginStatusConnectFailureProbe', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
				if (status == 3) { await withAutomationTimeout<string>(logout('uvue_auto_connect_failure_logout'), 'events/logoutConnectFailureProbe', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds) }
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			unInitSDK('uvue_auto_connect_failure_uninit')
			automationLoggedIn = false
			automationActiveUserID = ''
			await sleepAutomation(500)
		}
		if (primaryError != null) { throw primaryError as Error }
		recordAutomationStep('events', 'onConnectFailedScenario', true, 'unavailable endpoint delivered a non-zero network error after the probe began')
	}

	async function runAutomationSetupSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await runAutomationConnectFailureProbe(config)
		automationLifecycleEpochCounter = automationLifecycleEpochCounter + 1
		automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = automationLifecycleEpochCounter
		await runAutomationStep<boolean>('setup', 'initSDK', initSDK(buildAutomationInitConfig(config), 'uvue_auto_init_sdk'), (value : boolean) => { requireAutomation(value, 'initSDK returned false') }, responseAutomationEvidence('initSDK', 'init-result-is-true'))
		await normalizeAutomationExistingSession()
		await runAutomationEventControlScenario(config)
		const dataPath = getOpenIMDataPath()
		requireAutomationString(dataPath, 'getOpenIMDataPath returned empty path')
		recordAutomationEvidenceStep('setup', 'getOpenIMDataPath', true, dataPath, responseAutomationEvidence('getOpenIMDataPath', 'data-path-is-non-empty'), stringifyAPIValue(dataPath), null)
		initializeAutomationLogFiles()
		if (automationSuiteRequiresLocalFiles()) {
			prepareAutomationLocalFiles()
		} else {
			recordAutomationStep('setup', 'prepareLocalFiles', true, 'not required for filtered suite ' + automationSuiteFilter)
		}
		recordAutomationEventSubscriptionCoverage()
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_setup')
		recordAutomationEvidenceStep('setup', 'initSDK', true, 'successful login observed after init', mutationAutomationEvidence('initSDK', 'initialized-session-accepted-login', 'init-state-transition-observed', false), null, null)
		const sdkVersion = getSdkVersion()
		requireAutomationString(sdkVersion, 'getSdkVersion returned empty version')
		recordAutomationEvidenceStep('setup', 'getSdkVersion', true, sdkVersion, responseAutomationEvidence('getSdkVersion', 'sdk-version-is-non-empty'), stringifyAPIValue(sdkVersion), null)
	}

	function automationSubscribedStatusContains(value : OpenIMUserStatusListResult | null, userID : string) : boolean {
		if (value == null) { return false }
		let index = 0
		while (index < (value as OpenIMUserStatusListResult).statuses.length) {
			if ((value as OpenIMUserStatusListResult).statuses[index].userID == userID) { return true }
			index = index + 1
		}
		return false
	}

	function automationUserStatusEventContains(payloadText : string, userID : string) : boolean {
		try {
			const parsed = JSON.parseObject<UTSJSONObject>(payloadText)
			if (parsed == null) { return false }
			const rawStatuses = parsed['statuses']
			if (rawStatuses == null) { return false }
			const statuses = rawStatuses as Array<UTSJSONObject>
			let index = 0
			while (index < statuses.length) {
				const rawUserID = statuses[index]['userID']
				if (rawUserID != null && (rawUserID as string) == userID) { return true }
				index = index + 1
			}
		} catch (_error) {
		}
		return false
	}

	async function waitAutomationSubscribedStatus(userID : string, expectedPresent : boolean, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<boolean> {
		const startedAt = Date.now()
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() - startedAt < automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds) {
			try {
				const value = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMUserStatusListResult | null>(getSubscribeUsersStatus(operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'user-status/getSubscribeUsersStatus', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
				if (automationSubscribedStatusContains(value, userID) == expectedPresent) { return true }
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		return false
	}

	async function runAutomationUserStatusSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMUserInfo | null>('user-status', 'getSelfUserInfo', getSelfUserInfo('uvue_auto_self_info'), (value : OpenIMUserInfo | null) => { requireAutomationUser(value, config.primaryUserID, 'getSelfUserInfo') })
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMUserListResult | null>('user-status', 'getUsersInfo', getUsersInfo([config.primaryUserID, config.secondaryUserID], 'uvue_auto_users_info'), (value : OpenIMUserListResult | null) => { requireAutomationUserList(value, config.primaryUserID, config.secondaryUserID) })
		const selfInfo : OpenIMSetSelfInfoParams = { ex: 'uvue-automation-public' }
		const selfInfoUpdatedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onSelfInfoUpdated')
		beginAutomationOperation('setSelfInfo', config.primaryUserID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('user-status', 'setSelfInfo', setSelfInfo(selfInfo, 'uvue_auto_set_self_info'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('setSelfInfo', config.primaryUserID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('setSelfInfo', 'onSelfInfoUpdated', selfInfoUpdatedCount)
		const selfReadback = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMUserInfo | null>('user-status', 'getSelfUserInfo', getSelfUserInfo('uvue_auto_self_info_readback'), (value : OpenIMUserInfo | null) => { requireAutomationUser(value, config.primaryUserID, 'getSelfUserInfo readback') })
		requireAutomation(selfReadback != null && (selfReadback as OpenIMUserInfo).ex == selfInfo.ex, 'setSelfInfo ex was not observable through getSelfUserInfo')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('user-status', 'setSelfInfoReadback', 'getSelfUserInfo returned the exact updated ex', false, 'setSelfInfo')
		const statusEventSequence = readAutomationEventSequence()
		await runAutomationStep<string>('user-status', 'subscribeUsersStatus', subscribeUsersStatus([config.secondaryUserID], 'uvue_auto_subscribe_status'), noCache)
		let peerLoggedOut = false
		try {
			peerLoggedOut = true
			await runAutomationPeerCommand('logout_session', buildAutomationPeerPayload('secondary', null), automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			const statusDeadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
			let statusOccurrence : OpenIMAutomationEventOccurrence | null = null
			while (Date.now() < statusDeadline) {
				statusOccurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrence('onUserStatusChanged', automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch, statusEventSequence)
				if (statusOccurrence != null && automationUserStatusEventContains((statusOccurrence as OpenIMAutomationEventOccurrence).payloadText, config.secondaryUserID)) { break }
				statusOccurrence = null
				await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
			}
			if (statusOccurrence == null) { throw new Error('secondary peer logout did not emit an exact user-status event') }
			markAutomationEventEvidence('onUserStatusChanged', true, true, true)
		} finally {
			if (peerLoggedOut) {
				await runAutomationPeerCommand('login_session', buildAutomationPeerPayload('secondary', null), automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			}
		}
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMUserStatusListResult | null>('user-status', 'getUserStatus', getUserStatus([config.secondaryUserID], 'uvue_auto_user_status'), noCache)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMUserStatusListResult | null>('user-status', 'getSubscribeUsersStatus', getSubscribeUsersStatus('uvue_auto_subscribed_status'), noCache)
		const subscribedObserved = await waitAutomationSubscribedStatus(config.secondaryUserID, true, 'uvue_auto_subscribed_status_readback')
		if (subscribedObserved) {
			recordAutomationSemanticEvidence('user-status', 'subscribeUsersStatusReadback', 'subscribed status contained the secondary automation account', 'subscribeUsersStatus')
		} else {
			recordAutomationStep('user-status', 'subscribeUsersStatusReadback', false, 'subscribed status did not contain the secondary automation account before timeout')
		}
		await runAutomationStep<string>('user-status', 'unsubscribeUsersStatus', unsubscribeUsersStatus([config.secondaryUserID], 'uvue_auto_unsubscribe_status'), noCache)
		const unsubscribedObserved = await waitAutomationSubscribedStatus(config.secondaryUserID, false, 'uvue_auto_unsubscribed_status_readback')
		if (unsubscribedObserved) {
			recordAutomationSemanticEvidence('user-status', 'unsubscribeUsersStatusReadback', 'subscribed status excluded the secondary automation account', 'unsubscribeUsersStatus')
		} else {
			recordAutomationStep('user-status', 'unsubscribeUsersStatusReadback', false, 'subscribed status still contained the secondary automation account before timeout')
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationMessageCreateSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_message_create')
		let groupID = ''
		const groupInfo : OpenIMCreateGroupInfo = { groupName: 'uvue public create-send ' + new Date().getTime().toString(), groupType: 2, ex: 'uvue-public-create-send' }
		const groupParams : OpenIMCreateGroupParams = { groupInfo: groupInfo, memberUserIDs: [config.secondaryUserID], adminUserIDs: [] }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupItem | null>('message-create-send', 'createGroup', createGroup(groupParams, 'uvue_auto_create_send_group'), (value : OpenIMGroupItem | null) => {
			requireAutomation(value != null, 'createGroup returned null')
			groupID = (value as OpenIMGroupItem).groupID
			cachedGroupID = groupID
		})
		await sleepAutomation(1000)
		const textMessage = await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('hello from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_create_text'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const sentTextMessage = await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateTextMessage', textMessage, '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_text', false)
		const sourceMessage = sentTextMessage != null ? sentTextMessage as OpenIMMessageItem : textMessage as OpenIMMessageItem
		const advancedTextParams : OpenIMCreateAdvancedTextMessageParams = { text: 'advanced text from unixsdk public automation', messageEntityList: [] }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateAdvancedTextMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createAdvancedTextMessage', createAdvancedTextMessage(advancedTextParams, 'uvue_auto_create_advanced_text'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_advanced_text', false)
		const quoteParams : OpenIMCreateQuoteMessageParams = { text: 'quote from unixsdk public automation', message: stringifyQuoteMessage(sourceMessage) }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateQuoteMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createQuoteMessage', createQuoteMessage(quoteParams, 'uvue_auto_create_quote'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_quote', false)
		const advancedQuoteParams : OpenIMCreateAdvancedQuoteMessageParams = { text: 'advanced quote from unixsdk public automation', message: stringifyQuoteMessage(sourceMessage), messageEntityList: [] }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateAdvancedQuoteMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createAdvancedQuoteMessage', createAdvancedQuoteMessage(advancedQuoteParams, 'uvue_auto_create_advanced_quote'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_advanced_quote', false)
		const atUsersInfo : Array<OpenIMAtUsersInfoItem> = [{ atUserID: config.secondaryUserID, groupNickname: 'secondary' }]
		const atParams : OpenIMCreateTextAtMessageParams = { text: '@secondary hello from unixsdk public automation', atUserIDList: [config.secondaryUserID], atUsersInfo: atUsersInfo, quoteMessage: sentTextMessage }
		const atMessage = await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createTextAtMessage', createTextAtMessage(atParams, 'uvue_auto_create_text_at'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const sentAtMessage = await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateTextAtMessage', atMessage, '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_text_at', false)
		if (sentAtMessage != null) {
			try {
				requireAutomationTextAtUsersInfo(sentAtMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, config.secondaryUserID)
				recordAutomationStep('message-create-send', 'validateTextAtUsersInfo', true, 'atUsersInfo preserved for ' + config.secondaryUserID)
			} catch (error) {
				recordAutomationStep('message-create-send', 'validateTextAtUsersInfo', false, stringifyAPIValue(error))
			}
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('message-create-send', 'validateTextAtUsersInfo', 'sendAfterCreateTextAtMessage returned null')
		}
		const mergeMessages : Array<OpenIMMessageItem> = [sourceMessage]
		const mergeParams : OpenIMCreateMergerMessageParams = { messageList: mergeMessages, title: 'unixsdk public automation merger', abstractList: ['hello from unixsdk public automation'] }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateMergerMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createMergerMessage', createMergerMessage(mergeParams, 'uvue_auto_create_merger'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_merger', false)
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateForwardMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createForwardMessage', createForwardMessage(sourceMessage, 'uvue_auto_create_forward'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_forward', false)
		const customParams : OpenIMCreateCustomMessageParams = { data: '{"source":"unixsdk public automation"}', extension: 'uvue-public-automation', descriptionText: 'uvue public automation custom message' }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateCustomMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createCustomMessage', createCustomMessage(customParams, 'uvue_auto_create_custom'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_custom', false)
		const faceParams : OpenIMCreateFaceMessageParams = { index: 1, data: 'smile' }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateFaceMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createFaceMessage', createFaceMessage(faceParams, 'uvue_auto_create_face'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_face', false)
		const locationParams : OpenIMCreateLocationMessageParams = { descriptionText: 'DCloud test location', longitude: 120.155, latitude: 30.274 }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateLocationMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createLocationMessage', createLocationMessage(locationParams, 'uvue_auto_create_location'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_location', false)
		const cardParams : OpenIMCardElem = { userID: config.secondaryUserID, nickname: 'secondary', faceURL: '', ex: 'uvue-public-card' }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateCardMessage', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createCardMessage', createCardMessage(cardParams, 'uvue_auto_create_card'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_card', false)
		const picture : OpenIMPicture = { uuid: 'uvue-auto-image', type: 'jpg', size: 1, width: 1, height: 1, url: 'https://example.com/image.jpg' }
		const pictureParams : OpenIMPictureElem = { sourcePath: '', sourcePicture: picture, bigPicture: picture, snapshotPicture: picture }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateImageMessageByURL', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createImageMessageByURL', createImageMessageByURL(pictureParams, 'uvue_auto_create_image_url'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_image_url', true)
		const soundParams : OpenIMSoundElem = { uuid: 'uvue-auto-sound', soundPath: '', sourceUrl: 'https://example.com/sound.mp3', dataSize: 1, duration: 1 }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateSoundMessageByURL', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createSoundMessageByURL', createSoundMessageByURL(soundParams, 'uvue_auto_create_sound_url'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_sound_url', true)
		const videoParams : OpenIMVideoElem = { videoPath: '', videoUUID: 'uvue-auto-video', videoUrl: 'https://example.com/video.mp4', videoType: 'mp4', videoSize: 1, duration: 1, snapshotPath: '', snapshotUUID: 'uvue-auto-snapshot', snapshotSize: 1, snapshotUrl: 'https://example.com/snapshot.jpg', snapshotWidth: 1, snapshotHeight: 1 }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateVideoMessageByURL', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createVideoMessageByURL', createVideoMessageByURL(videoParams, 'uvue_auto_create_video_url'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_video_url', true)
		const fileParams : OpenIMFileElem = { filePath: '', uuid: 'uvue-auto-file', sourceUrl: 'https://example.com/file.txt', fileName: 'file.txt', fileSize: 1 }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateFileMessageByURL', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createFileMessageByURL', createFileMessageByURL(fileParams, 'uvue_auto_create_file_url'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_file_url', true)
		automationSendMessageProgressExpected = true
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateImageMessageFromFullPath', await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createImageMessageFromFullPath', createImageMessageFromFullPath(automationFixedImageFullPath, 'uvue_auto_create_image_full_path'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage, 'iOS simulator may reject generated image fixture metadata'), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_image_full_path', false)
		const localSoundParams : OpenIMCreateSoundMessageParams = { soundPath: automationFixedSoundFullPath, duration: 2 }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateSoundMessageFromFullPath', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createSoundMessageFromFullPath', createSoundMessageFromFullPath(localSoundParams, 'uvue_auto_create_sound_full_path'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_sound_full_path', false)
		const localVideoParams : OpenIMCreateVideoMessageParams = { videoPath: automationFixedVideoFullPath, videoType: 'mp4', duration: 1, snapshotPath: automationFixedVideoSnapshotFullPath }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateVideoMessageFromFullPath', await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createVideoMessageFromFullPath', createVideoMessageFromFullPath(localVideoParams, 'uvue_auto_create_video_full_path'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage, 'iOS simulator may reject generated video fixture metadata'), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_video_full_path', false)
		const localFileParams : OpenIMCreateFileMessageParams = { filePath: automationFixedFileFullPath, fileName: demoFixedFileName }
		await sendAutomationCreatedMessage('sendAfterCreateFileMessageFromFullPath', await runAutomationContinueStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-create', 'createFileMessageFromFullPath', createFileMessageFromFullPath(localFileParams, 'uvue_auto_create_file_full_path'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage), '', groupID, 'uvue_auto_send_created_file_full_path', false)
		await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('message-create-send', 'dismissGroup', dismissGroup(groupID, 'uvue_auto_dismiss_create_send_group'), noCache, 'create-send group cleanup failed')
	}

	async function runAutomationMessageSendSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_message_send')
		const message = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-send', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('sendMessage from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_create_send_text'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const sendOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_send_text', message: message as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
		const sendClientMsgID = message != null && message.clientMsgID != null ? message.clientMsgID as string : ''
		const secondarySendCursor = await captureAutomationPeerSettledCursor('secondary')
		beginAutomationOperation('sendMessage', sendClientMsgID, false)
		const sent = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-send', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(sendOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
		const sentClientMsgID = sent.clientMsgID != null ? sent.clientMsgID as string : ''
		completeAutomationOperation('sendMessage', sentClientMsgID)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnRecvNewMessage', 'sendMessage', secondarySendCursor, 'sendMessage secondary delivery', 'sendMessage from unixsdk public automation')
		const notOssMessage = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-send', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('sendMessageNotOss from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_create_send_not_oss_text'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const notOssOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_send_text_not_oss', message: notOssMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
		const notOssClientMsgID = notOssMessage != null && notOssMessage.clientMsgID != null ? notOssMessage.clientMsgID as string : ''
		const secondaryNotOssCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('secondary')
		beginAutomationOperation('sendMessageNotOss', notOssClientMsgID, false)
		const sentNotOss = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-send', 'sendMessageNotOss', sendMessageNotOss(notOssOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
		const sentNotOssClientMsgID = sentNotOss.clientMsgID != null ? sentNotOss.clientMsgID as string : ''
		completeAutomationOperation('sendMessageNotOss', sentNotOssClientMsgID)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnRecvNewMessage', 'sendMessageNotOss', secondaryNotOssCursor, 'sendMessageNotOss secondary delivery')
		const progressParams : OpenIMCreateFileMessageParams = { filePath: automationFixedFileFullPath, fileName: demoFixedFileName }
		const progressMessage = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-send', 'createFileMessageFromFullPath', createFileMessageFromFullPath(progressParams, 'uvue_auto_create_send_progress_file'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const progressClientMsgID = progressMessage != null && progressMessage.clientMsgID != null ? progressMessage.clientMsgID as string : ''
		const progressOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_send_progress_file', message: progressMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
		const previousProgressCount = readAutomationEventCount('onSendMessageProgress')
		const secondaryProgressCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('secondary')
		beginAutomationOperation('sendMessage', progressClientMsgID, true)
		const sentProgress = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-send', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(progressOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
		const sentProgressClientMsgID = sentProgress.clientMsgID != null ? sentProgress.clientMsgID as string : ''
		completeAutomationOperation('sendMessage', sentProgressClientMsgID)
		if (!await waitAutomationEventCountIncrease('onSendMessageProgress', previousProgressCount, 5000)) { throw new Error('sendMessage did not emit progress for a unique local file') }
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnRecvNewMessage', 'sendMessage', secondaryProgressCursor, 'sendMessage local-file secondary delivery', null, true)
		const id = sentClientMsgID
		if (id.length > 0) {
			cachedClientMsgID = id
		}
		await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_message_send_readback')
		try {
			const secondaryConversationParams : OpenIMGetOneConversationParams = { sourceID: config.primaryUserID, sessionType: OpenIMSessionTypeSingle }
			const secondaryConversationID = await runAutomationStep<string>('message-send', 'getConversationIDBySessionType', getConversationIDBySessionType(secondaryConversationParams, 'uvue_auto_secondary_message_conversation'), noCache)
			let sentObserved = false
			let notOssObserved = false
			const historyStartedAt = Date.now()
			let historyAttempt = 0
			while (Date.now() - historyStartedAt < automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds && (!sentObserved || !notOssObserved)) {
				try {
					const historyParams : OpenIMGetAdvancedHistoryMessageListParams = { conversationID: secondaryConversationID, startClientMsgID: '', count: 40 }
					const history = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null>(getAdvancedHistoryMessageList(historyParams, 'uvue_auto_secondary_message_history_' + historyAttempt.toString()), 'message-send/getAdvancedHistoryMessageList', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
					if (history != null) {
						let index = 0
						while (index < (history as OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult).messageList.length) {
							const item = (history as OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult).messageList[index]
							if (item.clientMsgID == sentClientMsgID) { sentObserved = true }
							if (item.clientMsgID == sentNotOssClientMsgID) { notOssObserved = true }
							index = index + 1
						}
					}
				} catch (_error) {
				}
				historyAttempt = historyAttempt + 1
				if (!sentObserved || !notOssObserved) { await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds) }
			}
			if (sentObserved) {
				recordAutomationSideEffect('message-send', 'sendMessagePeerReadback', 'secondary account history contained the exact sent message identity', true, 'sendMessage')
			} else {
				recordAutomationStep('message-send', 'sendMessagePeerReadback', false, 'secondary account history did not contain the exact sent message identity before timeout')
			}
			if (notOssObserved) {
				recordAutomationSideEffect('message-send', 'sendMessageNotOssPeerReadback', 'secondary account history contained the exact sent message identity', true, 'sendMessageNotOss')
			} else {
				recordAutomationStep('message-send', 'sendMessageNotOssPeerReadback', false, 'secondary account history did not contain the exact sent message identity before timeout')
			}
		} finally {
			await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_message_send_done')
		}
	}

	async function waitAutomationConversationMutation(params : OpenIMGetOneConversationParams, expectedPinned : boolean, expectedEx : string, expectedDraft : string, operationID : string) : Promise<OpenIMConversationItem> {
		const startedAt = Date.now()
		let attempt = 0
		while (true) {
			const remainingMilliseconds = automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds - (Date.now() - startedAt)
			if (remainingMilliseconds <= 0) { break }
			const attemptTimeoutMilliseconds = remainingMilliseconds < automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds ? remainingMilliseconds : automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds
			try {
				const value = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMConversationItem | null>(getOneConversation(params, operationID + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'conversation/getOneConversation', attemptTimeoutMilliseconds)
				if (value != null) {
					const conversation = value as OpenIMConversationItem
					if (conversation.isPinned == expectedPinned && conversation.ex == expectedEx && conversation.draftText == expectedDraft) {
						return conversation
					}
				}
			} catch (error) {
				console.log('conversation mutation readback pending')
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			const pollRemainingMilliseconds = automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds - (Date.now() - startedAt)
			if (pollRemainingMilliseconds <= 0) { break }
			const pollMilliseconds = pollRemainingMilliseconds < automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds ? pollRemainingMilliseconds : automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds
			await sleepAutomation(pollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('conversation mutation did not become observable before timeout')
	}

	function readAutomationPeerMessage(result : UTSJSONObject, label : string) : OpenIMMessageItem {
		const encodedMessage = JSON.stringify(result['message'])
		if (encodedMessage == null) { throw new Error(label + ' peer send returned no message') }
		const message = JSON.parseObject<OpenIMMessageItem>(encodedMessage as string)
		if (message == null || message.clientMsgID == null || (message.clientMsgID as string).length == 0) {
			throw new Error(label + ' peer send returned no concrete clientMsgID')
		}
		return message as OpenIMMessageItem
	}

	async function sendAutomationPeerUnreadMessageToPrimary(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig, label : string) : Promise<OpenIMMessageItem> {
		const payload : UTSJSONObject = {
			recvID: config.primaryUserID,
			text: 'unread readback from unixsdk public automation',
			operationID: 'uvue_auto_' + label + '_peer_send'
		}
		const result = await runAutomationPeerCommand('send_text', buildAutomationPeerPayload('secondary', payload), automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
		return readAutomationPeerMessage(result, label)
	}

	async function waitAutomationConversationUnreadCount(params : OpenIMGetOneConversationParams, expectPositive : boolean, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<number> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		let lastUnreadCount = -1
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const conversation = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMConversationItem | null>(getOneConversation(params, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'conversation/getOneConversationUnreadReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
			if (conversation != null) {
				lastUnreadCount = conversation.unreadCount
				if ((expectPositive && lastUnreadCount > 0) || (!expectPositive && lastUnreadCount == 0)) { return lastUnreadCount }
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('conversation unreadCount did not reach the expected state; last=' + lastUnreadCount.toString())
	}

	async function runAutomationConversationSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_conversation')
		const conversationParams : OpenIMGetOneConversationParams = { sourceID: config.secondaryUserID, sessionType: OpenIMSessionTypeSingle }
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'getConversationIDBySessionType', getConversationIDBySessionType(conversationParams, 'uvue_auto_conversation_id'), cacheAutomationConversationID)
		const originalConversation = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMConversationItem | null>('conversation', 'getOneConversation', getOneConversation(conversationParams, 'uvue_auto_one_conversation'), (value : OpenIMConversationItem | null) => { if (value != null) { cachedConversation = value } })
		if (originalConversation == null) { throw new Error('getOneConversation returned null before conversation mutation') }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMConversationListResult | null>('conversation', 'getMultipleConversation', getMultipleConversation([automationConversationID], 'uvue_auto_multiple_conversation'), cacheConversationList)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMConversationListResult | null>('conversation', 'getConversationListSplit', getConversationListSplit(defaultPageParams(), 'uvue_auto_conversation_page'), cacheConversationList)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMConversationListResult | null>('conversation', 'getAllConversationList', getAllConversationList('uvue_auto_all_conversations'), cacheConversationList)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMConversationListResult | null>('conversation', 'searchConversation', searchConversation(config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_search_conversation'), cacheConversationList)
		await runAutomationStep<number | null>('conversation', 'getTotalUnreadMsgCount', getTotalUnreadMsgCount('uvue_auto_total_unread'), noCache)
		const originalConversationEx = originalConversation.ex
		const originalConversationDraft = originalConversation.draftText
		const setConversationParams : OpenIMSetConversationParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, isPinned: !originalConversation.isPinned, ex: 'uvue-public-automation-' + new Date().getTime().toString() }
		const draftParams : OpenIMSetConversationDraftParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, draftText: 'draft from unixsdk public automation' }
		const restoreConversationParams : OpenIMSetConversationParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, isPinned: originalConversation.isPinned, ex: originalConversationEx }
		const restoreDraftParams : OpenIMSetConversationDraftParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, draftText: originalConversationDraft }
		let conversationMutationStarted = false
		try {
			const conversationChangedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onConversationChanged')
			beginAutomationOperation('setConversation', automationConversationID, true)
			conversationMutationStarted = true
			await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'setConversation', setConversation(setConversationParams, 'uvue_auto_set_conversation'), noCache)
			completeAutomationOperation('setConversation', automationConversationID)
			await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('setConversation', 'onConversationChanged', conversationChangedCount)
			const conversationFieldsReadback = await waitAutomationConversationMutation(conversationParams, setConversationParams.isPinned as boolean, setConversationParams.ex as string, originalConversationDraft, 'uvue_auto_set_conversation_readback')
			cachedConversation = conversationFieldsReadback
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('conversation', 'setConversation', true, 'getOneConversation returned expected ex and isPinned before draft mutation', mutationAutomationEvidence('setConversation', 'conversation-fields-updated', 'read-after-write-observed', false))

			await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'setConversationDraft', setConversationDraft(draftParams, 'uvue_auto_set_draft'), noCache)
			const conversationDraftReadback = await waitAutomationConversationMutation(conversationParams, setConversationParams.isPinned as boolean, setConversationParams.ex as string, draftParams.draftText, 'uvue_auto_set_draft_readback')
			cachedConversation = conversationDraftReadback
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('conversation', 'setConversationDraft', true, 'getOneConversation returned expected draftText after draft mutation', mutationAutomationEvidence('setConversationDraft', 'conversation-draft-updated', 'read-after-write-observed', false))
		} finally {
			if (conversationMutationStarted) {
				let restoreMatched = false
				try {
					await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'setConversationRestore', setConversation(restoreConversationParams, 'uvue_auto_restore_conversation'), noCache)
					await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'setConversationDraftRestore', setConversationDraft(restoreDraftParams, 'uvue_auto_restore_draft'), noCache)
					const restoredConversation = await waitAutomationConversationMutation(conversationParams, originalConversation.isPinned, originalConversationEx, originalConversationDraft, 'uvue_auto_restore_conversation_readback')
					cachedConversation = restoredConversation
					restoreMatched = restoredConversation.isPinned == originalConversation.isPinned && restoredConversation.ex == originalConversationEx && restoredConversation.draftText == originalConversationDraft
				} finally {
					recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('conversation', 'setConversation', 'restore-via-read-before-write', 'conversation-fields-restored', 'original isPinned/ex', restoreMatched ? 'original isPinned/ex' : 'restore not observed', restoreMatched)
					recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('conversation', 'setConversationDraft', 'restore-via-read-before-write', 'conversation-draft-restored', 'original draftText', restoreMatched ? 'original draftText' : 'restore not observed', restoreMatched)
				}
				if (!restoreMatched) { throw new Error('conversation cleanup did not restore the original state') }
			}
		}
		const inputParams : OpenIMInputStateParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, userID: config.secondaryUserID, focus: true }
		let automationAppPlatform = OpenIMPlatformIOS
		// #ifdef APP-ANDROID
		automationAppPlatform = OpenIMPlatformAndroid
		// #endif
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'changeInputStates', changeInputStates(inputParams, 'uvue_auto_change_input'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationPeerInputState('secondary', automationConversationID, config.primaryUserID, automationAppPlatform, true, 'uvue_auto_peer_input_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation', 'changeInputStatesPeerReadback', 'independent secondary Core observed the active app platform input state', false, 'changeInputStates')
		const inputCleanupParams : OpenIMInputStateParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, userID: config.secondaryUserID, focus: false }
		await withAutomationTimeout<string>(changeInputStates(inputCleanupParams, 'uvue_auto_change_input_cleanup'), 'conversation/changeInputStatesCleanup', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
		await waitAutomationPeerInputState('secondary', automationConversationID, config.primaryUserID, automationAppPlatform, false, 'uvue_auto_peer_input_cleanup')
		const historyParams : OpenIMGetAdvancedHistoryMessageListParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, startClientMsgID: '', count: 20 }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null>('conversation', 'getAdvancedHistoryMessageList', getAdvancedHistoryMessageList(historyParams, 'uvue_auto_history'), (value : OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null) => { requireAutomationHistory(value, cachedClientMsgID); cacheHistory(value) })
		const searchParams : OpenIMSearchLocalMessagesParams = { conversationID: automationConversationID, keywordList: ['automation'], keywordListMatchType: 0, senderUserIDList: [], messageTypeList: [OpenIMMessageTypeText], searchTimePosition: 0, searchTimePeriod: 0, pageIndex: 1, count: 20 }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMSearchMessageResult | null>('conversation', 'searchLocalMessages', searchLocalMessages(searchParams, 'uvue_auto_search_local_messages'), noCache)
		if (cachedClientMsgID.length > 0) {
			const findParams : Array<OpenIMFindMessageParams> = [{ conversationID: automationConversationID, clientMsgIDList: [cachedClientMsgID] }]
			await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFindMessageResult | null>('conversation', 'findMessageList', findMessageList(findParams, 'uvue_auto_find_message'), noCache)
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('conversation', 'findMessageList', 'no cached clientMsgID')
		}
		const readReceiptMessage = await sendAutomationPeerUnreadMessageToPrimary(config, 'mark_conversation_read')
		const readReceiptClientMsgID = readReceiptMessage.clientMsgID as string
		const secondaryReadReceiptCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('secondary')
		const unreadBeforeMark = await waitAutomationConversationUnreadCount(conversationParams, true, 'uvue_auto_mark_conversation_read_before')
		beginAutomationOperation('markConversationMessageAsRead', config.primaryUserID + ':' + readReceiptClientMsgID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'markConversationMessageAsRead', markConversationMessageAsRead(automationConversationID, 'uvue_auto_mark_conversation_read'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('markConversationMessageAsRead', config.primaryUserID + ':' + readReceiptClientMsgID)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnRecvC2CReadReceipt', 'markConversationMessageAsRead', secondaryReadReceiptCursor, 'markConversationMessageAsRead sender receipt delivery')
		const unreadAfterMark = await waitAutomationConversationUnreadCount(conversationParams, false, 'uvue_auto_mark_conversation_read_after')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation', 'markConversationMessageAsReadReadback', 'unreadCount changed from ' + unreadBeforeMark.toString() + ' to ' + unreadAfterMark.toString(), false, 'markConversationMessageAsRead')

		await sendAutomationPeerUnreadMessageToPrimary(config, 'mark_all_conversations_read')
		const unreadBeforeMarkAll = await waitAutomationConversationUnreadCount(conversationParams, true, 'uvue_auto_mark_all_read_before')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation', 'markAllConversationMessageAsRead', markAllConversationMessageAsRead('uvue_auto_mark_all_read'), noCache)
		const unreadAfterMarkAll = await waitAutomationConversationUnreadCount(conversationParams, false, 'uvue_auto_mark_all_read_after')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation', 'markAllConversationMessageAsReadReadback', 'unreadCount changed from ' + unreadBeforeMarkAll.toString() + ' to ' + unreadAfterMarkAll.toString(), false, 'markAllConversationMessageAsRead')
	}

	async function runAutomationMessageStorageSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_message_storage')
		const storageConversationParams : OpenIMGetOneConversationParams = { sourceID: config.secondaryUserID, sessionType: OpenIMSessionTypeSingle }
		await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'getConversationIDBySessionType', getConversationIDBySessionType(storageConversationParams, 'uvue_auto_storage_conversation_id'), cacheAutomationConversationID)
		const localMessage = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-storage', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('local ex from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_storage_local_ex_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const sendOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_storage_local_ex_send', message: localMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
		const sentLocal = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-storage', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(sendOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
		const localKey = messageKeyFromMessage(sentLocal)
		if (localKey == null) { throw new Error('setMessageLocalEx requires a concrete message key') }
		const localExParams : OpenIMSetMessageLocalExParams = { conversationID: localKey.conversationID, clientMsgID: localKey.clientMsgID, localEx: 'uvue-public-local-ex' }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(localKey.conversationID, localKey.clientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_set_local_ex_precondition')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'setMessageLocalEx', setMessageLocalEx(localExParams, 'uvue_auto_set_local_ex'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationMessageLocalEx(localKey, localExParams.localEx, 'uvue_auto_set_local_ex_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('message-storage', 'setMessageLocalExReadback', 'history returned the expected localEx for the exact clientMsgID', false, 'setMessageLocalEx')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'deleteMessageFromLocalStorage', deleteMessageFromLocalStorage(localKey, 'uvue_auto_delete_local_message'), noCache)
		try {
			await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(localKey.conversationID, localKey.clientMsgID, false, null, 'uvue_auto_delete_local_message_readback')
			recordAutomationSideEffect('message-storage', 'deleteMessageFromLocalStorageReadback', 'history omitted the exact locally deleted clientMsgID', false, 'deleteMessageFromLocalStorage')
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationSideEffectFailure('message-storage', 'deleteMessageFromLocalStorageReadback', stringifyAPIValue(error), 'deleteMessageFromLocalStorage')
		}

		const revokeMessageTarget = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-storage', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('revoke from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_revoke_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const revokeOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_revoke_send', message: revokeMessageTarget as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
		const sentRevoke = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-storage', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(revokeOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
		const revokeKey = messageKeyFromMessage(sentRevoke)
		if (revokeKey == null) { throw new Error('revokeMessage requires a concrete message key') }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(revokeKey.conversationID, revokeKey.clientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_revoke_precondition')
		const revokeEventCount = readAutomationEventCount('onNewRecvMessageRevoked')
		beginAutomationOperation('revokeMessage', revokeKey.clientMsgID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'revokeMessage', revokeMessage(revokeKey, 'uvue_auto_revoke_message'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('revokeMessage', revokeKey.clientMsgID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('revokeMessage', 'onNewRecvMessageRevoked', revokeEventCount)
		try {
			await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(revokeKey.conversationID, revokeKey.clientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeRevokeMessage, 'uvue_auto_revoke_message_readback')
			recordAutomationSideEffect('message-storage', 'revokeMessageReadback', 'history returned the exact clientMsgID as a revoke notification', false, 'revokeMessage')
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationSideEffectFailure('message-storage', 'revokeMessageReadback', stringifyAPIValue(error), 'revokeMessage')
		}

		const deleteMessageTarget = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-storage', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('delete from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_delete_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const deleteOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_delete_send', message: deleteMessageTarget as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
		const sentDelete = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-storage', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(deleteOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
		const deleteKey = messageKeyFromMessage(sentDelete)
		if (deleteKey == null) { throw new Error('deleteMessage requires a concrete message key') }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(deleteKey.conversationID, deleteKey.clientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_delete_message_precondition')
		const deleteEventCount = readAutomationEventCount('onMsgDeleted')
		beginAutomationOperation('deleteMessage', deleteKey.clientMsgID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'deleteMessage', deleteMessage(deleteKey, 'uvue_auto_delete_message'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('deleteMessage', deleteKey.clientMsgID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('deleteMessage', 'onMsgDeleted', deleteEventCount)
		try {
			await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(deleteKey.conversationID, deleteKey.clientMsgID, false, null, 'uvue_auto_delete_message_readback')
			recordAutomationSideEffect('message-storage', 'deleteMessageReadback', 'history omitted the exact server-deleted clientMsgID', false, 'deleteMessage')
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationSideEffectFailure('message-storage', 'deleteMessageReadback', stringifyAPIValue(error), 'deleteMessage')
		}

		const insertMessage = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-storage', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('insert from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_insert_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const singleParams : OpenIMInsertSingleMessageParams = { message: insertMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, sendID: config.primaryUserID }
		const insertSingleResult = await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'insertSingleMessageToLocalStorage', insertSingleMessageToLocalStorage(singleParams, 'uvue_auto_insert_single'), noCache)
		const insertedSingleMessage = parseAutomationInsertedMessageJSON(insertSingleResult, 'insertSingleMessageToLocalStorage')
		try {
			await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, insertedSingleMessage.clientMsgID as string, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_insert_single_readback')
			recordAutomationSemanticEvidence('message-storage', 'insertSingleMessageToLocalStorageReadback', 'history returned the inserted single message with exact generated clientMsgID', 'insertSingleMessageToLocalStorage')
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationSideEffectFailure('message-storage', 'insertSingleMessageToLocalStorageReadback', stringifyAPIValue(error), 'insertSingleMessageToLocalStorage')
		}
		let groupID = ''
		const groupInfo : OpenIMCreateGroupInfo = { groupName: 'uvue public storage ' + new Date().getTime().toString(), groupType: 2, ex: 'uvue-public-storage-group' }
		const groupParams : OpenIMCreateGroupParams = { groupInfo: groupInfo, memberUserIDs: [config.secondaryUserID], adminUserIDs: [] }
		const group = await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMGroupItem | null>('message-storage', 'createGroup', createGroup(groupParams, 'uvue_auto_storage_group'), noCache, 'group storage setup failed')
		if (group != null) {
			groupID = (group as OpenIMGroupItem).groupID
			const seedMessage = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-storage', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('group storage seed from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_storage_group_seed_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
			const seedOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_storage_group_seed_send', message: seedMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: '', groupID: groupID, isOnlineOnly: false }
			await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-storage', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(seedOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
			await sleepAutomation(500)
			const groupMessageParams : OpenIMInsertGroupMessageParams = { message: insertMessage as OpenIMMessageItem, groupID: groupID, sendID: config.primaryUserID }
			const groupConversationParams : OpenIMGetOneConversationParams = { sourceID: groupID, sessionType: OpenIMSessionTypeGroup }
			const groupConversationID = await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'getConversationIDBySessionType', getConversationIDBySessionType(groupConversationParams, 'uvue_auto_storage_group_conversation_id'), noCache)
			const insertGroupResult = await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorage', insertGroupMessageToLocalStorage(groupMessageParams, 'uvue_auto_insert_group'), noCache)
			const insertedGroupMessage = parseAutomationInsertedMessageJSON(insertGroupResult, 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorage')
			try {
				await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(groupConversationID, insertedGroupMessage.clientMsgID as string, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_insert_group_readback')
				recordAutomationSemanticEvidence('message-storage', 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorageReadback', 'history returned the inserted group message with exact generated clientMsgID', 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorage')
			} catch (error) {
				recordAutomationSideEffectFailure('message-storage', 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorageReadback', stringifyAPIValue(error), 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorage')
			}

			await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'deleteAllMsgFromLocal', deleteAllMsgFromLocal('uvue_auto_delete_all_local'), noCache)
			try {
				await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, insertedSingleMessage.clientMsgID as string, false, null, 'uvue_auto_delete_all_local_single_readback')
				await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(groupConversationID, insertedGroupMessage.clientMsgID as string, false, null, 'uvue_auto_delete_all_local_group_readback')
				recordAutomationSideEffect('message-storage', 'deleteAllMsgFromLocalReadback', 'single and group histories omitted both exact locally deleted clientMsgIDs', false, 'deleteAllMsgFromLocal')
			} catch (error) {
				recordAutomationSideEffectFailure('message-storage', 'deleteAllMsgFromLocalReadback', stringifyAPIValue(error), 'deleteAllMsgFromLocal')
			}

			const serverDeleteSingleDraft = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-storage', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('server delete all single seed from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_single_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
			const serverDeleteSingleOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_single_send', message: serverDeleteSingleDraft as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
			const serverDeleteSingle = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-storage', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(serverDeleteSingleOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
			const serverDeleteSingleID = serverDeleteSingle.clientMsgID == null ? '' : serverDeleteSingle.clientMsgID as string
			if (serverDeleteSingleID.length == 0) { throw new Error('deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvr requires a single-message clientMsgID') }
			await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, serverDeleteSingleID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_single_precondition')
			const serverDeleteGroupDraft = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('message-storage', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage('server delete all group seed from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_group_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
			const serverDeleteGroupOptions : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_group_send', message: serverDeleteGroupDraft as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: '', groupID: groupID, isOnlineOnly: false }
			const serverDeleteGroup = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('message-storage', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(serverDeleteGroupOptions), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
			const serverDeleteGroupID = serverDeleteGroup.clientMsgID == null ? '' : serverDeleteGroup.clientMsgID as string
			if (serverDeleteGroupID.length == 0) { throw new Error('deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvr requires a group-message clientMsgID') }
			await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(groupConversationID, serverDeleteGroupID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_group_precondition')
			await runAutomationStep<string>('message-storage', 'deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvr', deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvr('uvue_auto_delete_all_server'), noCache)
			try {
				await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, serverDeleteSingleID, false, null, 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_single_readback')
				await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(groupConversationID, serverDeleteGroupID, false, null, 'uvue_auto_delete_all_server_group_readback')
				recordAutomationSideEffect('message-storage', 'deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvrReadback', 'single and group histories omitted both exact server-deleted clientMsgIDs', false, 'deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvr')
			} catch (error) {
				recordAutomationSideEffectFailure('message-storage', 'deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvrReadback', stringifyAPIValue(error), 'deleteAllMsgFromLocalAndSvr')
			}
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('message-storage', 'dismissGroup', dismissGroup(groupID, 'uvue_auto_storage_group_dismiss'), noCache, 'storage group cleanup failed')
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('message-storage', 'insertGroupMessageToLocalStorage', 'storage group setup failed')
		}
	}

	async function waitAutomationFriendState(friendUserID : string, expectedPresent : boolean, expectedEx : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const params : OpenIMGetSpecifiedFriendsInfoParams = { userIDList: [friendUserID], filterBlack: false }
			try {
				const value = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMFriendListResult | null>(getSpecifiedFriendsInfo(params, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'friend/getSpecifiedFriendsInfoReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
				let found = false
				let exMatched = expectedEx.length == 0
				if (value != null) {
					let index = 0
					while (index < value.friends.length) {
						const friend = value.friends[index]
						if (friend.userID == friendUserID) {
							found = true
							exMatched = expectedEx.length == 0 || friend.ex == expectedEx
						}
						index = index + 1
					}
				}
				if (found == expectedPresent && (!expectedPresent || exMatched)) { return }
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('friend state did not match before timeout')
	}

	async function clearAutomationPendingFriendApplication(fromUserID : string, toUserID : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const applications = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMFriendApplicationListResult | null>(getFriendApplicationListAsRecipient(defaultApplicationParams(), operationPrefix + '_list'), 'friend/cleanupPendingFriendApplicationList', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
		const application = findFriendApplication(applications, fromUserID, toUserID)
		if (application == null || application.handleResult != 0) { return }
		const params : OpenIMFriendApplicationHandleParams = { toUserID: fromUserID, handleMsg: 'cleared by uni-app x public automation' }
		await withAutomationTimeout<string>(refuseFriendApplication(params, operationPrefix + '_refuse'), 'friend/cleanupPendingFriendApplicationRefuse', automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds)
	}

	async function readAutomationFriendPagination(fullFriendList : OpenIMFriendListResult | null, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<OpenIMFriendListResult | null> {
		if (fullFriendList == null) { throw new Error('friend pagination requires a complete friend list') }
		const fullUserIDs : Array<string> = []
		let fullIndex = 0
		while (fullIndex < fullFriendList.friends.length) {
			const userID = fullFriendList.friends[fullIndex].userID
			if (userID.length == 0 || fullUserIDs.indexOf(userID) >= 0) { throw new Error('complete friend list contained an invalid identity') }
			fullUserIDs.push(userID)
			fullIndex = fullIndex + 1
		}
		if (fullUserIDs.length == 0) { throw new Error('friend pagination requires at least one friend') }

		const seenUserIDs : Array<string> = []
		let firstPage : OpenIMFriendListResult | null = null
		let offset = 0
		while (offset < fullUserIDs.length) {
			const pageParams : OpenIMPageParams = { offset: offset, count: 1 }
			const page = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMFriendListResult | null>(getFriendListPage(pageParams, operationPrefix + '_' + offset.toString()), 'friend/getFriendListPagePartition', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
			if (page == null || page.friends.length != 1) { throw new Error('friend page did not honor count=1') }
			const friend = page.friends[0]
			if (friend.userID.length == 0 || seenUserIDs.indexOf(friend.userID) >= 0) { throw new Error('friend pages contained an invalid or duplicate identity') }
			if (fullUserIDs.indexOf(friend.userID) < 0) { throw new Error('friend page contained an identity outside the complete list') }
			seenUserIDs.push(friend.userID)
			if (offset == 0) { firstPage = page }
			offset = offset + 1
		}

		const tailParams : OpenIMPageParams = { offset: fullUserIDs.length, count: 1 }
		const tail = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMFriendListResult | null>(getFriendListPage(tailParams, operationPrefix + '_tail'), 'friend/getFriendListPageTail', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
		if (tail == null || tail.friends.length != 0) { throw new Error('friend pagination tail was not empty') }
		if (seenUserIDs.length != fullUserIDs.length) { throw new Error('friend pages did not cover the complete friend list') }
		return firstPage
	}

	async function waitAutomationFriendPagination(fullFriendList : OpenIMFriendListResult | null, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<OpenIMFriendListResult | null> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			try {
				return await readAutomationFriendPagination(fullFriendList, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString())
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('friend pagination did not converge before timeout')
	}

	async function waitAutomationBlackState(userID : string, expectedPresent : boolean, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			try {
				const value = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMBlackListResult | null>(getBlackList(operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'friend/getBlackListReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
				let found = false
				if (value != null) {
					let index = 0
					while (index < value.blackUsers.length) {
						if (value.blackUsers[index].userID == userID) { found = true }
						index = index + 1
					}
				}
				if (found == expectedPresent) { return }
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('black-list state did not match before timeout')
	}

	async function runAutomationFriendSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_friend_cleanup')
		await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('friend', 'deleteFriend', deleteFriend(config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_friend_cleanup_delete'), noCache, 'friend may not exist before automation')
		await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_friend_cleanup')
		await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('friend', 'deleteFriend', deleteFriend(config.primaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_friend_cleanup_delete_secondary'), noCache, 'friend may not exist before automation')
		await clearAutomationPendingFriendApplication(config.primaryUserID, config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_friend_cleanup_application')
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_friend_reject')
		const rejectAddParams : OpenIMAddFriendParams = { toUserID: config.secondaryUserID, reqMsg: 'friend reject request from unixsdk public automation', ex: 'uvue-public-friend-reject' }
		const secondaryRejectAddCursor = await captureAutomationPeerSettledCursor('secondary')
		beginAutomationOperation('addFriend', config.primaryUserID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'addFriend', addFriend(rejectAddParams, 'uvue_auto_friend_add_reject'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('addFriend', config.primaryUserID)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnFriendApplicationAdded', 'addFriend', secondaryRejectAddCursor, 'addFriend reject request delivery')
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFriendApplicationListResult | null>('friend', 'getFriendApplicationListAsApplicant', getFriendApplicationListAsApplicant(defaultApplicationParams(), 'uvue_auto_friend_apps_applicant_reject'), cacheFriendApplications)
		await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_friend_reject')
		const recipientReject = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFriendApplicationListResult | null>('friend', 'getFriendApplicationListAsRecipient', getFriendApplicationListAsRecipient(defaultApplicationParams(), 'uvue_auto_friend_apps_recipient_reject'), cacheFriendApplications)
		const rejectApplication = findFriendApplication(recipientReject, config.primaryUserID, config.secondaryUserID)
		if (rejectApplication != null) {
			const rejectHandle : OpenIMFriendApplicationHandleParams = { toUserID: config.primaryUserID, handleMsg: 'refused by uni-app x public automation' }
			const primaryRejectCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
			beginAutomationOperation('refuseFriendApplication', config.primaryUserID, true)
			await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'refuseFriendApplication', refuseFriendApplication(rejectHandle, 'uvue_auto_friend_refuse'), noCache)
			completeAutomationOperation('refuseFriendApplication', config.primaryUserID)
			await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnFriendApplicationRejected', 'refuseFriendApplication', primaryRejectCursor, 'refuseFriendApplication applicant delivery')
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('friend', 'refuseFriendApplication', 'friend application not found')
		}
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_friend_accept')
		const acceptAddParams : OpenIMAddFriendParams = { toUserID: config.secondaryUserID, reqMsg: 'friend accept request from unixsdk public automation', ex: 'uvue-public-friend-accept' }
		const secondaryAcceptAddCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('secondary')
		beginAutomationOperation('addFriend', config.primaryUserID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'addFriend', addFriend(acceptAddParams, 'uvue_auto_friend_add_accept'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('addFriend', config.primaryUserID)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnFriendApplicationAdded', 'addFriend', secondaryAcceptAddCursor, 'addFriend accept request delivery')
		await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_friend_accept')
		const recipientAccept = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFriendApplicationListResult | null>('friend', 'getFriendApplicationListAsRecipient', getFriendApplicationListAsRecipient(defaultApplicationParams(), 'uvue_auto_friend_apps_recipient_accept'), cacheFriendApplications)
		const acceptApplication = findFriendApplication(recipientAccept, config.primaryUserID, config.secondaryUserID)
		if (acceptApplication != null) {
			const acceptHandle : OpenIMFriendApplicationHandleParams = { toUserID: config.primaryUserID, handleMsg: 'accepted by uni-app x public automation' }
			const friendAddedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onFriendAdded')
			const friendApplicationAcceptedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onFriendApplicationAccepted')
			beginAutomationOperation('acceptFriendApplication', config.primaryUserID, true)
			await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'acceptFriendApplication', acceptFriendApplication(acceptHandle, 'uvue_auto_friend_accept'), noCache)
			completeAutomationOperation('acceptFriendApplication', config.secondaryUserID)
			await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('acceptFriendApplication', 'onFriendAdded', friendAddedCount)
			await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('acceptFriendApplication', 'onFriendApplicationAccepted', friendApplicationAcceptedCount)
			recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('acceptFriendApplication', ['onFriendAdded', 'onFriendApplicationAccepted'])
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('friend', 'acceptFriendApplication', 'friend application not found')
		}
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_friend_verify')
		await waitAutomationFriendState(config.secondaryUserID, true, '', 'uvue_auto_friend_accept_readback')
		const fullFriendList = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFriendListResult | null>('friend', 'getFriendList', getFriendList(false, 'uvue_auto_friend_list'), cacheFriends)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFriendListResult | null>('friend', 'getFriendListPage', waitAutomationFriendPagination(fullFriendList, 'uvue_auto_friend_page'), cacheFriends, responseAutomationEvidence('getFriendListPage', 'count-one-pages-partition-full-friend-list'))
		const searchParams : OpenIMSearchFriendsParams = { keywordList: [config.secondaryUserID], isSearchUserID: true, isSearchNickname: true, isSearchRemark: true }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFriendListResult | null>('friend', 'searchFriends', searchFriends(searchParams, 'uvue_auto_search_friends'), cacheFriends)
		const specifiedParams : OpenIMGetSpecifiedFriendsInfoParams = { userIDList: [config.secondaryUserID], filterBlack: false }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMFriendListResult | null>('friend', 'getSpecifiedFriendsInfo', getSpecifiedFriendsInfo(specifiedParams, 'uvue_auto_specified_friends'), cacheFriends)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMCheckFriendResult | null>('friend', 'checkFriend', checkFriend([config.secondaryUserID], 'uvue_auto_check_friend'), (value : OpenIMCheckFriendResult | null) => { requireAutomationCheckFriend(value, config.secondaryUserID) })
		await runAutomationStep<number | null>('friend', 'getFriendApplicationUnhandledCount', getFriendApplicationUnhandledCount(defaultPageParams(), 'uvue_auto_friend_app_count'), noCache)
		const updateParams : OpenIMUpdateFriendsParams = { friendUserIDs: [config.secondaryUserID], ex: 'uvue-public-update-friend-' + Date.now().toString() }
		const friendInfoChangedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onFriendInfoChanged')
		beginAutomationOperation('updateFriends', config.secondaryUserID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'updateFriends', updateFriends(updateParams, 'uvue_auto_update_friends'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('updateFriends', config.secondaryUserID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('updateFriends', 'onFriendInfoChanged', friendInfoChangedCount)
		await waitAutomationFriendState(config.secondaryUserID, true, updateParams.ex as string, 'uvue_auto_update_friends_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('friend', 'updateFriendsReadback', 'specified friend returned the exact updated ex', false, 'updateFriends')
		const addBlackParams : OpenIMAddBlackParams = { toUserID: config.secondaryUserID, ex: 'uvue-public-add-black' }
		const primaryBlackCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
		beginAutomationOperation('addBlack', config.secondaryUserID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'addBlack', addBlack(addBlackParams, 'uvue_auto_add_black'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('addBlack', config.secondaryUserID)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnBlackAdded', 'addBlack', primaryBlackCursor, 'addBlack actor delivery')
		await waitAutomationBlackState(config.secondaryUserID, true, 'uvue_auto_add_black_readback')
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMBlackListResult | null>('friend', 'getBlackList', getBlackList('uvue_auto_black_list'), noCache)
		const blackDeletedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onBlackDeleted')
		beginAutomationOperation('removeBlack', config.secondaryUserID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'removeBlack', removeBlack(config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_remove_black'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('removeBlack', config.secondaryUserID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('removeBlack', 'onBlackDeleted', blackDeletedCount)
		await waitAutomationBlackState(config.secondaryUserID, false, 'uvue_auto_remove_black_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('friend', 'removeBlackReadback', 'black list excluded the exact removed user', false, 'removeBlack')
		const friendDeletedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onFriendDeleted')
		beginAutomationOperation('deleteFriend', config.secondaryUserID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('friend', 'deleteFriend', deleteFriend(config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_delete_friend'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('deleteFriend', config.secondaryUserID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('deleteFriend', 'onFriendDeleted', friendDeletedCount)
		await waitAutomationFriendState(config.secondaryUserID, false, '', 'uvue_auto_delete_friend_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('friend', 'deleteFriendReadback', 'specified friend list excluded the exact deleted user', false, 'deleteFriend')
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupMembership(groupID : string, userID : string, operationID : string) : Promise<void> {
		const startedAt = Date.now()
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() - startedAt < automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds) {
			try {
				const groups = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMGroupListResult | null>(getSpecifiedGroupsInfo([groupID], operationID + '_group_' + attempt.toString()), 'group/getSpecifiedGroupsInfo', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
				const params : OpenIMGetGroupMemberListParams = { groupID: groupID, filter: 0, offset: 0, count: 100 }
				const members = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMGroupMemberListResult | null>(getGroupMemberList(params, operationID + '_members_' + attempt.toString()), 'group/getGroupMemberList', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
				let groupObserved = false
				if (groups != null) {
					let groupIndex = 0
					while (groupIndex < groups.groups.length) {
						if (groups.groups[groupIndex].groupID == groupID) { groupObserved = true }
						groupIndex = groupIndex + 1
					}
				}
				let memberObserved = false
				if (members != null) {
					let memberIndex = 0
					while (memberIndex < members.members.length) {
						if (members.members[memberIndex].userID == userID) { memberObserved = true }
						memberIndex = memberIndex + 1
					}
				}
				if (groupObserved && memberObserved) { return }
			} catch (error) {
				console.log('quit-group membership precondition pending')
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('secondary account did not observe quit-group membership before ownership transfer')
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupInfoUpdate(params : OpenIMSetGroupInfoParams, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<OpenIMGroupItem> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const value = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMGroupListResult | null>(getSpecifiedGroupsInfo([params.groupID], operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'group/getSpecifiedGroupsInfoReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
			if (value != null && value.groups.length > 0) {
				const group = value.groups[0]
				let matched = group.groupID == params.groupID
				if (params.groupName != null) { matched = matched && group.groupName == params.groupName as string }
				if (params.notification != null) { matched = matched && group.notification == params.notification as string }
				if (params.introduction != null) { matched = matched && group.introduction == params.introduction as string }
				if (params.ex != null) { matched = matched && group.ex == params.ex as string }
				if (params.needVerification != null) { matched = matched && group.needVerification == params.needVerification as number }
				if (matched) { return group }
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('group info mutation did not become observable')
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupOwner(groupID : string, expectedOwnerUserID : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<OpenIMGroupItem> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const value = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMGroupListResult | null>(getSpecifiedGroupsInfo([groupID], operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'group/getSpecifiedGroupsInfoOwnerReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
			if (value != null && value.groups.length > 0) {
				const group = value.groups[0]
				if (group.groupID == groupID && group.ownerUserID == expectedOwnerUserID) { return group }
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('group owner mutation did not become observable')
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupMemberUpdate(params : OpenIMSetGroupMemberInfoParams, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<OpenIMGroupMemberItem> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const query : OpenIMGroupUserListParams = { groupID: params.groupID, userIDList: [params.userID] }
			const value = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMGroupMemberListResult | null>(getSpecifiedGroupMembersInfo(query, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString()), 'group/getSpecifiedGroupMembersInfoReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
			if (value != null && value.members.length > 0) {
				const member = value.members[0]
				let matched = member.groupID == params.groupID && member.userID == params.userID
				if (params.nickname != null) { matched = matched && member.nickname == params.nickname as string }
				if (params.ex != null) { matched = matched && member.ex == params.ex as string }
				if (matched) { return member }
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('group member mutation did not become observable')
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupStatus(groupID : string, expectedStatus : number, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const params : OpenIMSetGroupInfoParams = { groupID: groupID }
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const group = await waitAutomationGroupInfoUpdate(params, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString())
			if (group.status == expectedStatus) { return }
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('group status did not match before timeout')
	}

	async function waitAutomationGroupMemberMute(groupID : string, userID : string, expectedMuted : boolean, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			const params : OpenIMSetGroupMemberInfoParams = { groupID: groupID, userID: userID }
			const member = await waitAutomationGroupMemberUpdate(params, operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString())
			const muted = member.muteEndTime > Date.now()
			if (muted == expectedMuted) { return }
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('group member mute state did not match before timeout')
	}

	async function runAutomationGroupSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_group')
		let groupID = ''
		const groupInfo : OpenIMCreateGroupInfo = { groupName: 'uvue public group ' + new Date().getTime().toString(), groupType: 2, ex: 'uvue-public-group' }
		const groupParams : OpenIMCreateGroupParams = { groupInfo: groupInfo, memberUserIDs: [config.secondaryUserID], adminUserIDs: [] }
		const primaryCreateGroupCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
		const newConversationCount = readAutomationEventCount('onNewConversation')
		beginAutomationOperation('createGroup', null, true)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupItem | null>('group', 'createGroup', createGroup(groupParams, 'uvue_auto_create_group'), (value : OpenIMGroupItem | null) => {
			requireAutomation(value != null, 'createGroup returned null')
			groupID = (value as OpenIMGroupItem).groupID
			cachedGroupID = groupID
		})
		const createGroupWindow = findLatestAutomationOperation('createGroup')
		if (createGroupWindow != null) { createGroupWindow.payloadNeedle = groupID }
		completeAutomationOperation('createGroup', groupID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('createGroup', 'onNewConversation', newConversationCount)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnJoinedGroupAdded', 'createGroup', primaryCreateGroupCursor, 'createGroup owner delivery')
		await sleepAutomation(1000)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupListResult | null>('group', 'getJoinedGroupList', getJoinedGroupList('uvue_auto_joined_groups'), cacheGroups)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupListResult | null>('group', 'getJoinedGroupListPage', getJoinedGroupListPage(defaultPageParams(), 'uvue_auto_joined_group_page'), cacheGroups)
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupListResult | null>('group', 'getSpecifiedGroupsInfo', getSpecifiedGroupsInfo([groupID], 'uvue_auto_specified_group'), cacheGroups)
		const searchGroupsParams : OpenIMSearchGroupsParams = { keywordList: [groupID], isSearchGroupID: true, isSearchGroupName: true }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupListResult | null>('group', 'searchGroups', searchGroups(searchGroupsParams, 'uvue_auto_search_groups'), cacheGroups)
		await runAutomationStep<boolean>('group', 'isJoinGroup', isJoinGroup(groupID, 'uvue_auto_is_join_group'), noCache)
		const membersParams : OpenIMGetGroupMemberListParams = { groupID: groupID, filter: 0, offset: 0, count: 20 }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupMemberListResult | null>('group', 'getGroupMemberList', getGroupMemberList(membersParams, 'uvue_auto_group_members'), cacheGroupMembers)
		const userListParams : OpenIMGroupUserListParams = { groupID: groupID, userIDList: [config.primaryUserID, config.secondaryUserID] }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupMemberListResult | null>('group', 'getSpecifiedGroupMembersInfo', getSpecifiedGroupMembersInfo(userListParams, 'uvue_auto_specified_members'), cacheGroupMembers)
		await runAutomationStep<Array<string> | null>('group', 'getUsersInGroup', getUsersInGroup(userListParams, 'uvue_auto_users_in_group'), noCache)
		const searchMembersParams : OpenIMSearchGroupMembersParams = { groupID: groupID, keywordList: [config.secondaryUserID], isSearchUserID: true, isSearchMemberNickname: true }
		await runAutomationStep<OpenIMGroupMemberListResult | null>('group', 'searchGroupMembers', searchGroupMembers(searchMembersParams, 'uvue_auto_search_members'), cacheGroupMembers)
		const setInfoParams : OpenIMSetGroupInfoParams = { groupID: groupID, groupName: 'uvue public group renamed ' + new Date().getTime().toString(), notification: 'uvue public notice', introduction: 'uvue public intro', ex: 'uvue-public-group-info' }
		const groupInfoChangedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onGroupInfoChanged')
		beginAutomationOperation('setGroupInfo', groupID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'setGroupInfo', setGroupInfo(setInfoParams, 'uvue_auto_set_group_info'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('setGroupInfo', groupID)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('setGroupInfo', 'onGroupInfoChanged', groupInfoChangedCount)
		await waitAutomationGroupInfoUpdate(setInfoParams, 'uvue_auto_set_group_info_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('group', 'setGroupInfoReadback', 'specified group returned the exact updated public fields', false, 'setGroupInfo')
		const setMemberParams : OpenIMSetGroupMemberInfoParams = { groupID: groupID, userID: config.primaryUserID, nickname: 'uvue public owner', ex: 'uvue-public-member' }
		const groupMemberIdentity = groupID + ':' + config.primaryUserID
		const groupMemberInfoChangedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onGroupMemberInfoChanged')
		beginAutomationOperation('setGroupMemberInfo', groupMemberIdentity, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'setGroupMemberInfo', setGroupMemberInfo(setMemberParams, 'uvue_auto_set_member_info'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('setGroupMemberInfo', groupMemberIdentity)
		await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('setGroupMemberInfo', 'onGroupMemberInfoChanged', groupMemberInfoChangedCount)
		await waitAutomationGroupMemberUpdate(setMemberParams, 'uvue_auto_set_member_info_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('group', 'setGroupMemberInfoReadback', 'specified member returned the exact updated nickname and ex', false, 'setGroupMemberInfo')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'changeGroupMute', changeGroupMute({ groupID: groupID, isMute: true }, 'uvue_auto_group_mute'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationGroupStatus(groupID, 3, 'uvue_auto_group_mute_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('group', 'changeGroupMuteReadback', 'specified group returned muted status', false, 'changeGroupMute')
		await withAutomationTimeout<string>(changeGroupMute({ groupID: groupID, isMute: false }, 'uvue_auto_group_mute_restore'), 'group/changeGroupMuteRestore', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
		await waitAutomationGroupStatus(groupID, 0, 'uvue_auto_group_mute_restore_readback')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'changeGroupMemberMute', changeGroupMemberMute({ groupID: groupID, userID: config.secondaryUserID, mutedSeconds: 60 }, 'uvue_auto_member_mute'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationGroupMemberMute(groupID, config.secondaryUserID, true, 'uvue_auto_member_mute_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('group', 'changeGroupMemberMuteReadback', 'specified member returned a future muteEndTime', false, 'changeGroupMemberMute')
		await withAutomationTimeout<string>(changeGroupMemberMute({ groupID: groupID, userID: config.secondaryUserID, mutedSeconds: 0 }, 'uvue_auto_member_mute_restore'), 'group/changeGroupMemberMuteRestore', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
		await waitAutomationGroupMemberMute(groupID, config.secondaryUserID, false, 'uvue_auto_member_mute_restore_readback')
		const kickGroupInfo : OpenIMCreateGroupInfo = { groupName: 'uvue public kick group ' + new Date().getTime().toString(), groupType: 2, ex: 'uvue-public-kick-group' }
		const kickGroupParams : OpenIMCreateGroupParams = { groupInfo: kickGroupInfo, memberUserIDs: [config.secondaryUserID], adminUserIDs: [] }
		const kickGroup = await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMGroupItem | null>('group', 'createGroup', createGroup(kickGroupParams, 'uvue_auto_kick_group_create'), noCache, 'kick group setup failed')
		if (kickGroup != null) {
			const kickGroupID = (kickGroup as OpenIMGroupItem).groupID
			const kickSeedSeq = await seedAutomationGroupConversation(kickGroupID, 'uvue_auto_kick_group_seq_seed')
			const kickParams : OpenIMGroupInviteParams = { groupID: kickGroupID, reason: 'kick from unixsdk public automation', userIDList: [config.secondaryUserID] }
			const groupMemberDeletedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onGroupMemberDeleted')
			beginAutomationOperation('kickGroupMember', kickGroupID, true)
			await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'kickGroupMember', kickGroupMember(kickParams, 'uvue_auto_kick_member'), noCache)
			completeAutomationOperation('kickGroupMember', kickGroupID + ':' + config.secondaryUserID)
			await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('kickGroupMember', 'onGroupMemberDeleted', groupMemberDeletedCount)
			recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('kickGroupMember', ['onGroupMemberDeleted'])
			await waitAutomationGroupHistorySeq(kickGroupID, kickSeedSeq + 1, 'uvue_auto_group_after_kick')
			const inviteParams : OpenIMGroupInviteParams = { groupID: kickGroupID, reason: 'invite from unixsdk public automation', userIDList: [config.secondaryUserID] }
			const secondaryInviteCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('secondary')
			beginAutomationOperation('inviteUserToGroup', kickGroupID, true)
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'inviteUserToGroup', inviteUserToGroup(inviteParams, 'uvue_auto_invite_user'), noCache, 'server/protocol can reject invite after applying member join side effect')
			completeAutomationOperation('inviteUserToGroup', kickGroupID)
			await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnJoinedGroupAdded', 'inviteUserToGroup', secondaryInviteCursor, 'inviteUserToGroup invited-member delivery')
			await waitAutomationGroupHistorySeq(kickGroupID, kickSeedSeq + 2, 'uvue_auto_group_after_invite')
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'dismissGroup', dismissGroup(kickGroupID, 'uvue_auto_dismiss_kick_group'), noCache, 'kick group cleanup failed')
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'kickGroupMember', 'kick group setup failed')
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'inviteUserToGroup', 'kick group setup failed')
		}
		let applyGroupID = ''
		const applyGroupInfo : OpenIMCreateGroupInfo = { groupName: 'uvue public apply group ' + new Date().getTime().toString(), groupType: 2, ex: 'uvue-public-apply-group' }
		const applyGroupParams : OpenIMCreateGroupParams = { groupInfo: applyGroupInfo, memberUserIDs: [], adminUserIDs: [] }
		const applyGroup = await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMGroupItem | null>('group', 'createGroup', createGroup(applyGroupParams, 'uvue_auto_apply_group'), noCache, 'group application setup failed')
		if (applyGroup != null) {
			applyGroupID = (applyGroup as OpenIMGroupItem).groupID
			await seedAutomationGroupConversation(applyGroupID, 'uvue_auto_apply_group_seq_seed')
			const verificationParams : OpenIMSetGroupInfoParams = { groupID: applyGroupID, needVerification: 1, ex: 'uvue-public-group-verification' }
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'setGroupInfo', setGroupInfo(verificationParams, 'uvue_auto_apply_group_verification'), noCache, 'set group verification failed')
			await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_group_apply_reject')
			const rejectJoinParams : OpenIMJoinGroupParams = { groupID: applyGroupID, reqMsg: 'group reject join from unixsdk public automation', joinSource: 3, ex: 'uvue-public-group-join-reject' }
			const primaryRejectJoinCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
			beginAutomationOperation('joinGroup', applyGroupID, true)
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'joinGroup', joinGroup(rejectJoinParams, 'uvue_auto_join_group_reject'), noCache, 'join group reject setup failed')
			completeAutomationOperation('joinGroup', applyGroupID)
			await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnGroupApplicationAdded', 'joinGroup', primaryRejectJoinCursor, 'joinGroup reject request delivery')
			await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_group_apply_reject')
			const rejectApps = await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMGroupApplicationListResult | null>('group', 'getGroupApplicationListAsRecipient', getGroupApplicationListAsRecipient(defaultApplicationParams(), 'uvue_auto_group_apps_recipient_reject'), cacheGroupApplications, 'group application recipient list unavailable')
			const rejectApp = findGroupApplication(rejectApps, applyGroupID, config.secondaryUserID)
			if (rejectApp != null) {
				const rejectHandle : OpenIMGroupApplicationHandleParams = { groupID: applyGroupID, fromUserID: config.secondaryUserID, handleMsg: 'refused by uni-app x public automation' }
				const secondaryRejectGroupCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('secondary')
				beginAutomationOperation('refuseGroupApplication', applyGroupID, true)
				await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'refuseGroupApplication', refuseGroupApplication(rejectHandle, 'uvue_auto_refuse_group_app'), noCache)
				completeAutomationOperation('refuseGroupApplication', applyGroupID)
				await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('secondary', 'OnGroupApplicationRejected', 'refuseGroupApplication', secondaryRejectGroupCursor, 'refuseGroupApplication applicant delivery')
			} else {
				recordAutomationSkip('group', 'refuseGroupApplication', 'group reject application not found')
			}
			await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_group_apply_accept')
			const acceptJoinParams : OpenIMJoinGroupParams = { groupID: applyGroupID, reqMsg: 'group accept join from unixsdk public automation', joinSource: 3, ex: 'uvue-public-group-join-accept' }
			const primaryAcceptJoinCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
			beginAutomationOperation('joinGroup', applyGroupID, true)
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'joinGroup', joinGroup(acceptJoinParams, 'uvue_auto_join_group_accept'), noCache, 'join group accept setup failed')
			completeAutomationOperation('joinGroup', applyGroupID)
			await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnGroupApplicationAdded', 'joinGroup', primaryAcceptJoinCursor, 'joinGroup accept request delivery')
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMGroupApplicationListResult | null>('group', 'getGroupApplicationListAsApplicant', getGroupApplicationListAsApplicant(defaultApplicationParams(), 'uvue_auto_group_apps_applicant'), cacheGroupApplications, 'group application applicant list unavailable')
			await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_group_apply_accept')
			const acceptApps = await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMGroupApplicationListResult | null>('group', 'getGroupApplicationListAsRecipient', getGroupApplicationListAsRecipient(defaultApplicationParams(), 'uvue_auto_group_apps_recipient_accept'), cacheGroupApplications, 'group application recipient list unavailable')
			const acceptApp = findGroupApplication(acceptApps, applyGroupID, config.secondaryUserID)
			if (acceptApp != null) {
				const acceptHandle : OpenIMGroupApplicationHandleParams = { groupID: applyGroupID, fromUserID: config.secondaryUserID, handleMsg: 'accepted by uni-app x public automation' }
				const primaryAcceptGroupCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
				const groupApplicationAcceptedCount = readAutomationEventCount('onGroupApplicationAccepted')
				beginAutomationOperation('acceptGroupApplication', applyGroupID, true)
				await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'acceptGroupApplication', acceptGroupApplication(acceptHandle, 'uvue_auto_accept_group_app'), noCache, 'server/protocol can reject group application accept after applying member join side effect')
				completeAutomationOperation('acceptGroupApplication', applyGroupID + ':' + config.secondaryUserID)
				await recordAutomationRequiredEventCorrelation('acceptGroupApplication', 'onGroupApplicationAccepted', groupApplicationAcceptedCount)
				await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnGroupMemberAdded', 'acceptGroupApplication', primaryAcceptGroupCursor, 'acceptGroupApplication owner delivery')
				recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('acceptGroupApplication', ['onGroupApplicationAccepted', 'onGroupMemberAdded'])
			} else {
				recordAutomationSkip('group', 'acceptGroupApplication', 'group accept application not found')
			}
			await runAutomationStep<number | null>('group', 'getGroupApplicationUnhandledCount', getGroupApplicationUnhandledCount(defaultPageParams(), 'uvue_auto_group_app_count'), noCache)
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'dismissGroup', dismissGroup(applyGroupID, 'uvue_auto_dismiss_apply_group'), noCache, 'apply group cleanup failed')
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'joinGroup', 'group application setup failed')
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'getGroupApplicationListAsApplicant', 'group application setup failed')
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'getGroupApplicationListAsRecipient', 'group application setup failed')
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'getGroupApplicationUnhandledCount', 'group application setup failed')
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'acceptGroupApplication', 'group application setup failed')
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'refuseGroupApplication', 'group application setup failed')
		}
		let quitGroupID = ''
		const quitGroupInfo : OpenIMCreateGroupInfo = { groupName: 'uvue public quit group ' + new Date().getTime().toString(), groupType: 2, ex: 'uvue-public-quit-group' }
		const quitGroupParams : OpenIMCreateGroupParams = { groupInfo: quitGroupInfo, memberUserIDs: [config.secondaryUserID], adminUserIDs: [] }
		const quitGroupResult = await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMGroupItem | null>('group', 'createGroup', createGroup(quitGroupParams, 'uvue_auto_quit_group_create'), noCache, 'quit group setup failed')
		if (quitGroupResult != null) {
			quitGroupID = (quitGroupResult as OpenIMGroupItem).groupID
			await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_group_quit_membership')
			try {
				await waitAutomationGroupMembership(quitGroupID, config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_quit_group_membership')
			} finally {
				await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_group_quit_transfer')
			}
			await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'transferGroupOwner', transferGroupOwner({ groupID: quitGroupID, newOwnerUserID: config.secondaryUserID }, 'uvue_auto_transfer_quit_group'), noCache)
			await waitAutomationGroupOwner(quitGroupID, config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_transfer_quit_group_readback')
			recordAutomationSemanticEvidence('group', 'transferGroupOwnerReadback', 'specified group returned the exact transferred owner', 'transferGroupOwner')
			const primaryQuitCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
			beginAutomationOperation('quitGroup', quitGroupID, true)
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'quitGroup', quitGroup(quitGroupID, 'uvue_auto_quit_group'), noCache, 'quit can fail while group maxSeq is still syncing')
			completeAutomationOperation('quitGroup', quitGroupID)
			await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnJoinedGroupDeleted', 'quitGroup', primaryQuitCursor, 'quitGroup actor-device delivery')
			await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_group_quit_cleanup')
			await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('group', 'dismissGroup', dismissGroup(quitGroupID, 'uvue_auto_dismiss_quit_group'), noCache, 'quit group cleanup failed')
			await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_group_transfer')
		} else {
			recordAutomationSkip('group', 'quitGroup', 'quit group setup failed')
		}
		await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'transferGroupOwner', transferGroupOwner({ groupID: groupID, newOwnerUserID: config.secondaryUserID }, 'uvue_auto_transfer_group_owner'), noCache)
		await switchAutomationSecondary(config, 'B_group_dismiss')
		await waitAutomationGroupOwner(groupID, config.secondaryUserID, 'uvue_auto_transfer_group_owner_readback')
		recordAutomationSemanticEvidence('group', 'transferGroupOwnerMainReadback', 'specified group returned the exact transferred owner', 'transferGroupOwner')
		const primaryDismissCursor = await captureAutomationPeerCursor('primary')
		beginAutomationOperation('dismissGroup', groupID, true)
		await runAutomationStep<string>('group', 'dismissGroup', dismissGroup(groupID, 'uvue_auto_dismiss_group'), noCache)
		completeAutomationOperation('dismissGroup', groupID)
		await waitAutomationPeerOperationEvent('primary', 'OnGroupDismissed', 'dismissGroup', primaryDismissCursor, 'dismissGroup former-member delivery')
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_group_done')
	}

	async function runAutomationAppSuite() : Promise<void> {
		await runAutomationStep<string>('app', 'setAppBackgroundStatus', setAppBackgroundStatus(false, 'uvue_auto_app_background'), noCache, serverAcknowledgedMutationAutomationEvidence('setAppBackgroundStatus'))
		await runAutomationStep<string>('app', 'setAppBadge', setAppBadge(0, 'uvue_auto_app_badge'), noCache, serverAcknowledgedMutationAutomationEvidence('setAppBadge'))
		await runAutomationStep<string>('app', 'networkStatusChanged', networkStatusChanged('uvue_auto_network_changed'), noCache)
		const params : OpenIMUpdateFcmTokenParams = { fcmToken: 'uvue-public-automation-fcm-token', expireTime: 0 }
		await runAutomationStep<string>('app', 'updateFcmToken', updateFcmToken(params, 'uvue_auto_update_fcm'), noCache, serverAcknowledgedMutationAutomationEvidence('updateFcmToken'))
	}

	async function runAutomationUploadSuite() : Promise<void> {
		const uploadRunID = new Date().getTime().toString()
		const uploadFileName = 'automation-upload-' + uploadRunID + '.bin'
		const uploadFilePath = writeAutomationUniqueUploadFile(uploadFileName, uploadRunID)
		const previousUploadProgressCount = readAutomationEventCount('onUploadFileProgress')
		const uploadParams : OpenIMUploadFileParams = { filepath: uploadFilePath, name: uploadFileName, contentType: 'application/octet-stream', uuid: 'uvue-auto-upload-file-' + uploadRunID, cause: 'automation upload' }
		beginAutomationOperation('uploadFile', null, true)
		const uploadResult = await runAutomationOptionalStep<OpenIMUploadFileResult | null>('upload', 'uploadFile', uploadFile(uploadParams, 'uvue_auto_upload_file'), noCache, 'uploadFile requires reachable object storage endpoint')
		if (uploadResult != null) {
			completeAutomationOperation('uploadFile', null)
			automationUploadFileProgressExpected = true
			await waitAutomationEventCountIncrease('onUploadFileProgress', previousUploadProgressCount, 5000)
			recordAutomationSideEffect('upload', 'uploadFileProgressReadback', 'onUploadFileProgress increased after a unique upload completed', true, 'uploadFile')
		}
		const uploadLogsParams : OpenIMUploadLogsParams = { line: 100, ex: 'uvue-public-automation' }
		const previousUploadLogsProgressCount = readAutomationEventCount('onUploadLogsProgress')
		beginAutomationOperation('uploadLogs', null, true)
		const uploadLogsResult = await runAutomationOptionalStep<string>('upload', 'uploadLogs', uploadLogs(uploadLogsParams, 'uvue_auto_upload_logs'), noCache, 'uploadLogs requires reachable object storage endpoint')
		if (uploadLogsResult != null) {
			completeAutomationOperation('uploadLogs', null)
			automationUploadLogsProgressExpected = true
			await waitAutomationEventCountIncrease('onUploadLogsProgress', previousUploadLogsProgressCount, 5000)
			recordAutomationSideEffect('upload', 'uploadLogsProgressReadback', 'onUploadLogsProgress increased after log upload completed', true, 'uploadLogs')
		}
	}

	async function createAndSendAutomationText(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig, text : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<OpenIMMessageItem> {
		const draft = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem | null>('conversation-mutation', 'createTextMessage', createTextMessage(text, operationPrefix + '_create'), cacheRequiredAutomationMessage)
		const options : OpenIMSendMessageOptions = { operationID: operationPrefix + '_send', message: draft as OpenIMMessageItem, recvID: config.secondaryUserID, groupID: '', isOnlineOnly: false }
		return await runAutomationStep<OpenIMMessageItem>('conversation-mutation', 'sendMessage', sendMessage(options), cacheSentAutomationMessage)
	}

	async function readAutomationConversationIDs(operationID : string) : Promise<Array<string>> {
		const result = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMConversationListResult | null>(getAllConversationList(operationID), 'conversation/getAllConversationListVisibilityReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
		if (result == null) { throw new Error('getAllConversationList returned null during visibility readback') }
		const conversationIDs : Array<string> = []
		let index = 0
		while (index < result.conversations.length) {
			const conversationID = result.conversations[index].conversationID
			if (conversationID.length == 0 || conversationIDs.indexOf(conversationID) >= 0) { throw new Error('getAllConversationList returned an invalid conversation identity') }
			conversationIDs.push(conversationID)
			index = index + 1
		}
		return conversationIDs
	}

	async function waitAutomationConversationVisibility(conversationIDs : Array<string>, expectedPresent : boolean, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		if (conversationIDs.length == 0) { throw new Error(operationPrefix + ' requires at least one conversationID') }
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			try {
				const visible = await readAutomationConversationIDs(operationPrefix + '_' + attempt.toString())
				let matched = 0
				let index = 0
				while (index < conversationIDs.length) {
					if ((visible.indexOf(conversationIDs[index]) >= 0) == expectedPresent) { matched = matched + 1 }
					index = index + 1
				}
				if (matched == conversationIDs.length) { return }
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error(operationPrefix + ' conversation visibility did not reach the expected state')
	}

	async function waitAutomationConversationAndMessageDeleted(conversationID : string, clientMsgID : string, operationPrefix : string) : Promise<void> {
		const deadline = Date.now() + automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds
		let attempt = 0
		while (Date.now() < deadline) {
			let conversationAbsent = false
			let messageAbsent = false
			try {
				const visible = await readAutomationConversationIDs(operationPrefix + '_conversations_' + attempt.toString())
				conversationAbsent = visible.indexOf(conversationID) < 0
				const params : OpenIMGetAdvancedHistoryMessageListParams = { conversationID: conversationID, startClientMsgID: '', count: 100 }
				const history = await withAutomationTimeout<OpenIMAdvancedHistoryMessageListResult | null>(getAdvancedHistoryMessageList(params, operationPrefix + '_history_' + attempt.toString()), 'conversation/getAdvancedHistoryMessageListDeleteReadback', automationSideEffectReadTimeoutMilliseconds)
				messageAbsent = history != null && findAutomationHistoryMessage(history, clientMsgID) == null
			} catch (_error) {
			}
			if (conversationAbsent && messageAbsent) { return }
			attempt = attempt + 1
			await sleepAutomation(automationSideEffectPollMilliseconds)
		}
		throw new Error('conversation and message deletion did not become observable')
	}

	async function runAutomationConversationMutationSuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_conversation_mutation')
		if (automationConversationID.length == 0) {
			const params : OpenIMGetOneConversationParams = { sourceID: config.secondaryUserID, sessionType: OpenIMSessionTypeSingle }
			await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation-mutation', 'getConversationIDBySessionType', getConversationIDBySessionType(params, 'uvue_auto_mutation_conversation_id'), cacheAutomationConversationID)
		}
		const clearSource = await createAndSendAutomationText(config, 'clear conversation from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_mutation_clear')
		const clearClientMsgID = clearSource.clientMsgID == null ? '' : clearSource.clientMsgID as string
		if (clearClientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error('clearConversationAndDeleteAllMsg requires a source clientMsgID') }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, clearClientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_clear_conversation_precondition')
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility([automationConversationID], true, 'uvue_auto_clear_conversation_visibility_precondition')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation-mutation', 'clearConversationAndDeleteAllMsg', clearConversationAndDeleteAllMsg(automationConversationID, 'uvue_auto_clear_conversation'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, clearClientMsgID, false, null, 'uvue_auto_clear_conversation_readback')
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility([automationConversationID], true, 'uvue_auto_clear_conversation_visibility_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation-mutation', 'clearConversationAndDeleteAllMsgReadback', 'history omitted the exact cleared message while the conversation remained visible', false, 'clearConversationAndDeleteAllMsg')

		const hideSource = await createAndSendAutomationText(config, 'hide conversation from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_mutation_hide')
		const hideClientMsgID = hideSource.clientMsgID == null ? '' : hideSource.clientMsgID as string
		if (hideClientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error('hideConversation requires a source clientMsgID') }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, hideClientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_hide_conversation_precondition')
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility([automationConversationID], true, 'uvue_auto_hide_conversation_visibility_precondition')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation-mutation', 'hideConversation', hideConversation(automationConversationID, 'uvue_auto_hide_conversation'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility([automationConversationID], false, 'uvue_auto_hide_conversation_readback')
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, hideClientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_hide_conversation_history_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation-mutation', 'hideConversationReadback', 'conversation list omitted the exact hidden conversation while history retained its message', false, 'hideConversation')

		const hideAllSource = await createAndSendAutomationText(config, 'hide all conversations from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_mutation_hide_all')
		const hideAllClientMsgID = hideAllSource.clientMsgID == null ? '' : hideAllSource.clientMsgID as string
		if (hideAllClientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error('hideAllConversations requires a source clientMsgID') }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, hideAllClientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_hide_all_precondition')
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility([automationConversationID], true, 'uvue_auto_hide_all_visibility_precondition')
		const visibleConversationIDs = await readAutomationConversationIDs('uvue_auto_hide_all_visible')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation-mutation', 'hideAllConversations', hideAllConversations('uvue_auto_hide_all_conversations'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility(visibleConversationIDs, false, 'uvue_auto_hide_all_readback')
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, hideAllClientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_hide_all_history_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation-mutation', 'hideAllConversationsReadback', 'conversation list omitted every pre-mutation conversation while history retained the exact message', false, 'hideAllConversations')

		const deleteMessagesSource = await createAndSendAutomationText(config, 'delete conversation messages from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_mutation_delete_messages')
		const deleteMessagesClientMsgID = deleteMessagesSource.clientMsgID == null ? '' : deleteMessagesSource.clientMsgID as string
		if (deleteMessagesClientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error('deleteConversationAndDeleteAllMsg requires a source clientMsgID') }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, deleteMessagesClientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_delete_conversation_msgs_precondition')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation-mutation', 'deleteConversationAndDeleteAllMsg', deleteConversationAndDeleteAllMsg(automationConversationID, 'uvue_auto_delete_conversation_msgs'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationConversationAndMessageDeleted(automationConversationID, deleteMessagesClientMsgID, 'uvue_auto_delete_conversation_msgs_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation-mutation', 'deleteConversationAndDeleteAllMsgReadback', 'conversation list and history omitted the exact deleted identities', false, 'deleteConversationAndDeleteAllMsg')

		const deleteSource = await createAndSendAutomationText(config, 'delete conversation from unixsdk public automation', 'uvue_auto_mutation_delete')
		const deleteClientMsgID = deleteSource.clientMsgID == null ? '' : deleteSource.clientMsgID as string
		if (deleteClientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error('deleteConversation requires a source clientMsgID') }
		await waitAutomationHistoryMessageState(automationConversationID, deleteClientMsgID, true, OpenIMMessageTypeText, 'uvue_auto_delete_conversation_precondition')
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility([automationConversationID], true, 'uvue_auto_delete_conversation_visibility_precondition')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('conversation-mutation', 'deleteConversation', deleteConversation(automationConversationID, 'uvue_auto_delete_conversation'), noCache)
		await waitAutomationConversationVisibility([automationConversationID], false, 'uvue_auto_delete_conversation_readback')
		recordAutomationSideEffect('conversation-mutation', 'deleteConversationReadback', 'conversation list omitted the exact deleted conversationID', false, 'deleteConversation')
	}

	function recordRequiredAutomationEventDelivery(eventName : string) {
		const count = readAutomationEventCount(eventName)
		if (count > 0) {
			recordAutomationStep('event-delivery', eventName, true, 'callback delivered count=' + count.toString())
		} else if (eventName == 'onSyncServerStart' || eventName == 'onSyncServerFinish' || eventName == 'onSyncServerProgress') {
			recordAutomationSkip('event-delivery', eventName, 'quick sync did not emit this sync callback during this run')
		} else if (eventName == 'onSendMessageProgress' && !automationSendMessageProgressExpected) {
			recordAutomationSkip('event-delivery', eventName, 'no local media/file send completed in current environment')
		} else if (eventName == 'onUploadFileProgress' && !automationUploadFileProgressExpected) {
			recordAutomationSkip('event-delivery', eventName, 'uploadFile did not complete in current object storage environment')
		} else if (eventName == 'onUploadLogsProgress' && !automationUploadLogsProgressExpected) {
			recordAutomationSkip('event-delivery', eventName, 'uploadLogs did not complete in current object storage environment')
		} else {
			recordAutomationStep('event-delivery', eventName, false, 'callback was registered but not delivered during automation')
		}
	}

	function recordTrackedAutomationEventDelivery(eventName : string) {
		const count = readAutomationEventCount(eventName)
		if (count > 0) {
			recordAutomationStep('event-delivery', eventName, true, 'callback delivered count=' + count.toString())
		}
	}

	function readAutomationMessageText(message : OpenIMMessageItem) : string {
		if (message.textElem == null) { return '' }
		const content = (message.textElem as OpenIMTextElem).content
		return content == null ? '' : content as string
	}

	async function runAutomationBatchedMessageEventProbe(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_batched_message_event')
		const eventName = 'onRecvNewMessages'
		const previousCount = readAutomationEventCount(eventName)
		const afterSequence = readAutomationEventSequence()
		let coreInitialized = true
		try {
			await runAutomationStep<string>('event-delivery', 'logoutForBatchedMessage', logout('uvue_auto_batched_message_logout'), (_value : string) => {
				automationLoggedIn = false
				automationActiveUserID = ''
			})
			unInitSDK('uvue_auto_batched_message_uninit')
			automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = 0
			coreInitialized = false
			await sleepAutomation(750)
			const messageText = 'batched-message-event-' + new Date().getTime().toString()
			const peerPayload : UTSJSONObject = { recvID: config.primaryUserID, text: messageText, operationID: 'uvue_auto_peer_batched_message' }
			const peerResult = await runAutomationPeerCommand('send_text', buildAutomationPeerPayload('secondary', peerPayload), automationSendStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			const peerMessage = readAutomationPeerMessage(peerResult, 'batched send_text')
			const clientMsgID = peerMessage.clientMsgID == null ? '' : peerMessage.clientMsgID as string
			if (clientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error('batched send_text peer command returned no clientMsgID') }
			automationLifecycleEpochCounter = automationLifecycleEpochCounter + 1
			automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = automationLifecycleEpochCounter
			const initialized = await withAutomationTimeout<boolean>(initSDK(buildAutomationInitConfig(config), 'uvue_auto_batched_message_reinit'), 'event-delivery/initSDKForBatchedMessage', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			requireAutomation(initialized, 'batched-message Core re-init returned false')
			coreInitialized = true
			await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_batched_message_event_reconnect')
			if (!await waitAutomationEventCountIncrease(eventName, previousCount, automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds)) { throw new Error('offline peer message did not emit onRecvNewMessages after reconnect') }
			const occurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrenceByMessageIdentityAfter(eventName, afterSequence, clientMsgID)
			if (occurrence == null) { throw new Error('onRecvNewMessages did not correlate with the offline peer clientMsgID') }
			const result = JSON.parseObject<OpenIMMessageListResult>(occurrence.payloadText)
			if (result == null) { throw new Error('onRecvNewMessages returned an invalid list wrapper') }
			let matched = false
			let index = 0
			while (index < result.messages.length) {
				const message = result.messages[index]
				if (message.clientMsgID == clientMsgID && message.sendID == config.secondaryUserID && message.recvID == config.primaryUserID && readAutomationMessageText(message) == messageText) { matched = true }
				index = index + 1
			}
			if (!matched) { throw new Error('onRecvNewMessages did not contain the exact offline peer message identity') }
			markAutomationEventEvidence(eventName, true, true, true)
			recordAutomationStep('event-delivery', 'onRecvNewMessagesScenario', true, 'reconnect sync callback matched the exact offline peer message identity')
		} finally {
			if (!coreInitialized) {
				automationLifecycleEpochCounter = automationLifecycleEpochCounter + 1
				automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = automationLifecycleEpochCounter
				const restored = await withAutomationTimeout<boolean>(initSDK(buildAutomationInitConfig(config), 'uvue_auto_batched_message_restore_init'), 'event-delivery/initSDKRestoreAfterBatchedMessage', automationDefaultStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
				requireAutomation(restored, 'batched-message restore init returned false')
				coreInitialized = true
			}
			if (!automationLoggedIn || automationActiveUserID != config.primaryUserID) {
				await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_batched_message_event_restore')
			}
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationOfflineMessageEventProbe(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await switchAutomationPrimary(config, 'A_offline_message_event')
		await runAutomationStep<string>('event-delivery', 'setBackgroundForOfflineMessage', setAppBackgroundStatus(true, 'uvue_auto_offline_event_background'), noCache, serverAcknowledgedMutationAutomationEvidence('setAppBackgroundStatus'))
		try {
			const eventName = 'onRecvOfflineNewMessage'
			const previousCount = readAutomationEventCount(eventName)
			const afterSequence = readAutomationEventSequence()
			const messageText = 'offline-event-' + new Date().getTime().toString()
			const peerPayload : UTSJSONObject = { recvID: config.primaryUserID, text: messageText, operationID: 'uvue_auto_peer_offline_message' }
			await runAutomationStep<string>('event-delivery', 'networkStatusChangedForOfflineMessage', networkStatusChanged('uvue_auto_offline_event_network_changed'), noCache)
			const peerResult = await runAutomationPeerCommand('send_text', buildAutomationPeerPayload('secondary', peerPayload), automationSendStepTimeoutMilliseconds)
			const peerMessage = readAutomationPeerMessage(peerResult, 'offline send_text')
			const clientMsgID = peerMessage.clientMsgID == null ? '' : peerMessage.clientMsgID as string
			if (clientMsgID.length == 0) { throw new Error('offline send_text peer command returned no clientMsgID') }
			if (!await waitAutomationEventCountIncrease(eventName, previousCount, automationSideEffectTimeoutMilliseconds)) { throw new Error('background delivery did not emit onRecvOfflineNewMessage') }
			const occurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrenceByMessageIdentityAfter(eventName, afterSequence, clientMsgID)
			if (occurrence == null) { throw new Error('onRecvOfflineNewMessage did not correlate with the peer clientMsgID') }
			const message = JSON.parseObject<OpenIMMessageItem>(occurrence.payloadText)
			if (message == null || message.clientMsgID != clientMsgID || message.sendID != config.secondaryUserID || message.recvID != config.primaryUserID || readAutomationMessageText(message as OpenIMMessageItem) != messageText) { throw new Error('onRecvOfflineNewMessage payload did not match the peer fixture') }
			const pluralOccurrence = findAutomationEventOccurrenceByMessageIdentityAfter('onRecvOfflineNewMessages', afterSequence, clientMsgID)
			if (pluralOccurrence == null) { throw new Error('onRecvOfflineNewMessages did not correlate with the peer clientMsgID') }
			markAutomationEventEvidence(eventName, true, true, true)
			markAutomationEventEvidence('onRecvOfflineNewMessages', true, true, true)
			recordAutomationStep('event-delivery', 'onRecvOfflineNewMessageScenario', true, 'background C2C notification matched the exact peer message identity')
		} finally {
			await runAutomationStep<string>('event-delivery', 'restoreForegroundAfterOfflineMessage', setAppBackgroundStatus(false, 'uvue_auto_offline_event_foreground'), noCache, serverAcknowledgedMutationAutomationEvidence('setAppBackgroundStatus'))
		}
	}

	function validateAutomationObservedLifecycleAncillaryEvents() {
		let progressValidated = false
		let unreadValidated = false
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationEventOccurrences.length) {
			const occurrence = automationEventOccurrences[index]
			if (!progressValidated && occurrence.eventName == 'onSyncServerProgress') {
				const syncStart = findAutomationEventOccurrence('onSyncServerStart', occurrence.epoch, 0)
				const syncFinish = findAutomationEventOccurrence('onSyncServerFinish', occurrence.epoch, 0)
				const progress = parseInt(occurrence.payloadText)
				if (syncStart != null && syncFinish != null && progress.toString() != 'NaN' && progress >= 0 && progress <= 100 && occurrence.sequence > syncStart.sequence && occurrence.sequence < syncFinish.sequence) {
					markAutomationEventEvidence('onSyncServerProgress', true, true, true)
					progressValidated = true
				}
			}
			if (!unreadValidated && occurrence.eventName == 'onTotalUnreadMessageCountChanged') {
				const unreadCount = parseInt(occurrence.payloadText)
				if (unreadCount.toString() != 'NaN' && unreadCount >= 0 && occurrence.epoch > 0) {
					markAutomationEventEvidence('onTotalUnreadMessageCountChanged', true, true, true)
					unreadValidated = true
				}
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationEventDeliverySuite(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		await runAutomationBatchedMessageEventProbe(config)
		await runAutomationOfflineMessageEventProbe(config)
		validateAutomationObservedLifecycleAncillaryEvents()
		await sleepAutomation(1500)
		let requiredIndex = 0
		while (requiredIndex < automationRequiredDeliveredEventNames.length) {
			const requiredEventName = automationRequiredDeliveredEventNames[requiredIndex]
			recordRequiredAutomationEventDelivery(requiredEventName)
			requiredIndex = requiredIndex + 1
		}
		recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('login', ['onConnecting', 'onConnectSuccess', 'onSyncServerStart', 'onSyncServerFinish'])
		recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('sendMessage', ['onSendMessageProgress', 'onRecvNewMessage'])
		recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('sendMessageNotOss', ['onRecvNewMessage'])
		recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('uploadFile', ['onUploadFileProgress'])
		recordAutomationCallableEventCorrelations('uploadLogs', ['onUploadLogsProgress'])
		let trackedIndex = 0
		while (trackedIndex < automationTrackedDeliveredEventNames.length) {
			recordTrackedAutomationEventDelivery(automationTrackedDeliveredEventNames[trackedIndex])
			trackedIndex = trackedIndex + 1
		}
	}

	function collectAutomationCoverageMissing() : Array<string> {
		const missing : Array<string> = []
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationPublicAPINames.length) {
			const name = automationPublicAPINames[index]
			if (!automationStringArrayContains(automationCoveredAPINames, name)) {
				missing.push(name)
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return missing
	}

	function collectAutomationValidatedMissing() : Array<string> {
		const missing : Array<string> = []
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationPublicAPINames.length) {
			const name = automationPublicAPINames[index]
			if (!automationStringArrayContains(automationValidatedAPINames, name)) {
				missing.push(name)
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return missing
	}

	function collectAutomationSkipKeys(allowed : boolean) : Array<string> {
		const keys : Array<string> = []
		automationStepResults.forEach((item : OpenIMAutomationCase) => {
			if (item.status == 'skipped') {
				const key = item.group + '/' + item.name
				const isAllowed = automationStringArrayContains(automationAllowedSkipCaseKeys, key)
				if (isAllowed == allowed) {
					keys.push(key)
				}
			}
		})
		return keys
	}

	function filterAutomationValidatedMissing(missing : Array<string>, allowed : boolean) : Array<string> {
		const result : Array<string> = []
		missing.forEach((name : string) => {
			const isAllowed = automationStringArrayContains(automationAllowedValidatedMissingNames, name)
			if (isAllowed == allowed) {
				result.push(name)
			}
		})
		return result
	}

	function runAutomationCoverageSuite() {
		const missing = collectAutomationCoverageMissing()
		if (missing.length == 0) {
			recordAutomationStep('coverage', 'publicAPIsRecorded', true, 'all public Android/iOS APIs are covered or explicitly allowed')
		} else {
			recordAutomationStep('coverage', 'publicAPIsRecorded', false, missing.join(', '))
		}
		const validatedMissing = collectAutomationValidatedMissing()
		const unexpectedValidatedMissing = filterAutomationValidatedMissing(validatedMissing, false)
		if (unexpectedValidatedMissing.length == 0) {
			recordAutomationStep('coverage', 'publicAPIsValidated', true, validatedMissing.length == 0 ? 'all public Android/iOS APIs passed without skip' : 'only explicitly allowed APIs were not runtime-validated: ' + validatedMissing.join(', '))
		} else {
			recordAutomationStep('coverage', 'publicAPIsValidated', false, unexpectedValidatedMissing.join(', '))
		}
	}

	function createAutomationGroupResult(group : string) : OpenIMAutomationGroupResult {
		const result : OpenIMAutomationGroupResult = { group: group, total: 0, passed: 0, failed: 0, skipped: 0 }
		return result
	}

	function findAutomationGroup(groups : Array<OpenIMAutomationGroupResult>, groupName : string) : OpenIMAutomationGroupResult | null {
		let index = 0
		while (index < groups.length) {
			if (groups[index].group == groupName) {
				return groups[index]
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return null
	}

	function buildAutomationGroups() : Array<OpenIMAutomationGroupResult> {
		const groups : Array<OpenIMAutomationGroupResult> = []
		let suiteIndex = 0
		while (suiteIndex < automationSuiteOrder.length) {
			groups.push(createAutomationGroupResult(automationSuiteOrder[suiteIndex]))
			suiteIndex = suiteIndex + 1
		}
		automationStepResults.forEach((item : OpenIMAutomationCase) => {
			let group = findAutomationGroup(groups, item.group)
			if (group == null) {
				const extra = createAutomationGroupResult(item.group)
				groups.push(extra)
				group = extra
			}
			if (group != null) {
				group.total = group.total + 1
				if (item.status == 'skipped') {
					group.skipped = group.skipped + 1
				} else if (item.status == 'passed') {
					group.passed = group.passed + 1
				} else {
					group.failed = group.failed + 1
				}
			}
		})
		return groups
	}

	function countAutomationFailures() : number {
		let count = 0
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationStepResults.length) {
			const item = automationStepResults[index]
			if (item.status == 'failed') {
				count = count + 1
			}
			index = index + 1
		}
		return count
	}

	function buildAutomationEventLines() : Array<string> {
		const lines : Array<string> = []
		if (automationEventRecords.length == 0) {
			lines.push('[EVENT] none observed')
			return lines
		}
		automationEventRecords.forEach((item : OpenIMAutomationEventRecord) => {
			lines.push('[EVENT] ' + item.name + ' count=' + item.count.toString() + ' last=' + item.lastPayload)
		})
		return lines
	}

	function automationSuitePrerequisites(suite : string) : Array<string> {
		if (suite == 'conversation') {
			return ['message-send']
		}
		if (suite == 'event-delivery') {
			return ['message-create', 'message-send', 'upload']
		}
		return []
	}

	function buildAutomationExecutedSuites() : Array<string> {
		if (automationSuiteFilter.length == 0) {
			return automationSelectableSuiteNames
		}
		const suites = automationSuitePrerequisites(automationSuiteFilter)
		if (automationSuiteFilter == 'message-create' || automationStringArrayContains(suites, 'message-create')) {
			suites.push('message-create-send')
		}
		suites.push(automationSuiteFilter)
		return suites
	}

	function buildAutomationSummary() : OpenIMAutomationSummary {
		let passed = 0
		let failed = 0
		let skipped = 0
		const caseLines : Array<string> = []
		automationStepResults.forEach((item : OpenIMAutomationCase) => {
			if (item.status == 'skipped') {
				skipped = skipped + 1
			} else if (item.status == 'passed') {
				passed = passed + 1
			} else {
				failed = failed + 1
			}
			caseLines.push('[' + item.status + '] [' + item.group + '] ' + item.name + ' ' + item.message)
		})
		const groups = buildAutomationGroups()
		const fullAutomationRun = automationSuiteFilter.length == 0
		const coverageMissing = fullAutomationRun ? collectAutomationCoverageMissing() : []
		const validatedMissing = fullAutomationRun ? collectAutomationValidatedMissing() : []
		const allowedSkipped = collectAutomationSkipKeys(true)
		const unexpectedSkipped = collectAutomationSkipKeys(false)
		const validatedAllowedMissing = filterAutomationValidatedMissing(validatedMissing, true)
		const validatedUnexpectedMissing = filterAutomationValidatedMissing(validatedMissing, false)
		const groupLines : Array<string> = []
		groups.forEach((group : OpenIMAutomationGroupResult) => {
			if (group.total > 0) {
				groupLines.push('[' + group.group + '] ' + group.passed.toString() + ' passed, ' + group.failed.toString() + ' failed, ' + group.skipped.toString() + ' skipped')
			}
		})
		const headline = failed == 0 && unexpectedSkipped.length == 0 && coverageMissing.length == 0 && validatedUnexpectedMissing.length == 0 ? 'Automation passed' : 'Automation failed'
		const coverageTotal = automationPublicAPINames.length
		const coverageRecorded = automationCoveredAPINames.length
		const validatedRecorded = automationValidatedAPINames.length
		const coverageText = 'Coverage recorded: ' + coverageRecorded.toString() + ' / ' + coverageTotal.toString()
		const coverageMissingText = coverageMissing.length == 0 ? 'Coverage missing: none' : 'Coverage missing: ' + coverageMissing.join(', ')
		const validatedText = 'Validated: ' + validatedRecorded.toString() + ' / ' + coverageTotal.toString()
		const validatedMissingText = validatedMissing.length == 0 ? 'Validated missing: none' : 'Validated missing: ' + validatedMissing.join(', ')
		const skipGateText = 'Unexpected skipped: ' + (unexpectedSkipped.length == 0 ? 'none' : unexpectedSkipped.join(', '))
		const validatedGateText = 'Unexpected validated missing: ' + (validatedUnexpectedMissing.length == 0 ? 'none' : validatedUnexpectedMissing.join(', '))
		const summaryText = headline + ': ' + passed.toString() + ' passed, ' + failed.toString() + ' failed, ' + skipped.toString() + ' skipped\n' + coverageText + '\n' + coverageMissingText + '\n' + validatedText + '\n' + validatedMissingText + '\n' + skipGateText + '\n' + validatedGateText + '\n' + groupLines.join('\n') + '\nEvents observed\n' + buildAutomationEventLines().join('\n') + '\n' + caseLines.join('\n')
		const summary : OpenIMAutomationSummary = {
			headline: headline,
			summaryText: summaryText,
			suiteFilter: automationSuiteFilter,
			executedSuites: buildAutomationExecutedSuites(),
			total: automationStepResults.length,
			passed: passed,
			failed: failed,
			skipped: skipped,
			coverageTotal: coverageTotal,
			coverageRecorded: coverageRecorded,
			coverageMissing: coverageMissing,
			validatedTotal: coverageTotal,
			validatedRecorded: validatedRecorded,
			validatedMissing: validatedMissing,
			allowedSkipped: allowedSkipped,
			unexpectedSkipped: unexpectedSkipped,
			validatedAllowedMissing: validatedAllowedMissing,
			validatedUnexpectedMissing: validatedUnexpectedMissing,
			groups: groups,
			cases: automationStepResults,
			events: automationEventRecords,
			logFilePath: automationRunLogFilePath,
			jsonFilePath: automationRunJSONFilePath,
			logWriteError: automationRunLogWriteError
		}
		return summary
	}

	function writeAutomationSummaryFiles(summary : OpenIMAutomationSummary) : OpenIMAutomationSummary {
		try {
			if (automationRunLogFilePath.length == 0 || automationRunJSONFilePath.length == 0) {
				initializeAutomationLogFiles()
			}
			summary.logFilePath = automationRunLogFilePath
			summary.jsonFilePath = automationRunJSONFilePath
			summary.logWriteError = automationRunLogWriteError
			summary.summaryText = summary.summaryText + '\nLog file: ' + automationRunLogFilePath + '\nJSON file: ' + automationRunJSONFilePath
			const jsonText = JSON.stringify(summary)
			uni.getFileSystemManager().writeFileSync(automationRunLogFilePath, summary.summaryText, 'utf-8')
			if (jsonText != null) {
				uni.getFileSystemManager().writeFileSync(automationRunJSONFilePath, jsonText as string, 'utf-8')
			}
		} catch (error) {
			summary.logWriteError = stringifyAPIValue(error)
		}
		return summary
	}

	async function runAutomationNamedSuite(suite : string, config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		if (suite == 'user-status') {
			await runAutomationUserStatusSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'message-create') {
			await runAutomationMessageCreateSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'message-send') {
			await runAutomationMessageSendSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'conversation') {
			await runAutomationConversationSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'message-storage') {
			await runAutomationMessageStorageSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'friend') {
			await runAutomationFriendSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'group') {
			await runAutomationGroupSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'app') {
			await runAutomationAppSuite()
		} else if (suite == 'upload') {
			await runAutomationUploadSuite()
		} else if (suite == 'conversation-mutation') {
			await runAutomationConversationMutationSuite(config)
		} else if (suite == 'event-delivery') {
			await runAutomationEventDeliverySuite(config)
		} else {
			throw new Error('Unknown automation suite: ' + suite)
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationGuardedSuite(suite : string, config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		const failuresBefore = countAutomationFailures()
		try {
			await runAutomationNamedSuite(suite, config)
		} catch (error) {
			if (countAutomationFailures() == failuresBefore) {
				recordAutomationStep(suite, 'suite runner', false, stringifyAPIValue(error))
			}
			statusText.value = 'Automation continuing after ' + suite
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationGuardedSuites(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig) : Promise<void> {
		if (automationSuiteFilter.length > 0) {
			if (!automationStringArrayContains(automationSelectableSuiteNames, automationSuiteFilter)) {
				throw new Error('Unknown automation suite filter: ' + automationSuiteFilter)
			}
			recordAutomationStep('setup', 'suiteFilter', true, automationSuiteFilter)
			const prerequisites = automationSuitePrerequisites(automationSuiteFilter)
			let index = 0
			while (index < prerequisites.length) {
				recordAutomationStep('setup', 'suite prerequisite', true, automationSuiteFilter + ' requires ' + prerequisites[index])
				await runAutomationGuardedSuite(prerequisites[index], config)
				index = index + 1
			}
			await runAutomationGuardedSuite(automationSuiteFilter, config)
			return
		}
		let index = 0
		while (index < automationSelectableSuiteNames.length) {
			await runAutomationGuardedSuite(automationSelectableSuiteNames[index], config)
			index = index + 1
		}
	}

	async function runAutomationCleanupBeforeSummary(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null) : Promise<void> {
		try {
			const subscription = onRecvCustomBusinessMessage((_payload : string) => {})
			if (subscription.id.length == 0 || subscription.eventName != 'onRecvCustomBusinessMessage') { throw new Error('onRecvCustomBusinessMessage returned an invalid subscription handle') }
			off(subscription)
			off(subscription)
			recordAutomationStep('cleanup', 'off', true, 'off called twice for ' + subscription.eventName + '#' + subscription.id)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'off', 'none', 'duplicate-off-left-no-owned-resource', 'subscription absent', 'subscription absent', true)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'onRecvCustomBusinessMessage', 'off(subscription)', 'subscription-cleanup-executed', 'subscription removed by exact handle', 'subscription removed by exact handle', true)
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationStep('cleanup', 'off', false, stringifyAPIValue(error))
		}
		try {
			offAll('onRecvCustomBusinessMessage')
			recordAutomationStep('cleanup', 'offAll', true, 'offAll called for onRecvCustomBusinessMessage')
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'offAll', 'none', 'off-all-left-no-owned-resource', 'event-name registry entry absent', 'event-name registry entry absent', true)
			registerSDKEvents()
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationStep('cleanup', 'offAll', false, stringifyAPIValue(error))
		}
		if (automationLoggedIn) {
			await runAutomationStep<string>('cleanup', 'logout', logout('uvue_auto_logout_before_uninit'), (_value : string) => {
				automationLoggedIn = false
				automationActiveUserID = ''
			}, responseAutomationEvidence('logout', 'login-status-is-logged-out'))
			const loggedOutStatus = await runAutomationStep<OpenIMLoginStatus>('cleanup', 'getLoginStatus', getLoginStatus('uvue_auto_logout_status'), noCache, responseAutomationEvidence('getLoginStatus', 'login-status-readback-is-logged-out'))
			requireAutomation(loggedOutStatus == 1, 'logout did not transition to logged-out state')
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('cleanup', 'logout', true, 'read-after-logout status is logged out', mutationAutomationEvidence('logout', 'logout-result-observed', 'logged-out-status-readback', false), null, null)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'logout', 'none', 'logout-is-terminal', 'logged-out status', 'logged-out status', true)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'login', 'logout()', 'authenticated-session-cleaned', 'logged-out status', 'logged-out status', true)
		}

		let retainedConnectingCount = 0
		const retained = onConnecting(() => { retainedConnectingCount = retainedConnectingCount + 1 })
		unInitSDK('uvue_auto_uninit_epoch_probe')
		automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = 0
		recordAutomationStep('cleanup', 'unInitSDK', true, 'first teardown requested')
		await sleepAutomation(750)
		if (config != null && isAutomationConfigReady(config)) {
			const readyConfig = config as OpenIMAutomationConfig
			automationLifecycleEpochCounter = automationLifecycleEpochCounter + 1
			automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = automationLifecycleEpochCounter
			await runAutomationStep<boolean>('cleanup', 'initSDK', initSDK(buildAutomationInitConfig(readyConfig), 'uvue_auto_reinit_epoch_probe'), (value : boolean) => {
				requireAutomation(value, 're-init after unInitSDK returned false')
			}, responseAutomationEvidence('initSDK', 'reinit-result-is-true'))
			await switchAutomationPrimary(readyConfig, 'A_epoch_probe')
			await sleepAutomation(250)
			requireAutomation(retainedConnectingCount == 1, 'registry/native epoch rebind delivered ' + retainedConnectingCount.toString() + ' connecting callbacks')
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('cleanup', 'unInitSDK', true, 'teardown barrier allowed one clean re-init epoch and preserved registry', mutationAutomationEvidence('unInitSDK', 'teardown-barrier-completed', 'clean-reinit-after-uninit', false), 'null', null)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'unInitSDK', 'none', 'teardown-operation-is-terminal', 'old native epoch inactive', 'old native epoch inactive', true)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'initSDK', 'unInitSDK()', 'initialized-native-epoch-cleaned', 'old native epoch inactive', 'old native epoch inactive', true)
			recordAutomationEvidenceStep('cleanup', 'onConnecting', true, 'subscription survived Core epoch and delivered once after rebind', mutationAutomationEvidence('onConnecting', 'subscription-survived-core-epoch', 'single-delivery-after-rebind', true), null, null)
			off(retained)
			recordAutomationCleanupEvidence('cleanup', 'onConnecting', 'off(subscription)', 'retained-epoch-probe-subscription-removed', 'exact retained handle removed', 'exact retained handle removed', true)
			await runAutomationStep<string>('cleanup', 'logout', logout('uvue_auto_logout_final'), (_value : string) => {
				automationLoggedIn = false
				automationActiveUserID = ''
			}, responseAutomationEvidence('logout', 'cleanup-login-status-is-logged-out'))
		}
		unInitSDK('uvue_auto_uninit_final')
		automationCurrentLifecycleEpoch = 0
		recordAutomationStep('cleanup', 'unInitSDK', true, 'final teardown requested')
	}

	async function runAutomationFlow(config : OpenIMAutomationConfig | null) : Promise<void> {
		try {
			applyConfiguredAutomationSuiteFilter(config)
			if (!isAutomationConfigReady(config)) {
				recordAutomationStep('setup', 'readConfig', false, 'Missing openim-test-config storage/static data. Run scripts/register-openim-test-accounts.mjs first.')
			} else {
				const readyConfig = config as OpenIMAutomationConfig
				automationPeerBridgeEnabled = readyConfig.peerBridgeEnabled
				automationPeerBridgeRunNonce = readyConfig.peerBridgeRunNonce
				if (!automationPeerBridgeEnabled || automationPeerBridgeRunNonce.length == 0) {
					throw new Error('Full Public automation requires the independent peer bridge')
				}
				automationExpectedSecondaryUserID = readyConfig.secondaryUserID
				recordAutomationStep('setup', 'readConfig', true, 'api=' + readyConfig.apiAddr + ' ws=' + readyConfig.wsAddr)
				await runAutomationSetupSuite(readyConfig)
				await runAutomationGuardedSuites(readyConfig)
			}
		} catch (error) {
			recordAutomationStep('setup', 'automation runner', false, stringifyAPIValue(error))
		}
	}

	function handleRunAutomation() : Promise<OpenIMAutomationSummary> {
		return new Promise<OpenIMAutomationSummary>((resolve, _reject) => {
			if (automationRunning) {
				recordAutomationStep('setup', 'runner busy', false, 'Automation already running')
				resolve(writeAutomationSummaryFiles(buildAutomationSummary()))
				return
			}
			automationRunning = true
			automationEventSuppressed = true
			resetAutomationCache()
			statusText.value = 'Running public Android/iOS automation'
			const config = readAutomationConfig()
			const chain = runAutomationFlow(config)
			chain.then((_value : void) => {
				runAutomationCleanupBeforeSummary(config).catch((error : any | null) : void => {
					recordAutomationStep('cleanup', 'cleanup runner', false, stringifyAPIValue(error))
				}).then((_cleanupValue : void) => {
					if (automationSuiteFilter.length == 0) {
						runAutomationCoverageSuite()
					}
					const summary = writeAutomationSummaryFiles(buildAutomationSummary())
					statusText.value = summary.headline
					setResult(summary.summaryText)
					automationRunning = false
					automationEventSuppressed = false
					resolve(summary)
				})
			})
		})
	}

	function isAutomationAutorunValue(value : string | null) : boolean {
		return value == '1' || value == 'true' || value == 'yes'
	}

	function scheduleAutomationAutorun() {
		if (automationAutorunScheduled || automationAutorunEvaluated) {
			return
		}
		automationAutorunEvaluated = true
		if (automationAutorunRequested == false) {
			const config = readAutomationConfig()
			if (config != null) {
				automationAutorunRequested = isAutomationAutorunValue((config as OpenIMAutomationConfig).autorun)
			}
		}
		if (automationAutorunRequested == false) {
			return
		}
		automationAutorunScheduled = true
		statusText.value = 'Automation scheduled'
		setTimeout(() => {
			handleRunAutomation()
		}, 500)
	}

	onLoad((options : OnLoadOptions) => {
		const openimAutomation = options["openimAutomation"] ?? ""
		const autorun = options["autorun"] ?? ""
		const suiteFilter = options["suiteFilter"] ?? ""
		if (suiteFilter.length > 0) {
			automationQuerySuiteFilter = suiteFilter.trim()
		}
		automationAutorunRequested = isAutomationAutorunValue(openimAutomation) || isAutomationAutorunValue(autorun)
	})

	onReady(() => {
		scheduleAutomationAutorun()
	})

	setTimeout(() => {
		scheduleAutomationAutorun()
	}, 1000)

	defineExpose({
		handleInitSDKOnly,
		handleLoginOnly,
		handleCreateTextMessage,
		handleCreateQuoteMessageOnly,
		handleCreateAdvancedQuoteMessage,
		handleCreateForwardMessage,
		handleCreateTextAtMessage,
		handleCreateMergerMessage,
		handleSendCachedMessage,
		handleSendCachedMessageNotOss,
		handleInsertSingleMessage,
		handleInsertGroupMessage,
		handleAutomationPeerBridgeReadRequest,
		handleAutomationPeerBridgeWriteResponse,
		handleRunAutomation
	})
</script>

